(52,	'Mayang Court',	'mayang-court',	'',	'Kuala lumpur, Malaysia',	'Sun Loungers, Outdoor dining chair and tables',	'Located on Jalan Mayang is Mayang Court, a posh and high-end \r\ncondominium developed by Bolton Berhard. Around KLCC. ',	1,	9999,	11,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2015-12-02 20:07:15'),
(53,	'Kempinski Hotel & Residences Palm Jumeirah',	'marina-dubai',	'hotels_marina-dubai.pdf',	'Dubai UAE',	'Outdoor Furniture, wicker furniture',	'Dubai Marina',	1,	9999,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:10:47'),
(54,	'Pan Pacific Hotel',	'pan-pacific-hotel',	'hotels_pan-pacific-hotel.pdf',	'Kuala lumpur, Malaysia',	'Outdoor Dining Table and Chair, Bar Tables and Chair, Wicker Furniture',	'Each property provides an invigorating blend of the best that the Pacific has to offer. The service and traditions of the east combine with the creativity and personality of the west to provide refreshing experiences that leave you feeling restored and rejuvenated. ',	1,	9999,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:10:47'),
(55,	'Park Royale Hotel',	'park-royale-hotel',	'hotels_park-royale-hotel.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur Malaysia',	'Sun Loungers',	'Exuding the spirit and individuality of their location, each \r\nPARKROYAL provides a connection to authentic local \r\nexperiences. A trusted provider of hospitality, PARKROYAL leverages a strong heritage that has flourished into a reputable brand in Asia Pacific. ',	1,	16,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:10:47'),
(57,	'Seri Pacific Hotel',	'seri-pacific-hotel',	'hotels_seri-pacific-hotel.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Outdoor Furniture, Outdoor Benches',	'Whether you’re in Malaysia for business, a romantic break, honeymoon or the holiday-of-a-lifetime with the family, the rooms at Seri Pacific Hotel Kuala Lumpur have everything you need for a relaxing and comfortable stay. Known for its legendary warm and friendly hospitality, Seri Pacific Hotel Kuala Lumpur offers exceptional accommodation and impeccable service to make your stay a memorable one.',	1,	14,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:10:47'),
(58,	'Petronas',	'petronas',	'hotels_petronas.pdf',	'Carigali, Malaysia',	'Outdoor Dining Chair and Table, Umbrellas, Wicker Furniture',	'PETRONAS was incorporated on 17 August 1974 as the national oil company of Malaysia, vested with the entire ownership and control of the petroleum resources in the country. It has since grown from merely being the manager and regulator of Malaysia’s upstream sector into a fully integrated oil and gas corporation, ranked among the FORTUNE Global 500® largest corporations in the world. ',	1,	9999,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 21:46:37'),
(59,	'THE DATAI, LANGKAWI',	'the-datai-langkawi',	'hotels_the-datai-langkawi.pdf',	'langkawi, kedah, Malaysia',	'Outdoor Furniture, Umbrellas',	'Teluk Datai is a tribute to nature. Million year old rainforest cascades down to the white sands of Datai beach. There vision is to preserve and enhance the natural environment while creating unique luxury and educational eco-tourism experience.',	1,	4,	10,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:10:47'),
(60,	'Restaurant Anggerik Kuring',	'restaurant-anggerik-kuring',	'restaurants_restaurant-anggerik-kuring.pdf',	'Selangor, Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs, Dining Tables',	'Anggerik Restaurant at Cyberjaya',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
