(62,	'Madfoon Palace',	'madfoon-palace',	'restaurants_madfoon-palace.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur',	'Dining Tables, Restaurant Benches, Dining Chairs, Booth Sofas',	'An Arab restaurant located in Taman Melawati, Kuala Lumpur.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(63,	'Grill House',	'grill-house',	'',	'Kuala Lumpur',	'Dining Chairs, Dining Tables',	'Located at mines resort, Kuala Lumpur',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2015-12-02 20:07:46'),
(64,	'Havana Fish And Chips Bar',	'havana-fish-and-chips-bar',	'restaurants_havana-fish-and-chips-bar.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs, Dining Tables, Bar Chairs',	'For the past two years, the Magnificent Fish &  Chips Bar has stood proudly (and burily) as one of the main attractions on Changkat Bukit Bintang. The Magnificent Fish & Chips Bar was specially commended in the Best Seafood Restaurant category of the Time Out KL Food Awards 2009. the restaurant required furniture that would anhance their theme of a laid back cuban style restaurant and we did just what was required by customising the finishing of our havana chair the upholstery of our serene bar chair.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(67,	'HOMST',	'homst',	'restaurants_homst.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Tables, Dining Chairs, Baby Chairs',	'Grown to 7 outlets, HOMST is known for its friendly service and wonderful food. HOMST has in fact established as a destination for friends and family and have committed to grow providing confident halal chinese cuisine most of their restaurant are furnished using Horestco furniture.',	1,	21,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(68,	'I BIZA CLUB KL',	'i-biza-club-kl',	'restaurants_i-biza-club-kl.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Dining Furniture, Bar Chairs, Bar Tables, Wicker Furniture',	'Ibiza KL is the latest entertainment hub located at Jalan \r\nBerangan, Changkat Kuala Lumpur, opening its door to party people on 30th January 2013. Ibiza KL consists of astonishing interior design concepts never seen before in Malaysia. Party-goers will be able to party up their night, chillout on comfortable VIP seat while playing the PlayStation 3 console.',	1,	21,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(69,	'JAGUAR SUPPER CLUB',	'jaguar-supper-club',	'restaurants_jaguar-supper-club.pdf',	'Petaling Jaya, Malaysia',	'Bar Chairs and Tables, Dining Chairs and Tables',	'Jaguar Supper Club is located at 14 Jalan Yong Shook Lin, Pj New Town, Petaling Jaya. ',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(70,	'JOE\'S KITCHEN',	'joes-kitchen',	'restaurants_joes-kitchen.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Tables, Dining Chairs',	'Joe\'s Kitchen, owned by Joe Flizzow, one \r\nof the well known celebrity in Malaysia. Joe’s Kitchen is located at  SS 15 Subang Jaya. ',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(71,	'Kyo Chon',	'kyo-chon',	'restaurants_kyo-chon.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Tables, Dining Chairs, Bar Tables, Bar Chairs',	'Part of Kyo Chon restaurant group, that has restaurant from south korea to newyork. consistently noted as the best fried chicken in south korea, it is leading brand in south korea food service industry. quality is of utmost importance, be in the selection of ingredients or in the selection of interior furniture.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(72,	'Midi 57',	'midi-57',	'restaurants_midi-57.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Bar Furniture, Indoor and Outdoor Dining Furniture, Ratan Furniture',	'Midi 57, a friendly and relaxed Italian restaurant serving \r\nauthentic traditional wood oven pizza and homemade pastas. Midi 57 has a more casual setting that would be a great hang out place for families and friends to chill out & dine indoor or even opt for alfresco dining. ',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(73,	'Naab',	'naab',	'restaurants_naab.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs, Menu Holders',	'Naab is one of the well known Iranian restaurant in the heart of the tourist centre and golden triangle of Kuala Lumpur. This company has been active in food industry for more than 10 years and started its first Iranian restaurant in Ampang area. In its next prospects it planned a Dining Center wholly Iranian in style. we custom made their furniture to fit their theme. The chairs are upholstered with handmade fabric sourced by the client from Iran.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(74,	'NESTRETTO',	'nestretto',	'restaurants_nestretto.pdf',	'Kemaman, Terengganu, Malaysia',	'Wicker Furniture, Dining Chairs, Dining Tables, Bar Furniture',	'A coffee shop in Kemaman, Terengganu, Malaysia that serves great gourmet coffee. Nestretto required furniture that suited their coffee shop theme.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:38'),
(75,	'NYONYA',	'nyonya',	'restaurants_nyonya.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs, Bar Chairs',	'In 2010 Little Singapore Restaurant Group was recognised Restaurant & Catering Queensland as the winner of the prestigious ‘Best Asian Restaurant (Malaysian)’. Little Nyonya, Little Singapore Restaurant group has grown from a single restaurant in Sunnybank in 2005 to five impressive locations across Brisbane in 2011.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(76,	'Red Onions',	'red-onions',	'restaurants_red-onions.pdf',	'Bangsar, Kuala Lumpur.',	'Bar Chairs, Bar Tables',	'Red Onion Restaurant @ Bangsar, Kuala Lumpur. Located in Jalan Telawi, Bangsar Red Onion Restaurant serves Pakistani and Middle Eastern cuisine. In Red Onion the chefs experiment with new recepies that delisht their customers.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(77,	'RILS BANGSAR',	'rils-bangsar',	'restaurants_rils-bangsar.pdf',	'Jalan Telawi, Bangsar, Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs and Tables, Bar Chairs',	'Ril’s Bangsar at Bangsar Baru. Located in Jalan Telawi, Bangsar is this spacious and elegant restaurant open for both brunch, lunch and dinner offering the classic, delicious fine dining in or outside, in an comfortable, cool and breezy seating area.\r\n\r\n',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(78,	'RONNIE Q',	'ronnie-q',	'restaurants_ronnie-q.pdf',	'Bangsar Malaysia',	'Bar Chairs, Bar Tables',	'Ronie Q is a local pub in Bangsar that is the place to hangout during all the top sporting events from the AFL, EPL, Cricket, Rugby, among others.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(79,	'ROULLETTE',	'roullette',	'restaurants_roullette.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Chairs and Tables, Bar Chairs and Tables, Wicker Furniture',	'Housed in a spectacularly – decorated building spreading across 2 levels and 8400 square feet. The Roulette Restaurant Bar, haseasy access to Kesas highway and Ambang botanic garden housing development. It has amazing looks with over 350 of seating capacity with the ability to morph into a dining venue, special event destination or a club.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(80,	'SAKURA KRISTAL ALAM',	'sakura-kristal-alam',	'restaurants_sakura-kristal-alam.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Dining Tables, Dining Cahairs, Wicker furniture',	'Part of the sakura chain of restaurant, Sakura Kristal, it serves local, asian and western cuisine in a fine dining setting.',	1,	9999,	9,	'0000-00-00 00:00:00',	'2016-03-25 22:04:39'),
(84,	'THE OCEAN RESIDENCE',	'new-client',	'hotels_the-ocean-residence_v538.pdf',	'Langkawi, Kedah, Malaysia',	'Hawaii Chair, Hawaii Table, Trinity chair, Bahamas Table, Tiara Sunlounger, Commercial 250 Umbrella, Venice Table, Accura Table',	'A family-run property, The Ocean Residence Langkawi is a boutique hotel that is all about making its guests feel at home. The ocean front villas have been built with Malaysian Kampong style in mind to promote traditional ways of living on the island. The resort grounds boast one of the finest selections of pools on the entire island!. The Ocean Residence required furniture made of natural tropical materials that could enhance the guest\'s experience and go well with their theme. ',	1,	9999,	10,	'2015-12-08 21:06:25',	'2019-04-05 14:47:29'),
(86,	'Cibiuk Restaurant',	'cibiuk-restaurant',	'restaurants_cibiuk-restaurant_v580.pdf',	'Shah Alam, Malaysia',	'dining table, dining chairs, low tables, baby chairs',	'Cibiuk Restaurant is known for its high quality Sundanese cuisine, one of the most popular cuisine in Indonesia, at reasonable price. Cibiuk opened its 3rd branch in Shah Alam in March 2016. They were looking for quality furniture at reasonable price.  ',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-10 15:04:01',	'2019-05-20 22:01:27'),
(87,	'My Dutchies',	'my-dutchies',	'restaurants_my-dutchies_v193.pdf',	'Ara Damansara, Petaling Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia',	'Tiara Bar Chair, Bahamas Bar Table, Concorde Chair, Bahamas Dining Table, Bahamas Round Table',	'My-Dutchies is a healthy food that is determined to bring you tasty yet nutritious delights. At Dutchies, only the finest cuts of meats and the best Dutch cheese are used to create a luscious and sensational sandwich that will not only make your taste buds happy, but also your body. And while sandwiches are their forte, they are also proud of their salads and side that are fit for royalty.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-11 14:43:24',	'2016-05-19 17:38:13'),
(88,	'Elegant Inn Restaurant',	'elegant-inn-restaurant',	'restaurants_elegant-inn-restaurant_v571.pdf',	'P Ramlee, Kuala Lumpur',	'Maldives Sofa, Maldives Coffee Table',	'This refined restaurant sits in a tranquil corner on the second floor of Menara Hap Seng in the heart of Kuala Lumpur. Elegant Inn started out as a modest 40-seater restaurant in a street tucked away in a small corner of Cheras. Known for refined Cantonese cuisine, Elegant Inn has been luring the city’s prominent, powerful, titled and moneyed to its Taman Connaug.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-11 15:30:49',	'2016-05-19 17:35:24'),
(89,	'Segamat Rel Cafe',	'segamat-rel-cafe',	'restaurants_segamat-rel-cafe_v507.pdf',	'Shah Alam, Malaysia',	'Sakura Chair, Trinity Chair, Publika Dining table',	'Whenever you\'re feeling of having the authentic taste of Malay food (especially Johorean food), do head over to Segamat Rel Cafe at Shah Alam. The owner\'s personal collection of antiques are truly amazing and fascinating.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-12 14:22:54',	'2016-05-19 17:44:52'),
(90,	'Homst Recipe',	'homst-recipe',	'',	'Putrajaya, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Valencia Chair',	'Grown to 7 outlets, HOMST is known for its friendly service and wonderful food. HOMST has in fact established as a destination for friends and family and have committed to grow providing confident halal chinese cuisine most of their restaurant are furnished using Horestco furniture.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-12 14:57:30',	'2016-05-12 14:57:30'),
(91,	'Sam\'s Restaurant',	'sams-restaurant',	'restaurants_sams-restaurant_v477.pdf',	'Plaza Damansara, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Outdoor and Indoor furniture, Dining Chairs and Dining Tables, Bar Chairs',	'Sam\'s is a friendly place where succulent food along with great drinks allows for enjoyable moments to be had by all. The mood is laidback, the music nostalgic, the service impeccable and the food hard day\'s work.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-12 17:24:05',	'2016-05-12 23:32:51'),
(92,	'Sam\'s @ Batai Restaurant',	'sams-batai-restaurant',	'restaurants_sams-batai-restaurant_v838.pdf',	'Plaza Batai, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Outdoor and Indoor furniture, Dining Chairs and Dining Tables, Bar Chairs',	'Sam\'s is a friendly place where succulent food along with great drinks allows for enjoyable moments to be had by all. \r\nThe mood is laidback, the music nostalgic, the service impeccable and the food hard day\'s work.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2016-05-12 17:39:02',	'2016-05-12 23:33:54'),
(93,	'Max Tien',	'max-tien',	'residential_max-tien_v642.pdf',	'Malaysia',	'Havana Chair, Koorg Bedside Table, Custom Made Wadrobe, Koorg Console, Custom Made Dining, Table Bench',	'One of the residential apartment furnished by us. Made of teak, the \r\nfurniture gives an elegant look to your apartment and enhances the \r\nbeauty of your living.',	1,	9999,	23,	'2016-05-19 21:19:32',	'2016-05-20 00:00:53'),
(94,	'Westin',	'westin',	'hotels_westin_v194.pdf',	'Kualalumpur, Malaysia',	'Sunlounger / deck pool chairs, Luxurious sunbrella cushion umbrellas of various sizes and designs, Pool chairs and tables',	'The Westin Kualalumpur is a five star hotel located on the Vibrant streets of Jolam Bukit Bintang, while assuring its guest a luxurious stay, the required hotel aroubustic yet stylish, confortable yet elegant furniture.',	1,	9999,	10,	'2016-05-28 14:58:22',	'2019-05-27 21:47:32'),
(95,	'Wood Stock Villas',	'wood-stock-villa-coorg',	'',	'Coorg, Karnataka, INDIA',	'Outdoor Furniture, Indoor Furniture, Bedroom Furniture, Living Room Furniture ',	'Woodstock Villas is situated about 3.5 km from a popular hill station retreat in South India. The ideal location of the resort amidst the lush green beauty of nature, makes it one of the best places to stay in Western Ghats. The owners wanted to maintain a raw and natural feel to the resort. And at the same time, furniture that is affordable, durable and easy to maintain in the tropical environment. They were delighted to have the resort furnished in solid teak wood furniture made in our manufacturing facility in Indonesia. Handcrafted by expert craftsmen. the design is kept simple yet elegant to provide best comfort to the resort guests.',	1,	999,	10,	'2016-12-07 23:19:45',	'2016-12-07 23:19:45'),
(103,	'LE PIRATE RESTAURANT',	'le-pirate-restaurant',	'le-pirate-restaurant.pdf',	'Dubai Marina, United Arab Emirates',	'Custom Dining Chairs, Custom dining tables, Outdoor Umbrellas, Carribean Sofa, Marina Sofa',	'This place is about seafood and pirates, two things Emiraties are passionate about. They promise and experience to remember starting with the minute their customers step inside.\r\nTo live up-to that promise, they required furniture that was custom built to their theme and of the highest craftsmanship. After visiting many woodworking factories who didn\'t have the capacity/capability to produce the furniture, the owner found us and we gave it a shot. The resulting furniture is for anyone to see, use and judge at the restaurant.  ',	1,	9999,	9,	'2017-05-19 21:22:17',	'2017-05-19 21:22:17'),
(104,	'Tanjung Jara Resort',	'tanjung-jara-resort',	'hotels_tanjung-jara-resort_v399.pdf',	'Terengganu, Malaysia',	'Outdoor, Furniture, Outdoor Chairs, Outdoor Sofa, Sun Loungers',	'This place is about seafood and pirates, two things Emiraties are passionate about. They promise and experience to remember starting with the minute their customers step inside.\r\nTo live up-to that promise, they required furniture that was custom built to their theme and of the highest craftsmanship. After visiting many woodworking factories who didn\'t have the capacity/capability to produce the furniture, the owner found us and we gave it a shot. The resulting furniture is for anyone to see, use and judge at the restaurant.  ',	1,	9999,	10,	'2017-08-21 21:01:15',	'2017-08-22 17:49:42'),
(105,	'ROCKWALL GRILL & BISTRO',	'ts',	'restaurants_rockwall-grill-bistro_v906.pdf',	'Petaling Jaya, Selangor',	'Healy Barrel, Trinity Bar Chair, Concorde Chair, Dome Bar Chair',	'Rockwall Grill & Bistro aims to provide its discerning clients a delicious western dining experience. They are passionate about good food and attentive service. They required furniture that reflected those values.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2017-10-03 17:12:02',	'2019-04-08 22:38:00'),
(106,	'i-SOHO',	'i-soho',	'',	'iCity, Selangor, Malaysia',	'Hawaii Round Table, Panama Arm Chair, XL Lounger, XL Sun Lounger Cushion.',	'i-SOHO is an meant to be an  abode for trendy individuals that opt for a work-life culture surrounding cosmopolitan style. The exquisite development is constructed with unique architectures giving a sinuous depiction on the tower blocks. The astonishing facade is inspired by the integration of sky, water and greenery elements.',	1,	9999,	11,	'2017-10-09 21:23:55',	'2017-10-09 21:23:55'),
(107,	'CROWN REGENCY',	'crown-regency',	'hotels_crown-regency_v476.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Kashmir sofas, Cushions, Paris Executive chairs',	'Every suite in Crown Regency Serviced Suites Kuala Lumpur is equipped with full amenities. The  serviced apartment is tastefully furnished with contemporary furniture and fittings, coziness and warmth exude from each suite. It is ideal for both short term and long term accommodation. The management makes it a point that the furnishings are regularly upgraded and Horestco is a preferred supplier. ',	1,	9999,	10,	'2017-10-11 14:39:21',	'2017-10-11 17:00:23'),
(108,	'DE\'BARCINO Bar and Restaurant',	'debarcino-bar-and-restaurant',	'restaurants_debarcino-bar-and-restaurant_v571.pdf',	'Desa Sri Hartamas, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Healy Barrel, Dome Bar Chair, Vintage Bar Chair, Trinity Side Chair',	'A cozy place for hanging out after work within the Hartamas vicinity, the fine dining capital of Malaysia. The interior has an  inviting and relaxing theme. ',	1,	9999,	9,	'2017-10-16 15:43:41',	'2017-10-16 17:03:18'),
(109,	'TEPPANYAKI KITCHEN',	'teppanyaki-kitchen',	'',	'Taman Danau Dota, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Panama Arm Chair, Custom Table',	'Kitchen Teppanyaki is a Japanese Food Restaurant located at KL Festival City Mall in Kuala Lumpur. \r\nGood ambiance. Great value for money. Menu choices are not wide but adequate. Food is cooked in front of your eyes and served very quickly.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2017-10-21 16:09:19',	'2017-10-21 16:09:19'),
(110,	'SIDE WALK CAFE',	'side-walk-cafe',	'restaurants_side-walk-cafe_v176.pdf',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Panama Arm Chair, Hawaii Sofa, Mauritius Sofa (Wicker) , Bahamas Dining Table',	'A sidewalk cafe that serves great food. It required furniture in vibrant and attractive colors. And Horestco was chosen as their supplier for our multitude of options for personalisation of  colors and finishes.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2017-11-02 20:57:32',	'2017-11-02 22:01:11'),
(111,	'TRAVELLERS BISTRO & PUB',	'travellers-pub-and-lounge',	'restaurants_travellers-bistro-pub_v511.pdf',	'Cameron Highlands, Pahang, Malaysia',	'Vintage Bar Chair, Bahamas Bar Chair, Windsor sofa, Publika Table',	'Located in the heart of Cameroon Highlands, Malaysia. It\'s cozy environment inside attracts customers from all ages and all walks of life who like to come here just to hang out, have a drink and have a blast.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2018-04-04 13:45:49',	'2018-04-27 21:39:03'),
(112,	'CAMEROON HIGHLAND RESORT',	'cameroon-highland-resort',	'hotels_cameroon-highland-resort_v311.pdf',	'Cameroon Highlands, Pahang, Malaysia',	'Outdoor Chairs',	'Set 1,500 metres above sea level in a forested mountainscape, Cameron Highlands Resort is built as a long extension from an existing 1930s cottage with architecture dating from the 1070s. Promising splendour, romance and nostalgia, the interiors hark back to its grand colonial heritage with tall French doors, timber-beamed ceilings and plantation shutters combined with the colours and textures of Jim Thompson’s famed Asian silks. Each room features an elegant colonial design that is spacious and comfortable. \r\nAll rooms and suites enjoy a beautiful view of the golf course against a backdrop of rolling hills and lush green forest. Horestco\'s outdoor chairs adorn the balconies of the rooms. \r\n',	1,	9999,	10,	'2018-04-06 19:24:25',	'2018-04-06 23:03:14'),
(113,	'THE SAFFRON RESTAURANT',	'the-saffron-restaurant',	'restaurants_the-saffron-restaurant_v772.pdf',	'Bukit Bintang, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Grenada Bar Chair, Concorde Chair, Custom Table',	'Family owned and operated, serving authentic Indian dishes. This restaurant has managed to build a group of loyal customers, in an area with plenty of food and beverage outlets. The interiors are themed to be homely and cozy. ',	1,	9999,	9,	'2018-04-27 19:22:04',	'2019-05-21 20:38:32'),
(114,	'Grapeskin',	'buena-brasa',	'',	'Dubai UAE',	'\"Indoor dining tables and chairs\", \"Outdoor Dining Furniture\"',	'  Grapeskin is a fun and trendy neighbourhood grape bar and kitchen where an inviting laid back approach invites guests to choose from cool food sharing platters paired with eclectic grape and beverages to suit their mood. A bright open space with industrial furnishings, Grapeskin is a new social hangout, nestled within the courtyard at La Ville Hotel & Suites CITY WALK Dubai, perfect for relaxing after work or catching up with friends. ',	1,	9,	9,	'2020-08-08 20:21:35',	'2020-08-08 20:21:35'),
(115,	'Buena Brasa',	'buena-brasa',	'',	'Bangsar South Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Interior wood and metal works, Leather sofa, Banquet sofa, dining table, Dining chairs , Bar chairs, bar tables, Outdoor engineered stone tables, Wall Mirrors and storage racks',	'Buena Brasa Gastro Pub” is a newly founded Spanish restaurant located in Kuala Lumpur, specialize in casual dining with the goal of introducing guests to the distinctive taste of the Spanish national cuisine. In addition to the incredible food, a key part of the gastronomical experience is the modern, yet cozy and welcoming interior which required a blend of distinctive materials used in the furniture and decor.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2020-08-08 20:24:30',	'2020-08-08 20:24:30'),
(116,	'Three stooges ',	'three-stooges',	'',	'Damansara Uptown ',	'Bar Stools, bar chairs, Dining chairs, Dining Tables, Barrels, wall panels',	'A central meeting for families, couples and business alike, Three Stooges provides a friendly and hippy place for happy hour, dinner and supper. An exciting place with a happy and friendly staff to cheer you up. From the first outlet at Sunway till the fifth outlet at Cheras, they demand a quality furniture at a reasonable price with a short lead time and that is what Horestco Emphasis on the most: Quality product with the quality service, affordable and shortest lead time. ',	0,	9999,	9,	'2020-09-20 20:54:56',	'2020-09-20 20:54:56'),
(118,	'Gardenview Residence',	'gardenview-residence',	'',	'Cyberjaya, Malaysia',	'\"Tiara Round Table, Florence Folding Chair, Commercial 300 Umbrella\"',	'An International Resort Living in Cyberjaya.Gardenview Residence brings a brand new style of living in the heart of Cyberjaya â€“ Silicon Valley of Malaysia. Gardenview Residence is an exclusive residential enclave offering luxurious apartment suites designed for those with discerning preference. It is set within a prestigious neighbourhood and an expanding expatriate community.',	1,	300,	11,	'2022-11-23 21:03:55',	'2022-11-23 21:03:55'),
(121,	'MENARA BOUSTED',	'menara-bousted',	'',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'\"Hawaii Sofa, Hawaii Ottoman, Hawaii Chair\"',	'Menara Boustead is located at the 69 Jalan Raja Chulan, Kuala Lumpur. It is a thirty-two-storey office tower connected by an overhead bridge to a twelve-storey car parking annex. They required quality outdoor sofas for an ourdoor seating area.',	1,	9999,	11,	'2022-11-23 21:40:00',	'2022-11-23 21:40:00'),
(122,	'Putra Residence',	'putra-residence',	'',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'Hanging nest',	'',	1,	123,	11,	'2022-11-23 22:42:27',	'2022-11-23 22:42:27'),
(123,	'Danau Permai',	'danau-permai',	'',	'Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'\"Madrid Lounger, Commercial 300 Umbrella\"',	'Danau Permai is located in Taman Desa, which is always a choice location for both locals and expatriates alike. It is close to the Danau Business Centre neighborhood and just a short distance away from Faber Heights.\r\nIt provides an excellent internal layout with an extra store room, laminated wood flooring in the bedrooms, beautiful landscaping, sprawling gardens, lush greenery, soothing water features and also inclusive of a very well-furnished and maintained surroundings.',	1,	400,	11,	'2022-11-23 23:15:48',	'2022-11-23 23:15:48'),
(124,	'Z HOTEL',	'z-hotel',	'',	'Ipoh, Perak, Malaysia',	'\"Bahamas Bar Chair, Mauritius Sofa, Custom Chair, Custom Table\"',	'A small luxury hotel strategically located at the heart of Ipoh town that that opened in January 2016. Z hotel provides five star accommodation experience with a touch of contemporary in every room. \r\nKnown among the locals for its  lobby cafe that serves 24 hours artisan coffee and pastries.',	1,	999,	10,	'2022-11-24 00:11:05',	'2022-11-24 00:11:05'),
(135,	'Socotra Corner',	'socotra-corner',	NULL,	'Nilai, Negeri Sembilan, Malaysia',	'\"Mehfil Side Chair\",\" Bali Dining Chair\",\" Bahamas Dining Table\",\" Custom Grenada double Booth\"',	'Named after Socotra Island, a UNESCO recognised world heritage site. Authentic Arabian cuisine. Great indoor as well as outdoor dining areas. Caters to a young and hip crowd.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2023-01-12 00:01:24',	'2023-01-12 00:01:24'),
(141,	'BIG CUP CAFE',	'big-cup-cafe',	NULL,	'MANGLORE INDIA',	'\"Dining tables and chairs\", \"Umbrellas\"',	'Big Cup was born out of the passion of planter families based in Coorg, Karnataka the coffee hub of India.Located in Coorg region in the southern Indian state of Karnataka, the coffee served at Big Cup is sourced from the estates owned and managed by the Sandalkad, and Thaikappa Families.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2023-01-13 03:18:18',	'2023-01-13 03:18:18'),
(142,	'Dima Restaurant',	'dima-restaurant',	NULL,	'Petaling Jaya, Malaysia',	'\"Sakura Chair\", \"Ritz Dining Table\" ,\"Panama Arm Chair\", \"Panama Table\"',	'Dima Restaurant offers the most authentic Arabic and Middle Eastern cuisine to food lovers not just in Malaysia but also throughout the World. Dima Restaurant are offering not only tasty but also healthy food to all customers with extra comfort and leisure.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2023-01-13 03:48:19',	'2023-01-13 03:48:19'),
(143,	'Tar Boosh',	'tar-boosh',	NULL,	' Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia',	'\"Grenada Booth\", \"Concorde Chair\", \"Ritz Dining Table\",\" Publika Dining Table\"',	'Located in the lobby of City Sentral Hotel on the busy thoroughfare of KL Sentral. The restaurant required furniture that reflected their theme of Contemporary Arabian setting, that is also practical and cost efficient at the same time.',	1,	9999,	9,	'2023-01-13 23:15:10',	'2023-01-13 23:15:10');
