(667,	'MISORE DINING TABLE D100',	'HRS314-NAT-D100',	NULL,	'Misore tables are among our most popular dining tables - both for individual clients as well as fine dining restaurants. \r\nMasterfully crafted out of solid teak wood - it can be knocked down easily. \r\nBlends well with a variety of chairs.',	'Standard Height : 78cm \r\n\r\nROUND TABLES \r\nDiameter : 70cm - 2 seater\r\nDiameter : 100cm - 4 seater\r\nDiameter : 130cm - 6 seater\r\nDiameter : 150cm - 8 seater\r\nDiameter : 170cm - 10 seater\r\n\r\nSQUARE TABLES :\r\nSide : 150cm X 150cm - 8 Seater',	'dining-furniture-misore-dining-table-667_v807.pdf',	NULL,	9999,	'HDC31,CT31T,ST31',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2021-12-17 18:01:58'),
(668,	'BAHAMAS ROUND TABLETOP D60',	'HDS32-TB-D60',	NULL,	'The Bahamas dining table is a popular choice for restaurants due to its stylish design and functional features. It is known for its easy mobility, making it convenient for restaurant staff to move it around as needed.\r\n\r\nThe table is crafted from high-quality Solid Teak wood, which is highly valued for its durability and natural beauty. Teak wood is resistant to rotting, warping, and pests, making it ideal for furniture that will be exposed to varying weather conditions or heavy use.\r\n\r\nThe dining table features a round powder-coated base made from mild steel, which provides stability and support. The powder coating adds a layer of protection against scratches and rust, ensuring the table remains in excellent condition even with frequent use.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of solid teak wood and a sturdy base, the Bahamas dining table offers a reliable and long-lasting solution for restaurant seating. Its elegant design and versatile features make it a popular choice for establishments looking to create a welcoming and stylish dining environment',	'Standard Height : 78cm\r\nStandard Diameter 80cm, 70cm, 60cm. \r\nAlso available in custom make sizes',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'HDS21,BRL88,HRS31',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-05-30 22:50:11'),
(670,	'RIMBA SQUARE UMBRELLA',	'HPU85',	NULL,	'Rimba Umbrella is a result of a joint product development idea with a well known and sought after designing firm from Singapore. The umbrella uses a tilt mechanism with stainless steel fittings including base in antique finishing and premium teak wood frame.',	'270cmx270cm with pole length 250cm.',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'',	'0',	0,	0,	41,	70,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2021-09-29 16:03:13'),
