(679,	'GEORGIAN ARM CHAIR',	'HDC51-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Trinity chair is a multipurpose chair. The structure and the design allows it to be wrapped with different materials to be used at different places. fabric and leather upholstered can be used as dining and lounge chair while upholstered with  Synthetic and natural rattan can be used as outdoor dining and Cafe chair.',	'Depth: 52cm\r\nWidth: 66cm\r\nHeight: 86cm\r\nSeat Height: 47cm',	'dining-furniture-trinity-chair-679_v187.pdf',	'',	210,	'HDS28,HDS33',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2022-12-10 22:35:04'),
(681,	'MONACO SUN LOUNGER',	'OSL98-SR-STD',	NULL,	'Made to withstand the tough weather outdoors. \r\nThe commercial grade 304 stainless steel also makes it resistant to chlorine water at swimming pools.\r\nThe hairline finishing on the stainless steel frame makes it easy to maintain. \r\nElegantly handwoven synthetic wicker that resists mildew, UV light, and colorfastness. \r\nTo enhance the comfort and longevity of the lounger, we recommend adding a cushion made from Sunroof or Sunbrella fabrics. Available in a variety of colors.',	'Length 200cm\r\nWidth 60cm\r\nHeight 35cm',	'',	'',	9999,	'OSL91,HOD105,ST03',	'1',	0,	0,	41,	67,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2023-01-05 17:48:58'),
(682,	'BAHAMAS DINING TABLE S60',	'HDS342-AM1-S60',	NULL,	'The Bahamas dining table is a popular choice for restaurants due to its stylish design and functional features. It is known for its easy mobility, making it convenient for restaurant staff to move it around as needed.\r\n\r\nThe table is crafted from high-quality Solid Teak wood, which is highly valued for its durability and natural beauty. Teak wood is resistant to rotting, warping, and pests, making it ideal for furniture that will be exposed to varying weather conditions or heavy use.\r\n\r\nThe dining table features a round powder-coated base made from mild steel, which provides stability and support. The powder coating adds a layer of protection against scratches and rust, ensuring the table remains in excellent condition even with frequent use.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of solid teak wood and a sturdy base, the Bahamas dining table offers a reliable and long-lasting solution for restaurant seating. Its elegant design and versatile features make it a popular choice for establishments looking to create a welcoming and stylish dining environment.',	'Standard Height : 78cm\r\nSquare Tables : \r\nSide : 60cm X 60cm - 2 seater\r\nSide : 70cm X 70cm - 2 seater\r\nSide : 80cm X 80cm - 4 seater\r\nSide : 90cm X 90cm - 4 seater\r\n\r\nRectangle Tables : \r\nLength 120cm X Width 90cm - 6 seater (with 2 bases)',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'HDS23,HDS28,HDS36',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-05-30 22:43:27'),
(683,	'PUBLIKA DINING TABLETOP S60',	'PUB-DT-S60',	NULL,	'Made of High-pressure laminate (HPL) over hardwood plywood with matching HPL or PVC edging.\r\nVery popular with restaurants and Cafes for their low cost and easy maintenance.\r\nIt comes in various custom-made sizes and a variety of colors.',	'Standard Height : 78cm\r\nSquare Tables : \r\nSide : 60cm X 60cm - 2 seater\r\nSide : 70cm X 70cm - 2 seater\r\nSide : 80cm X 80cm - 4 seater\r\nSide : 90cm X 90cm - 4 seater\r\n\r\nRectangle Tables : \r\nLength 120cm X Width 90cm - 6 seater (with 2 bases)',	'dining-furniture-publika-dining-table-s60-683_v930.pdf',	NULL,	10,	'HDS34',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-05-30 22:41:41'),
