(695,	'BAHAMAS ROUND BAR TABLE D60',	'BRT39-TB-D60',	NULL,	'The Bahamas Bar table is a stylish and high-quality piece of furniture designed for use in bars, restaurants, or even at home. It is constructed using premium teak wood, known for its durability and resistance to weather elements, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nThe table features a mild steel base, which provides stability and support. The combination of teak wood and mild steel creates a visually appealing contrast, giving the table a modern and sophisticated look.\r\n\r\nOne of the notable features of the Bahamas Bar table is its versatility in terms of dimensions and colors. It comes in a variety of sizes to accommodate different spaces and requirements. Whether you need a compact table for a cozy corner or a larger one for a spacious bar area, you can find a suitable option.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the table is available in various colors, allowing you to choose the one that best matches your interior or personal style. Whether you prefer a classic natural teak finish, a rich dark stain, or even a vibrant painted color, the Bahamas Bar table offers customization options to suit your taste.',	'Standard Height : 110cm\r\n1. Top Diameter : 60cm - 2 seater\r\n2. Top Diameter : 70cm - 2/4 seater\r\n3. Top Diameter : 80cm - 4 seater',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'HBC01,HDS32,HBC23',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2023-12-09 03:40:49'),
(696,	'ACCURA ROUND BAR TABLE D60',	'BRT40-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Material: Solid Teak Wood Top and Stainless Steel #304 Base Our Accura Collection furniture combines the timeless beauty of Teak Wood with the strength and resiliency of Stainless Steel to produce stunning designs and high performance furniture. Perfect for heavy duty outdoor use in a residential or a commercial setting. Highly durable, long lasting and low maintenance. The top is made of Grade A Kiln dried Plantation grown Teak wood while the base is made of 8mm thick corrosion resistant stainless steel grade 304 plate. The thick stainless steel base plate ensures stability.',	'Standard Height : 110cm\r\n1. Top Diameter : 60cm - 2 seater\r\n2. Top Diameter : 70cm - 2/4 seater\r\n3. Top Diameter : 80cm - 4 seater',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'BRT39,HBC19,HBC24',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2022-04-12 17:27:20'),
(697,	'HEALY BARREL TABLE D70',	'BRL81-TB',	NULL,	'Traditional barrels in a new look! \r\nThe barrel can be fitted with a variety of tabletop sizes. \r\nEach barrel is handmade and unique. \r\n',	'Standard Height : 110cm\r\n1. Top Diameter : 70cm - 2 seater\r\n2. Top Diameter : 80cm - 4 seater\r\n2. Top Diameter : 90cm - 4 seater',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'HBC01,HBC02,RB212',	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2021-12-13 21:43:47'),
