(797,	'MARINA SOFA',	'MS66',	NULL,	'Crafted by master craftsmen using time-tested boat building construction methods. \r\nMade from Genuine Teak Wood. \r\nPerformance outdoor fabrics available for upholstery.\r\nOval shaped centre table. \r\nThe price is inclusive of cushion made with olefin sunproof HDF. For sunbrella and other fabric brands , please contact us.',	'External Dimensions :\r\nLength : 240cm\r\nWidth : 220cm \r\n',	'',	NULL,	9999,	'MS55,XL1',	'0',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-06-03 21:01:31'),
(798,	'TIARA BOOKSHELF',	'BS73-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Tiara’s bookshelf is a splendid piece of furniture crafted from timeless and luxurious teak wood. This exquisitely designed bookshelf seamlessly marries functionality with aesthetics, making it a standout addition to any home or office space. The warm, honey-toned hue of the teak wood brings a touch of natural elegance to the room, creating an inviting and cozy atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe bookshelf boasts a sturdy construction, showcasing the inherent durability and strength of teak wood. The carefully chosen teak not only adds a touch of sophistication but also ensures longevity, making it an investment that withstands the test of time. The natural grains and textures of the wood create a visually stunning display, with each shelf telling its own unique story.\r\n\r\nWith its thoughtfully arranged compartments and shelves, Tiara’s bookshelf offers ample space for a diverse collection of books, cherished mementos, and decorative items. The design is both practical and stylish, providing a harmonious blend of form and function. The smooth, polished surface of the teak wood enhances its tactile appeal, inviting touch and interaction.\r\n\r\nWhether placed in a cozy reading nook, a study, or a living room, Tiara’s teak wood bookshelf becomes a focal point that elevates the entire space. It serves as more than just a storage solution; it’s a testament to Tiara’s refined taste and appreciation for quality craftsmanship. This bookshelf is a tribute to the timeless beauty of teak wood, offering not just a place to organize literary treasures but also an aesthetic statement that enriches the surroundings.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nL 60 x W 40 x H 171 CM',	'',	'',	'',	9999,	'HRC301,BD1007,HTC34,CT22T,EC101',	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-06-01 23:10:09'),
