(872,	'KOORG SOFA 2 SEATER',	'LC43-000-STD',	NULL,	'Koorg sofa is made of premium teak wood with custom fabric and leather option available to match your decor. While maintaining great looking appeal, Koorg sofa is design to meet comfort through a simple and minimalistic approach.\r\n\r\nThe price is inclusive of cushion made with olefin sunproof HDF. For sunbrella and other fabric brands , please contact us.',	'Seating Dimensions: (CM)\r\n\r\n3seater: 195W X 65D \r\n2seater: 130W X 65D\r\n1seater: 65W X 65D',	'',	'',	3,	'HRC226,KSS53',	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2024-02-05 21:01:02'),
