(891,	'CONCORDE LOUNGE CHAIR',	'CLC01-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Crafted almost entirely by hand using natural materials, contemporary in spirit but reassuring and satisfying as only the natural and handmade can be. \r\nConcorde Lounge Chair is simple, comfortable and durable. It is made of high quality Teak Wood. The curved backrest and armrest makes for a comfortable seating. Also available in variety of furnishes.\r\n\r\nThe prices is included with cushion and Sunproof fabric.',	'Height : 78cm\r\nWidth : 69cm\r\nDepth : 65cm\r\nSeating Height : 30cm',	'',	'',	9999,	'EL98,ALC36',	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2015-12-05 13:30:42',	'2021-09-29 06:05:53'),
