(981,	'EIFFEL BAR CHAIR',	'EC102-BL-STD',	NULL,	'The combination of stainless steel frames and open-mesh sling fabric results in exceptional comfort, aesthetics, and functionality. With Ferrari Batyline, we only use the highest quality grade 304 stainless steel. Fabric slings are known for their comfort, which is one of their biggest benefits. When stretched between two side frames, the sling provides a seating surface that molds your individual body shape. Aside from being exceptionally resistant to fading, mildew, and wear & tear, Ferrari Batyline is also exceptionally durable.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2016-07-01 20:30:54',	'2022-11-23 17:31:08'),
