(986,	'WINDSOR DINING CHAIR',	'WS03-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Windsor DINING CHAIR is a beautifully crafted piece of furniture that takes inspiration from vintage industrial design, blending both aesthetics and functionality seamlessly. It has been thoughtfully designed to be particularly well-suited for high-traffic commercial areas where space is limited, making it an excellent choice for restaurants, cafes, and other dining establishments.\r\n\r\nThe chair’s construction features a combination of durable materials, ensuring its longevity and sturdiness. The frame is made from epoxy-coated mild steel, which not only adds to its strength but also provides protection against corrosion and wear. This makes the chair resilient to the challenges of heavy use in busy environments.\r\n\r\nAs for the seat, it is crafted from solid wood, adding a touch of natural elegance to the chair’s overall design. The solid wood seat not only enhances the visual appeal of the chair but also offers comfort to those seated.\r\n\r\nWindsor DINING CHAIR is a testament to practicality without compromising on style. Its vintage industrial design ensures it complements a wide range of interior decor styles, making it a versatile choice for various commercial spaces. Whether it’s a modern, rustic, or eclectic setting, this dining chair effortlessly blends in and adds character to the surrounding environment.',	NULL,	'dining-furniture-windsor-chair-986_v105.pdf',	NULL,	999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2016-08-19 20:30:10',	'2024-06-29 23:10:54'),
(987,	'ACCURA SIDEBOARD',	'HS02-000-STD',	NULL,	'Clean - lined, low profile design that showcases the wood\'s rich grain and warm color.\r\nAn anchor piece in any room.\r\nExpertly crafted from hand selected teak wood and stainless steel base.\r\nAmple storage space with 2 removable shelves.',	NULL,	'living-furniture-accura-sideboard-987_v743.pdf',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2016-08-19 21:27:56',	'2021-09-29 12:18:27'),
(988,	'TIARA LAUNDRY BOX',	'LB01-STD-AM1	',	NULL,	'Clean lined design that allows easy ventilation. Crafted from solid teak wood features. Cut out handles that allow the box to be easily carved around. Removable and easy to clean liner, made of cotton canvas and attached with velcro to the frame.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	43,	88,	'2016-08-22 21:32:08',	'2024-06-08 18:45:34'),
(989,	'GEROGIAN TABLE D60',	'GWT100-NAT-D65',	NULL,	'Crafted by master craftsmen with attention to detail, from hand selected and kiln dried timber. Perfect for outdoor dining areas where space comes at a premium. Teak wood being extremely long lasting is the optimal choice for commercial outdoor furniture. Never too hot or too cold to the touch. Easily portable. Knockdown construction for times when the furniture is to be stored.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2016-08-25 21:28:26',	'2022-06-30 19:41:41'),
