(1009,	'BALI DAY BED',	'ODB9-00-STD',	NULL,	'The Bali Daybed makes a perfect casual outdoor seating choice with its elegant design with curves for beauty and comfort.\r\nGreat for spending the evenings outdoors with your loved ones. \r\nMade of Viro / Rehau synthetic rattan. \r\nColour fast and resistant to sun and rain. \r\nExceptionally strong structure. \r\nRequires the minimal maintenance. \r\nComes in choice of woven / wooden top built in side table.\r\nVarious choices of cushion fabrics and colors. \r\nPrices mentioned are including Cushion prices for Sunproof Fabric.\r\nTo change to Sunbrella Fabric, please contact us.\r\n\r\n	Frame : Aluminium	\r\n	Weaving : VIRO/REHAU fiber	\r\n		\r\n	Dimensions : (cm)	\r\n	W189 x D165 x H80	365.00\r\n	Packing: 1 units/box	\r\n	Package Volume: 2.49m³	\r\n		\r\n ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2016-10-15 02:48:28',	'2021-09-29 12:40:15'),
(1010,	'SUN LOUNGER CUSHION T 8',	'SL-C8-SP167',	NULL,	'Sun Lounger Cushion is designed for outdoor use and is made from Sun proof Olefin fabric, which is resistant to sunlight and other outdoor elements. The cushion is filled with Quick Dry foam, which has a thickness of 8 cm on the seat, providing maximum comfort for users.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the foam, the cushion also has a layer of polyester fiber, which adds an extra layer of softness and comfort. The cushion also features anti-slip backing fabric to prevent it from slipping off the lounger, making it safer and more\r\n\r\nDesigned to provide users with a comfortable and safe outdoor lounging experience. Its durable and high-quality materials make it a reliable choice for anyone looking to enjoy the outdoors in comfort.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2016-10-17 23:13:53',	'2023-11-19 00:49:36'),
(1011,	'GEORGIAN SIDE CHAIR ',	'HRC59-AM1-STD',	NULL,	'Trinity chair is a multipurpose chair. The structure and the design allows it to be wrapped with different materials to be used at different places. fabric and leather upholstered can be used as dining and lounge chair while upholstered with Synthetic and natural rattan can be used as outdoor dining and Cafe chair.',	NULL,	'dining-furniture-trinity-side-chair-1011_v623.pdf',	NULL,	999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2016-11-22 21:03:03',	'2022-11-18 23:56:15'),
(1012,	'KOORG COFFEE TABLE',	'CT23T-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Made of premium teak wood with tempered glass top. Minimalistic design approach for neat and clean look for modern living concept.',	NULL,	'living-furniture-koorg-coffee-table-1012_v766.pdf',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	79,	'2016-11-25 22:38:59',	'2021-09-29 13:50:25'),
(1013,	'BAHAMAS BAR TABLE S60',	'HDS342-TB-S60',	NULL,	' The Bahamas Bar table is a stylish and high-quality piece of furniture designed for use in bars, restaurants, or even at home. It is constructed using premium teak wood, known for its durability and resistance to weather elements, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nThe table features a mild steel base, which provides stability and support. The combination of teak wood and mild steel creates a visually appealing contrast, giving the table a modern and sophisticated look.\r\n\r\nOne of the notable features of the Bahamas Bar table is its versatility in terms of dimensions and colors. It comes in a variety of sizes to accommodate different spaces and requirements. Whether you need a compact table for a cozy corner or a larger one for a spacious bar area, you can find a suitable option.\r\n\r\nIn addition, the table is available in various colors, allowing you to choose the one that best matches your interior or personal style. Whether you prefer a classic natural teak finish, a rich dark stain, or even a vibrant painted color, the Bahamas Bar table offers customization options to suit your taste.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2016-12-01 16:59:13',	'2023-12-09 03:17:32'),
(1014,	'DOME BAR CHAIR',	'BRC201-AM1',	NULL,	'A handy chair suitable for Cafe and restaurants. It is made of Solid wood. The chair is designed to maximize your seating capacity without compromising the comfort of your valued customers.',	NULL,	'dining-furniture-dome-bar-chair-1014_v788.pdf',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'0',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2016-12-01 20:21:14',	'2021-09-29 15:52:44'),
(1015,	'MISORE DINING CHAIR',	'HRC35-AM-STD',	NULL,	'Elegantly designed in generous proportions, Misore dining chair is comfortable and durable.Suits well in a variety of spaces. Made of teak wood frame and uopholstered in quality materials with a tfted back.',	NULL,	'dining-furniture-misore-dining-chair-1015_v534.pdf',	NULL,	999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2016-12-01 21:49:12',	'2022-11-19 00:04:40'),
