(1028,	'ACCURA SQUARE COFFEE TABLE',	'ACT37-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Our Accura Collection combines the timeless beauty of teak with the strength and resiliency of Stainless Steel to produce stunning designs and high performance furniture. Perfect for outdoor use in a residential or a commercial setting. Highly durable, long lasting and low maintenance furniture. Made of Grade A Kiln dried plantation grown teak wood and grade 304 stainless steel.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2017-03-22 17:31:22',	'2021-09-29 12:24:19'),
