(1119,	'BAHAMAS ROUND TABLETOP D80',	'HDS34-TB-D80',	NULL,	'The Bahamas dining table is a popular choice for restaurants due to its stylish design and functional features. It is known for its easy mobility, making it convenient for restaurant staff to move it around as needed.\r\n\r\nThe table is crafted from high-quality Solid Teak wood, which is highly valued for its durability and natural beauty. Teak wood is resistant to rotting, warping, and pests, making it ideal for furniture that will be exposed to varying weather conditions or heavy use.\r\n\r\nThe dining table features a round powder-coated base made from mild steel, which provides stability and support. The powder coating adds a layer of protection against scratches and rust, ensuring the table remains in excellent condition even with frequent use.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of solid teak wood and a sturdy base, the Bahamas dining table offers a reliable and long-lasting solution for restaurant seating. Its elegant design and versatile features make it a popular choice for establishments looking to create a welcoming and stylish dining environment.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2019-12-13 23:15:07',	'2024-05-30 22:52:10'),
