(1181,	'ROME DINING CHAIR',	'RC2-GLD-STD',	NULL,	'ROME DINING CHAIR is a sophisticated and stylish seating option that seamlessly blends contemporary design with comfort, making it an ideal choice for modern dining environments. Its exquisite combination of aesthetics and functionality makes it stand out in any space.\r\n\r\nThis chair features elegant gold-plated legs that add a touch of luxury and opulence to its overall look. The gold plating not only enhances the chair’s visual appeal but also exudes a sense of refinement and elegance. The legs are sturdy and well-crafted, ensuring stability and durability.\r\n\r\nThe seat and back of the chair are upholstered in a sumptuous Royal blue velvet fabric. This choice of fabric adds a sense of grandeur and regality to the chair, creating a truly royal appearance. The plush velvet material not only enhances the comfort factor but also adds texture and richness to the design.\r\n\r\nFor those who prefer a different color palette or finish, the ROME DINING CHAIR also comes in a Black powder-coated surface with black fabric upholstery. This option provides a more sleek and modern aesthetic, offering versatility to cater to various interior design preferences. ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2020-08-25 19:07:39',	'2024-06-29 23:35:35'),
