(1185,	'HEALY DINING TABLE D80',	'BRL88-TB-D80',	NULL,	'The Healy barrel dining table offers a unique and traditional aesthetic, combining barrel classic appeal with a modern twist. These tables are particularly favored by restaurants and bars aiming to create a distinctive and memorable dining atmosphere for their customers.\r\n\r\nCrafted from durable and robust solid timber, the Healy barrel dining table showcases wood’s natural beauty and strength. Timber is carefully selected for quality and treated to ensure longevity. To enhance the visual appeal, metal strips are incorporated into the design, adding an industrial touch and reinforcing the barrel structure.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the Healy barrel dining table is the attention to detail exhibited through Antique Brass nail heads. These nail heads not only add elegance and sophistication to the table but also serve as functional elements, securing the metal strips and further reinforcing the overall construction.\r\n\r\nThe Healy barrel dining table offers customization options for the top size, allowing establishments to tailor the tables to their specific needs. This flexibility ensures that the tables can be seamlessly integrated into different dining spaces, accommodating various seating arrangements and spatial requirements.\r\n\r\nHealy barrel dining table presents a harmonious blend of traditional and contemporary elements, creating a visually appealing and durable piece of furniture. With its solid timber construction, metal strips, Antique Brass nail heads, and customizable top sizes, this table offers a unique dining experience for patrons. It adds character to any restaurant or bar setting.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION\r\n\r\nD80 x H78 CM\r\n\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2020-09-02 19:54:37',	'2024-06-29 19:44:48'),
(1186,	'HEALY DINING TABLE D90',	'BRL88-TB-D90',	NULL,	'The Healy barrel dining table offers a unique and traditional aesthetic, combining barrel classic appeal with a modern twist. These tables are particularly favored by restaurants and bars aiming to create a distinctive and memorable dining atmosphere for their customers.\r\n\r\nCrafted from durable and robust solid timber, the Healy barrel dining table showcases wood’s natural beauty and strength. Timber is carefully selected for quality and treated to ensure longevity. To enhance the visual appeal, metal strips are incorporated into the design, adding an industrial touch and reinforcing the barrel structure.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the Healy barrel dining table is the attention to detail exhibited through Antique Brass nail heads. These nail heads not only add elegance and sophistication to the table but also serve as functional elements, securing the metal strips and further reinforcing the overall construction.\r\n\r\nThe Healy barrel dining table offers customization options for the top size, allowing establishments to tailor the tables to their specific needs. This flexibility ensures that the tables can be seamlessly integrated into different dining spaces, accommodating various seating arrangements and spatial requirements.\r\n\r\nHealy barrel dining table presents a harmonious blend of traditional and contemporary elements, creating a visually appealing and durable piece of furniture. With its solid timber construction, metal strips, Antique Brass nail heads, and customizable top sizes, this table offers a unique dining experience for patrons. It adds character to any restaurant or bar setting.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION\r\n\r\nD90 x H78 CM\r\n\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2020-09-02 19:59:01',	'2024-06-29 19:46:53'),
