(1279,	'Reunion Circular Sofa',	'RS-001-SR-D360',	NULL,	'\"The Reunion Circular sofa is perfect for faimly gathering. Place it in your garden, Gazebo or Patio or pool side to enjoy your family gathering. made of synthetic rattan hand woven over a sturdy aluminium frame.\r\nInterchangeable as a side table with a glass top or as an ottoman with a cushion.\r\nThe 10cm thick cushions come in various options of Sunbrella, Sunproof or Nagata fabrics.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-05-24 22:34:58',	'2021-09-29 07:58:15'),
