(1282,	'MODERNO DINING CHAIR',	'UDC-SI55-STD',	NULL,	' MODERNO DINING CHAIR is a sophisticated and well-crafted dining chair designed to elevate your dining experience while offering both comfort and style. Constructed using high-quality mild steel, this dining chair boasts a sturdy and durable frame that ensures long-lasting use. The chair features a thoughtfully designed cushioned seat and backrest, which adds an extra layer of comfort for extended seating periods.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the MODERNO DINING CHAIR is its elegant and modern design. The frame is skillfully powder coated in a sleek and timeless Matt black finish, giving it a refined look that effortlessly complements various interior styles. The matte black coating not only adds a touch of sophistication but also provides protection against wear and tear, ensuring the chair retains its pristine appearance over time.\r\n\r\nThe seat and backrest of the MODERNO DINING CHAIR are upholstered in a durable fabric that is specifically chosen to withstand everyday use and maintain its appeal. This upholstery offers a comfortable seating experience while being resilient enough to resist potential stains or damage. The chair is available in an array of colors for the upholstery, allowing you to choose the shade that best suits your personal taste and complements your existing decor.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-25 21:49:33',	'2024-06-29 23:41:08'),
(1283,	'MARIO DINING CHAIR',	'MRD-SI-159',	NULL,	'MARIO  a luxurious dining chair that will make your dining space (Home, Restaurant & Cafe ) stand out from the crowd. The chair is made of a mild steel frame and velvet fabric upholstered, making it comfortable and stylish. It features a sleek design that looks great on any home decor. The Emerald Dining Chair comes in a variety of colors so you can find one that matches your current decor perfectly.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	99999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-25 21:55:42',	'2022-11-19 00:01:06'),
(1284,	'MURANO DINING CHAIR ',	'MRC-SI-171',	NULL,	'Murano Dining Chair is a striking piece of furniture that seamlessly combines colorful contemporary design with functionality. Crafted with a sturdy mild steel frame, this dining chair showcases a unique and innovative concept that goes beyond the traditional seating arrangement.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature of the Murano Dining Chair is its compartmentalized, dual-purpose shelf. This shelf is intelligently integrated into the design, adding both aesthetic appeal and practicality to the chair. It serves as a convenient storage solution, allowing you to keep essential items within arm’s reach while you enjoy your meal. Whether it’s holding a book, a tablet, a small plant, or even tableware, this integrated shelf enhances the chair’s usability.\r\n\r\nWhat sets the Murano Dining Chair apart is its extensive array of colors. It is available in a wide spectrum of hues, ranging from vibrant and bold choices to more subdued and elegant tones. This color diversity ensures that the chair can effortlessly blend into various interior design schemes, making it a versatile option for a range of spaces.\r\n\r\nThe upholstery of the Murano Dining Chair is not only visually appealing but also comfortable. The combination of the mild steel frame and the upholstered seat ensures a pleasant seating experience, making it suitable for extended use during meals, conversations, or even work sessions.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-25 21:59:27',	'2024-06-29 22:39:29'),
(1285,	'EMERALD DINING CHAIR ',	'EMC-SI-162',	NULL,	'The Emerald Dining Chair is a luxurious dining chair that will make your dining space (Home, Restaurant & Cafe ) stand out from the crowd. The chair is made of a mild steel frame and velvet fabric upholstered, making it comfortable and stylish. It features a sleek design that looks great on any home decor. The Emerald Dining Chair comes in a variety of colors so you can find one that matches your current decor perfectly.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	99999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-27 14:53:15',	'2022-11-18 23:51:11'),
(1286,	'JAZE SIDE CHAIR',	'JSC-SI-164',	NULL,	'The luxurious JaZe Side Chair is as comfortable as it is stylish. The legs are gold plated with royal velvet fabric, giving this chair an elegant and regal look.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	99999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-27 14:57:51',	'2022-11-18 23:58:17'),
(1287,	'JAZE ARM CHAIR ',	'JAC-SI-165',	NULL,	'Available in a variety of colors, made of mild steel frame & velvet fabric upholstered, this design is contemporary, dual-purpose, and compartmentalized',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-27 15:00:51',	'2022-06-11 21:06:15'),
(1288,	'PARIS DINING CHAIR',	'SI177',	NULL,	'PARIS DINING CHAIR embodies a perfect blend of contemporary aesthetics, durability, and comfort, making it an excellent choice for modern interior spaces. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this dining chair redefines elegance while ensuring practicality.\r\n\r\nThe chair features a sleek and minimalist design, characterized by clean lines and subtle curves that effortlessly capture the essence of contemporary style. Its versatile silhouette allows it to seamlessly complement a range of interior design themes, from urban chic to minimalist sophistication.\r\n\r\nConstructed with high-quality materials, the PARIS DINING CHAIR guarantees exceptional durability and longevity. The sturdy frame is meticulously engineered to withstand regular use, ensuring that it remains a staple in your dining area for years to come. The chair’s robust construction also makes it suitable for both residential and commercial settings, adding to its versatility.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the PARIS DINING CHAIR is its commitment to comfort. The ergonomic design ensures that every moment spent sitting in the chair is a pleasant experience. The chair’s well-proportioned seat and backrest offer ample support, allowing you to enjoy long conversations and meals without any discomfort. Whether you’re hosting a dinner party or simply enjoying a meal with your family, the PARIS DINING CHAIR ensures that your seating experience is always relaxing.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-27 15:04:54',	'2024-06-29 22:36:47'),
(1289,	'MILANO DINING CHAIR',	'MLC-SI71-STD',	NULL,	'This modern design is available in a range of colors and is both duable and confartable.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999999,	NULL,	'0',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-05-27 15:11:01',	'2022-11-19 00:03:44'),
