(1291,	'HAWAII SOFA 2 SEATER ',	'OSS72-HW-2STR',	NULL,	'The Hawaii Sofa is designed for a relaxed outdoor seating experience. Combining traditional weaving techniques with modern manufacturing techniques, it is highly durable and easy to maintain.  \r\n\r\nAluminium frame with all weather REHAU weave.\r\nAvailable in various weave colors with a variety of cushion colors in sunbrella, sunproof and suny guard fabrics.\r\n\r\nPrices mentioned are including Cushion prices for Sunproof Fabric.\r\nTo change to Sunbrella Fabric, please contact us.\r\n\r\nFrame : Aluminium	\r\nWeaving : VIRO/REHAU fiber	\r\n	\r\nDimensions : (cm)	\r\nW160 x D80 x H75	145.00\r\nPacking: 1 units/box	\r\nPackage Volume: 0.96m³	\r\n	\r\n	\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-05-27 18:15:56',	'2022-11-15 16:32:05'),
(1293,	'Hawaii Sofa 3 Seater',	'OSS73-HW-3STR',	NULL,	'The Hawaii Sofa is designed for a relaxed outdoor seating experience. Combining traditional weaving techniques with modern manufacturing techniques, it is highly durable and easy to maintain.\r\n\r\nAluminium frame with all weather REHAU weave.\r\n\r\nAvailable in various weave colors with a variety of cushion colors in sunbrella, sunproof and suny guard fabrics.\r\n\r\nPrices mentioned are including Cushion prices for Sunproof Fabric.\r\n\r\nTo change to Sunbrella Fabric, please contact us.\r\n\r\nFrame : Aluminium	\r\nWeaving : VIRO/REHAU fiber	\r\n	\r\nDimensions : (cm)	\r\nW225 x D80 x H75	195.00\r\nPacking: 1 units/box	\r\nPackage Volume: 1.35m³	\r\n	\r\n	\r\nSunbrella Fabric:	195.00\r\nSunproof Fabric: 	96.00',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-05-27 18:23:37',	'2022-11-15 16:31:01'),
(1294,	'Hawaii Sofa 1 Seater',	'OSS71-HW-1STR',	NULL,	'The Hawaii Sofa is designed for a relaxed outdoor seating experience. Combining traditional weaving techniques with modern manufacturing techniques, it is highly durable and easy to maintain.\r\n\r\nAluminium frame with all weather REHAU weave.\r\n\r\nAvailable in various weave colors with a variety of cushion colors in sunbrella, sunproof and suny guard fabrics.\r\n\r\nPrices mentioned are including Cushion prices for Sunproof Fabric.\r\n\r\nTo change to Sunbrella Fabric, please contact u\r\n\r\nFrame : Aluminium	\r\nWeaving : VIRO/REHAU fiber	\r\n	\r\nDimensions : (cm)	\r\nW95 X D80 x H75	105.00\r\nPacking: 1 units/box	\r\nPackage Volume: 0.57m³	\r\n	\r\n	',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-05-27 18:26:46',	'2021-11-23 01:04:19'),
(1295,	'MADISON SOFA 1 SEATER',	'MAD-R16A70C168-1STR',	NULL,	'unique, modern, and classy range of sofas that offer you the comfort and style to completely transform your outdoor lounge or dining area. The Madison sofa is made of olefin rope woven into the sturdy steel frame.\r\nStrength, support, and durability. This super-comfortable and durable sofa features a high-density foam covered by Olefine fabric.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-06-14 17:35:12',	'2022-11-24 22:20:29'),
(1296,	'MADISON  SOFA 2 SEATER',	'MAD-R16A70C168-2STR',	NULL,	'A truly unique, modern, and classy Madison sofa with both comfort and style perfect for relaxing or eating in any outdoor area. Featuring a Galvanized steel frame woven with olefin rope, and high-density foam covered by Olefin fabric which offers comfort, durability, and long life\r\nsuper-comfortable with strength, support, and luxurious features.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-06-14 17:42:08',	'2022-11-30 16:03:48'),
(1297,	'Milan Bar Table L120',	'HOD97-NAT-S120',	NULL,	'Expertly crafted tabletop from genuine solid wood for long-lasting performance in any outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nThoughtful attention to detail and proportion.\r\n\r\nEasy to maintain.\r\n\r\nTable base made of mild steel with epoxy or powder coating.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2021-06-23 19:25:39',	'2021-12-16 17:59:51'),
(1298,	'KOORG DISPLAY RACK',	'KDC63-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Koorg storage rack, A minimalist multi purpose organiser, be it to display your precious cristals, book rack, file rack or restaurant merchanidise display. The rack is made of  ecofriendly and sustainable plantation TEAK wood. Bevelled glass, Crafted to perfection, designed to created the lasting impression. Available in Natural Teak color as well as Wallnut color. ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2021-06-28 16:49:34',	'2021-09-28 10:38:04'),
(1300,	'RIO SOFA 1 SEATER ',	'OSS97-JB-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa, where the luxury of your living room meets the serenity of the outdoors. Crafted with meticulous design, this sofa is your invitation to bask in the fresh air of your garden or unwind under the radiant sun while enveloped in unparalleled comfort.\r\nDesigned with a generous depth, our sofa embraces you in a cocoon of relaxation, offering a retreat from the demands of the day. The all-weather fiber, carefully selected for its durability, ensures a lasting and elegant aesthetic, making this sofa a timeless addition to your outdoor sanctuary.\r\nCustomization is at the heart of our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa. Choose from a range of fabric options in different types and colors, allowing you to tailor the sofa to seamlessly blend with your outdoor theme. From subtle neutrals to vibrant hues, we offer a palette to suit every taste and style.\r\nThe price of our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa includes cushions made with high-quality olefin sunproof HDF, providing not only plush support but also resistance to the elements. For those seeking alternative fabric brands such as Sunbrella and more, please don\'t hesitate to contact us for a personalized touch.\r\nElevate your outdoor living experience with the perfect blend of sophistication, durability, and comfort. Our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa is more than just furniture; it\'s an oasis of tranquility where the beauty of nature meets the luxury of home.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-09-27 20:58:42',	'2024-03-14 21:13:06'),
(1301,	'ZANZIBAR SIDE CHAIR ',	'HDC305-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Zanzibar Side Chair is a versatile and stylish piece of furniture that can complement various interior styles. It is durable, comfortable, and easy to maintain, making it a practical choice for any home or office.\r\n\r\nThis piece of furniture is made of solid wood and upholstery. solid wood is a durable and sustainable material that is often used in furniture manufacturing.\r\n\r\nThe upholstery of the chair is made of either PU or fabric. PU stands for polyurethane, which is a synthetic material often used as a leather substitute. It is durable and easy to clean, making it a popular choice for furniture upholstery. Fabric upholstery, on the other hand, is available in various textures, patterns, and colors. It provides a softer and warmer feel than PU.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-10-28 23:56:14',	'2024-06-29 23:00:07'),
(1302,	'GREECE DINING CHAIR ',	'GRC-DC-STD',	NULL,	'Designed in a way that provides enough back rest to allow you to relax after eating, Greece Dining Chair offers an ergonomic design.\r\nThe chair features a combination of solid wood and PU leather.\r\nOriginally named Greece, it represents comfort and quality.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-10-29 16:53:34',	'2022-11-18 23:57:00'),
(1304,	'Mehfil Small Arm Dining Chair',	'HDC307-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Mehfil Small Arm is Dining chair is PU and Wood combination chairs. Its just Nice for indoor and outdoor dining area under the veranda\r\n\r\nCombination of Solid wood and PU leather\r\nQuality, Comfort and modern and unique Style ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'0',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-10-29 17:21:35',	'2022-01-22 23:16:50'),
(1305,	'RAEES DINING BASE D36',	'SS-D36-10',	NULL,	'Raees Base is made of 8mm thick corrosion resistant stainless steel grade 360 plate. Unique and Modern Design   ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	14,	'2021-10-30 20:40:21',	'2021-11-06 19:53:06'),
(1306,	'VINTAGE DINING CHAIR ',	'VNT-DC-STD',	NULL,	'The Vintage Dining Chair is a beautiful piece of furniture that features solid wood construction, and it looks like it came straight out of an old-school dining room. This chair is built to last, and its design will fit right in with your existing decor while still adding a little something special.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2021-10-30 23:16:34',	'2022-11-19 00:10:01'),
(1308,	'PACIFIC CHAIR ',	'HRP88-00-STD',	NULL,	'Pacific chair  demonstrates the combination between innovative polymer technology and traditional weaving craft, using an eco-friendly and recyclable Raucord fiber produced by Rehau® of Germany. It is hand woven and mounted on an aluminum frame by our craftsmen.\r\nWith its arm rest, it is resistant to all weather conditions (even extreme hot or cold temperatures).\r\nFit for indoor or outdoor use in both commercial and residential settings.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	30,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2021-11-07 23:05:27',	'2022-11-19 00:47:41'),
(1309,	'NUSA LOUNGE SOFA 2 SEATER ',	'N2S-EA-HY',	NULL,	'The NUSA 2-Seater Sofa combines timeless elegance and modern durability, featuring a robust base crafted from premium A Grade teak wood with internationally compliant moisture content (MC). The upper part showcases intricate twisted synthetic hyacinth weaving over a lightweight aluminium frame that is powder-coated for added protection and a sleek finish. This sophisticated sofa offers superior comfort while enhancing any living space with its unique blend of natural aesthetics and contemporary design.\r\n\r\nFrame : Aluminium\r\n\r\nWeaving : Hyacinth wicker\r\n\r\nWeaving : VIRO EURO ASH 195.00\r\n\r\nWeaving :Flat Knitted textile 225.00\r\n\r\nPacking: 1 unit/box\r\n\r\nPackage Volume: 0.96m³',	NULL,	'outdoor-furniture-nusa-2-seater-sofa-1309_v919.pdf',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2021-11-19 23:35:04',	'2024-06-22 21:07:10'),
(1310,	'RITZ HOSTESS STATION',	'RSC-1013',	NULL,	'Host your customer with warmth and style with Ritz hostess station. It is made of solid wood. Quartz top adds elegance to the design and makes it resistant to scratches with ease of maintenance. High performance hardware on drawers makes it smooth to operate with heavy loads of cutleries.  ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2021-12-16 23:15:01',	'2022-04-05 21:25:18'),
(1311,	'MEHFIL DINING TABLE L180',	'HDS24-NAT-R180',	NULL,	'Our Mehfil tables - (mehfil means \"a gathering to entertain\") - are great for large gatherings. Centre of attraction in any dining area and a constant topic of conversation and admiration. Each table is unique and exhibit naturally occurring knots, graining, splitting and mineral deposits that add character to each piece. Made of solid single slab Raintree timber top from sustainable sources. Raintree is also called Pokok Hujan in Malay, Trembesi in Javanese, Meh in Indonesian, while its scientific name is Albizia Saman. Come with a variety of bases.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2021-12-17 22:12:27',	'2024-03-07 20:29:26'),
(1312,	'KOORG DINING TABLE L150',	'DT626-NAT-L150',	NULL,	'Simple and elegant dining table. \r\nMade from premium Teak wood. \r\nAvailable in various sizes. \r\nSuitable for homes, resorts as well as fine dining restaurants.\r\n\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2021-12-19 00:39:58',	'2021-12-19 00:41:57'),
