(1364,	'SAUD OTTOMAN ',	'SD-C180-OT',	NULL,	'The sturdy, weatherproof SAUD outdoor ottoman has been designed for use outdoors in residential and commercial environments, Crafted from a combination of sustainable and recycled materials,  from the front porch to the back patio. Both stylish and functional, this versatile outdoor footrest solution will add comfort, convenience, and durability to your outdoor space.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2022-09-28 15:36:17',	'2022-09-28 15:40:26'),
(1365,	'OUTDOOR FABRIC CARTENZA 110',	'SP-CTZ-110',	NULL,	'\"Sunproof is a water-repellant, easy to maintain, performance outdoor fabric. \r\nIt is treated with sanitised products that inhibit microbial growth and mould. \r\nMade from 100% solution dyed olefin yarn, it is environmentally friendly and 100% recyclable. It has excellent weatherability and withstands the effects of prolonged exposure to sunlight, wind, chlorinated pool water, rain and humidity. \r\nA leader in setting trends, it comes in the latest designs and wide range of colours.\r\nIts extreme stain resistance, anti bacterial and anti mildew properties keeps the fabric looking clean, fresh and new. \r\nAn excellent choice for value, durability and comfort.\r\n\r\nSpecifications.  \r\nBrand : Sunproof. Composition:  Width (cm) : 150. 100% Olefin. Weight (gr/m2) :   238. Abrasion (BS EN 14465:2003 Annex A) - rubs   :  12,000.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2022-10-08 23:55:35',	'2022-11-11 23:24:04'),
