(1367,	'SAUD DINING TABLE L180',	'SD-DT-L180',	NULL,	'The SAUD Dining Table L180 is perfect for small families, blending elegance and functionality with ease of assembly. Key features include:\r\n\r\nTop Material: Crafted from teakwood arranged in slates, the table top combines durability with a sophisticated look. The lasur finishing highlights the natural beauty of the wood and provides a smooth, protective layer.\r\nBase Material: The base is constructed from powder-coated mild steel, ensuring strength and a contemporary style.\r\nSeating Capacity: Comfortably accommodates up to 6 people, making it ideal for family meals and small gatherings.\r\nKnockdown Mechanism: Designed with a convenient knockdown mechanism for easy assembly and disassembly, perfect for those who move frequently or have limited space.\r\nThis dining table not only enhances your dining area with its stylish design but also offers practical features for long-lasting use and convenience.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teak Wood Top  \r\n Base: Galvanised Steel',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	100,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2022-10-12 15:53:46',	'2024-06-13 16:31:16'),
(1368,	'SAUD DINING TABLE L210',	'SD-DT-L210',	NULL,	'The SAUD Dining Table L210 is ideal for normal-sized families, combining style, durability, and practicality. Key features include:\r\n\r\nTop Material: The table top is crafted from teakwood arranged in slates, offering both robustness and elegance. The lasur finishing enhances the natural beauty of the wood while providing a smooth, protective layer.\r\nBase Material: Constructed from powder-coated mild steel, the base ensures durability and adds a modern touch to the design.\r\nSeating Capacity: Designed to comfortably seat up to 8 people, making it perfect for family meals and gatherings.\r\nKnockdown Mechanism: Features a convenient knockdown mechanism for easy assembly and disassembly, ideal for frequent movers or those with limited space.\r\nThis dining table not only elevates your dining area with its sophisticated design but also provides practical features for ease of use and long-lasting quality.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teak Wood Top \r\nBase: Galvanised Steel ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	100,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2022-10-12 16:09:49',	'2024-06-13 16:32:54'),
