(1377,	'KOORG REHYAL',	'KR-TB-STD',	NULL,	'Koorg Rehal is a handcrafted wooden and rattan Quran stand. also pronounced Raykal, Reyhal, etc. It is made of solid wood and natural rattan weaving. Koorg Rehal stands can be used as a holybook holder and /or reading stand at home, in office and prayer room. It is foldable that makes it easy to carry around and store.  ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'0',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2022-11-15 20:59:46',	'2022-11-22 21:53:58'),
(1378,	'BARCELONA SUN LOUNGER',	'BRLG-SS-STD',	NULL,	'The Barcelona lounger is a must-have for any modern swimming pool, featuring a striking woven design made from 100% sustainable materials and powder-coated frames. This eye-catching piece of furniture is carefully hand-woven by skilled artisans and made with the best quality materials to ensure durability, comfort, and longevity.\r\nTo enhance the comfort and longevity of the lounger, we recommend adding a cushion made from Sunroof or Sunbrella fabrics. Available in a variety of colors.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	67,	'2022-11-20 03:02:17',	'2023-01-11 20:43:47'),
(1379,	'AQSA CHAIR',	'AC-DC-STW',	NULL,	'The Aqsa Dining Chair is a stunning modern outdoor chair. Made of natural teak wood and with an elegant, comfortable, and durable Olefin rope seat and backrest, it will bring you years of enjoyment. Its classic design adds elegance to any outdoor space or deck.\r\nFor the ultimate outdoor dining experience, explore the elegant design and optional upholstery options for this stunning chair. For the ultimate outdoor dining experience, explore the elegant design and optional upholstery options for this stunning chair.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 04:49:18',	'2022-11-23 16:20:55'),
(1380,	'AMRA CHAIR ',	'AM-DC-STW',	NULL,	'Sit back, relax and enjoy the view. This outdoor chair is a great addition to any outdoor space, with a stylish and comfortable design made of durable teak wood and Olefin fabric. Ideal for both indoor and outdoor use, just wipe clean with a damp cloth when you’re done.  Its large scale is enhanced with a generous depth at the seat, which can be upholstered to your preference',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 16:30:26',	'2022-11-23 16:21:17'),
(1381,	'DANISH DINING CHAIR',	'DA-DC-STW',	NULL,	' The Danish dining chair is a classic and elegant piece of furniture known for its simplicity and functionality. Typically crafted from high-quality Teak wood, these chairs are durable and have a natural, warm appearance. The seat is made of 15 MM WIDTH VIRO POLYPEEL material, which is a synthetic rattan-like material that adds comfort and texture to the chair.\r\n\r\nOne of the defining characteristics of Danish dining chairs is their clean lines and minimalistic design. They often have a straightforward and unadorned look, emphasizing practicality and understated beauty. The chairs’ aesthetic appeal lies in their timeless design, making them suitable for various interior styles and decor preferences.\r\n\r\nThe legs of Danish dining chairs are usually tapered, which adds a touch of elegance and visual interest to the overall structure. The backrests are often gently curved, providing ergonomic support and comfort for extended sitting.\r\n\r\nViro PolyPeel seats are a common feature of Danish dining chairs, ensuring that they are comfortable to sit on and easy to maintain. This material is known for its durability and resistance to wear and tear, making the chairs suitable for regular use in both residential and commercial spaces.\r\n\r\nThe versatility of Danish dining chairs makes them a popular choice for various settings, from traditional dining rooms to modern interior designs. Their combination of functionality, comfort, and timeless style adds significant value to these chairs, making them cherished pieces of furniture for many homeowners and interior decorators.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 16:43:23',	'2024-06-29 22:53:30'),
(1382,	'SHIZU DINING CHAIR',	'SH-DC-STW',	NULL,	' The Shizu Dining Chair is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed for use in dining rooms, homes, and commercial spaces. The typical design of this chair incorporates Teak wood, a durable and beautiful material, giving it a classic and elegant appearance. The chair also features 40 MM strapping in a sleek black color, arranged in a 1×1 webbing pattern, which adds a contemporary touch to its overall look.\r\n\r\nThe Shizu Dining Chair is known for its simple and clean lines, showcasing minimal ornamentation. This design approach enhances its aesthetic appeal and allows it to blend seamlessly with various interior styles. Despite its straightforward design, the chair doesn’t compromise on comfort and functionality, making it a popular choice for seating during meals and gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe chair’s features include tapered legs, which provide stability and visual balance to the overall structure. The curved backrest offers ergonomic support and ensures that users can sit comfortably for extended periods. Another notable aspect of the chair is the Viro PolyPeel seats, known for their durability, comfort, and resistance to environmental factors like moisture and UV rays. This feature ensures that the Shizu Dining Chair maintains its attractive appearance and functionality even with frequent use.\r\n\r\nOne of the key advantages of the Shizu Dining Chair is its timeless style, meaning it transcends trends and fads, allowing it to remain relevant and aesthetically pleasing for years to come. Additionally, its versatility makes it suitable for a variety of settings, ranging from casual to formal spaces.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 16:49:13',	'2024-06-29 22:51:51'),
(1383,	'LALIT DINING CHAIR',	'LA-DC-STW',	NULL,	'LALIT DINING CHAIR is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed with a combination of Teak wood and 5 MM POLYHYACINTH EUROASH COLOR. The design typically follows a minimalist approach, characterized by clean lines and limited embellishments. This simplicity enhances the aesthetic appeal and allows the chair to blend seamlessly with various interior styles.\r\n\r\nThe use of Teak wood ensures durability and longevity, making it a great choice for dining chairs that are frequently used. The 5 MM POLYHYACINTH EUROASH COLOR adds a touch of natural texture to the chair, giving it an organic and contemporary look. The KT webbing pattern is likely used for the seat, providing both comfort and support for the user.\r\n\r\nSome common features of the LALIT DINING CHAIR include tapered legs, which add an elegant touch and contribute to stability. The curved backrests enhance the ergonomic design, promoting a comfortable seating experience. Additionally, the Viro PolyPeel seats offer durability and are easy to maintain, making them ideal for regular use in homes and commercial spaces.\r\n\r\nThe LALIT DINING CHAIR is versatile and suitable for various settings, including homes, dining rooms, restaurants, cafes, and other commercial establishments. Its timeless style ensures that it won’t go out of fashion quickly, making it a valuable investment for interior decor. Whether it’s for formal dining or casual gatherings, these chairs offer both aesthetic charm and functional comfort, making them a popular choice for many discerning customers.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 16:53:56',	'2024-06-29 22:50:25'),
(1384,	'SHAZA DINING CHAIR',	'SA-DC-STW',	NULL,	'SHAZA DINING CHAIR is a type of dining chair that follows a typical design, combining Teak wood and 5 MM OUTDOOR ROPE C 161 IN CREATIVE WEBBING PATTERN with KT webbing pattern. The chair’s design is characterized by simple, clean lines and minimal ornamentation, giving it a contemporary and sophisticated look.\r\n\r\nOne of the key aspects of these chairs is their focus on comfort and functionality, making them suitable for extended use during meals or gatherings. Additionally, they are highly appreciated for their aesthetic appeal, offering a balance of both style and practicality.\r\n\r\nThe SHAZA DINING CHAIR often features tapered legs, which provide stability and a touch of elegance. The curved backrests enhance comfort and encourage proper posture during dining. The use of Viro Poly Peel seats further adds to the chair’s comfort and durability.\r\n\r\nDue to their versatile design, these dining chairs can be used in various settings, including homes, dining rooms, and commercial spaces like restaurants or cafes. They are highly regarded for their timeless style, making them suitable for different interior design themes and decor styles.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 17:07:16',	'2024-06-29 22:49:14'),
(1385,	'NELY DINING CHAIR',	'NDC-TW-CTS',	NULL,	'Our latest addition to the Nely dining chair range, the Nely  Dining Chair is an ultra-chic and comfortable seat for both indoor and outdoor use. The design of this piece looks great in any setting, making it ideal for restaurants, bars, and lounges – or in your garden or patio. The chair features a Teakwood frame with a double-stitched Olefin weatherproof fabric backrest and base. Ideal for relaxing after a hard day\'s work, or enjoying quality time with family and friends.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2022-11-22 18:52:38',	'2022-11-23 16:20:25'),
(1386,	'KOORG REHAL',	'KRG-RHL-NAT',	NULL,	'Koorg Rehal is a handcrafted wooden and rattan Quran stand. also pronounced Raykal, Reyhal, etc. It is made of solid wood and natural rattan weaving. Koorg Rehal stands can be used as a holybook holder and /or reading stand at home, in office and prayer room. It is foldable that makes it easy to carry around and store.  ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2022-11-22 19:00:37',	'2023-11-22 00:52:56'),
(1387,	'TIARA FOLDING TABLE TALL',	'TFT-45-STD',	NULL,	'Simple, elegant and economical yet durable and made for heavy-duty outdoor use.\r\n\r\nPerfect for a small and medium sized patio or porch in a home or a restaurant. It has an easy folding mechanism and takes very low storage space.\r\n\r\nAll our outdoor chairs suit this dining table.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Solid Teak Wood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2022-11-22 21:15:46',	'2022-11-22 22:42:58'),
(1388,	'TIARA FOLDING TABLE SHORT',	'TFT-35-STD',	NULL,	'\"Simple, elegant and economical yet durable and made for heavy-duty outdoor use.\r\n\r\nPerfect for a small and medium sized patio or porch in a home or a restaurant. It has an easy folding mechanism and takes very low storage space.\r\n\r\nAll our outdoor chairs suit this dining table.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Solid Teak Wood\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2022-11-22 21:25:24',	'2022-11-22 21:51:48'),
(1389,	'DATAI DINING CHAIR',	'DT-BR-STD',	NULL,	' Datai Dining Chair is a sophisticated and stylish seating option designed to enhance the ambiance of your dining space, whether it’s at home, in a restaurant, or a cafe. This chair exudes elegance and class, making it a perfect choice for those who want to create a refined atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe chair is constructed using durable steel, ensuring its sturdiness and longevity. The steel frame provides reliable support, allowing you to comfortably sit and enjoy your meals for extended periods. The use of steel also adds a modern touch to the chair’s overall aesthetic.\r\n\r\nTo enhance comfort, the Datai Dining Chair is upholstered with high-quality synthetic leather. This upholstery not only provides a soft and cozy seating experience but also adds a touch of luxury and sophistication. The synthetic leather is easy to clean and maintain, making it suitable for busy dining environments.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the Datai Dining Chair is its sleek design. The chair’s clean lines and minimalistic silhouette contribute to its versatility, allowing it to effortlessly blend into various home decor styles. Whether your interior design is modern, contemporary, or traditional, this chair can complement it seamlessly.\r\n\r\nThe Datai Dining Chair comes in a range of colors, providing you with the flexibility to choose the one that best suits your existing decor. Whether you prefer neutral tones to create a timeless look or bold hues to make a statement, you can easily find a color that matches your aesthetic preferences.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2022-12-06 17:42:17',	'2024-06-29 23:55:41'),
(1390,	'RITZ FOOD DISPLAY S60',	'RZ-FD-TA60',	NULL,	'The Ritz food display is a beautiful and elegant way to showcase your food items, made from high-quality solid wood. The display comes in different sizes to fit your specific needs and preferences.\r\n\r\nTeak wood is a durable and long-lasting material that is resistant to water, decay, and insects. It also has a beautiful natural finish that adds warmth and style to any setting. The Ritz food display is designed with clean lines and a minimalist aesthetic, making it perfect for both modern and traditional settings.\r\n\r\nThis display is perfect for restaurants, cafes, hotels, or any food-related businesses that want to elevate their food presentation. It can also be used for home entertaining or as a stylish centerpiece for any event or gathering.\r\n\r\nWith its high-quality materials and beautiful design, the Ritz food display is sure to impress your guests and add a touch of sophistication to your food presentation.\r\nDIMENSIONS\r\nW 60 x D60 x H45 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2022-12-13 01:07:52',	'2024-06-01 20:16:53'),
(1391,	'TOWEL STORAGE',	'TS-STD',	NULL,	'STYLISH DESIGN - Incredibly compact this Towel storage unit is designed to mix function with style perfect for any Swimming Pool.\r\nLARGE STORAGE SPACE: Keeps your Swimming Pool and home tidy - suitable for beauty essentials and more. Hinged lid to access easily and keep protected.\r\nMATERIAL - Built from high-quality Solid wood and Stainless steel #303   \r\nAnd this style piece of Swimming Pool furniture is very easy to clean after an accidental spillage.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2022-12-14 23:22:25',	'2022-12-15 16:46:26'),
(1392,	'BARCELONA LOUNGE CHAIR',	'BRC-LC-WW-1S',	NULL,	'Lounge in luxurious comfort, style, & eco-friendliness with our versatile Barcelona Lounge Chair. Available in a beautiful riffed seashell weave aluminum finish and a light beachy whitewash.\r\nThe cushion features a supple and durable material as well as irresistible sunproof and sunbrella fabric with high density or quick dry foam  seat pad that elevates the product in smart-casual designs',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2022-12-21 17:28:54',	'2023-01-11 20:53:03'),
(1393,	'BARCELONA SOFA 2 SEATER',	'BRC-LS-WW-2S',	NULL,	'\"Contemporary and Retro, our Barcelona Sofas can effortlessly transcend spaces, lifestyles, and lounging experiences. Fancy and elegant, it is made of matte aluminum material with neutral colors. With White Wash FSW 37 and the seashell tones, you can find a color scheme to match any interior design. The sea motifs on the pillows are also pretty special.\r\nThis lightweight & elegant frame has been designed with white matte aluminum weaving inspired by the rich texture of seashells left washed to the shores by the salty sea. Structured silhouettes and refined lines give it an aesthetic that is functional as well as aesthetically pleasing. The environmentally friendly styling stands out in any setting\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2022-12-21 18:26:05',	'2023-01-11 17:04:17'),
