(1410,	'OUTDOOR FABRIC ARASHI 167',	'SP-ARS-167',	NULL,	'Sunproof Acrylic is a water-repellant, easy to maintain, performance outdoor fabric.\r\nIt is treated with sanitised products that inhibit microbial growth and mould.\r\nMade from 100% solution dyed Acrylic yarn, it is eco friendly and 100% recyclable. It has excellent weatherability and withstands the effects of prolonged exposure to sunlight, wind, chlorinated pool water, rain and humidity.\r\nA leader in setting trends, it comes in the latest designs and wide range of colours.\r\nIts extreme stain resistance, anti bacterial and anti mildew properties keeps the fabric looking clean, fresh and new.\r\nAn excellent choice for value, durability and comfort.\"\r\n\"\r\nBrand : Sunproof\r\nComposition : 100% Acrylic\r\nWidth (cm) : 150\r\nWeight (gr/m2) : 274\r\nAbrasion (BS EN 14465:2003 Annex A) - rubs : 18,000\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	2,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2023-01-01 00:31:18',	'2023-01-01 00:37:57'),
