(1457,	'ACCURA ROUND BAR TABLE D90',	'BRT40-TB-D90',	NULL,	'\"Material: Solid Teak Wood Top and Stainless Steel #304 Base\r\nOur Accura Collection furniture combines the timeless beauty of Teak Wood with the strength and resiliency of Stainless Steel to produce stunning designs and high performance furniture. Perfect for heavy duty outdoor use in a residential or a commercial setting. Highly durable, long lasting and low maintenance. The top is made of Grade A Kiln dried Plantation grown Teak wood while the base is made of 8 mm thick corrosion resistant stainless steel grade 304 plate. The thick stainless steel base plate ensures stability.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2023-02-12 03:25:06',	'2023-02-12 03:33:22'),
