(1461,	'ROSCHE DINING CHAIR',	'RSH-67-BL',	NULL,	'ROSCHE DINING CHAIR is a high-quality piece of furniture that combines modern design with comfort and durability. It is ideal for use in both residential and commercial settings and is sure to be a stylish and functional addition to any space.\r\nIt is constructed with a solid steel frame for durability and stability. The backrest is made of HPL bent wood, which gives it a sleek and modern appearance. The seat is padded with high-density foam for comfort and upholstered in black leather for a luxurious look and feel.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2023-02-16 18:13:36',	'2023-02-16 18:14:46'),
(1462,	'	AGAPE BAR CHAIR',	'	AG-SI159B-GR',	NULL,	'The AGAPE BAR CHAIR is a high-quality seating solution for bars, restaurants, and cafes. Made from solid steel, it is built to last and withstand heavy use. The seat is upholstered with HD foam and covered with black velvet fabric, providing comfort and elegance. The chair features a contemporary design with a sleek and slender profile that fits seamlessly into modern interiors. The AGAPE BAR CHAIR is not only functional but also a stylish addition to any bar area. It is easy to maintain, making it a practical and long-lasting investment for any business.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2023-02-16 18:52:30',	'2023-02-16 19:53:16'),
(1463,	'NEST DAYBED',	'NDB-GR-STD',	NULL,	'The Nest day bed is designed to enrich the most sophisticated outdoor open-Air atmosphere. Woven with weather-resistant synthetic fiber over powder coated Aluminium frame is an aesthetically refined piece. Due to its Oval Shape, it can be used as a lounge for couple seating at the poolside, Balcony or at the Beach. The all weather-resistant fiber used is UV resistant and Eco friendly, Resistant to color fastness. Price is inclusive of Sunproof Olefin fabric with HD foam. For other fabric ranges please contact our friendly sales support team.   ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-02-16 19:36:39',	'2023-02-16 19:47:09'),
