(1466,	'TOKYO FREE STANDING WARDROBE',	'TK-W01',	NULL,	'The Tokyo free-standing wardrobe is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed to add a touch of elegance and sophistication to your living space. The cabinet is made of high-quality mild steel that is durable and long-lasting. The steel frame is powder-coated in black, giving it a sleek and modern look. The wardrobe also features teakwood shelving, providing ample storage space for clothing and accessories. The combination of black steel and warm teakwood creates a beautiful contrast, adding to the wardrobe\'s overall visual appeal. With its sturdy construction and stylish design, the Tokyo free-standing wardrobe is the perfect addition to any home.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Mild steel Powder Coating Black / Teakwood Shelving ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2023-02-20 22:05:57',	'2023-02-20 22:09:14'),
(1467,	'ZANZIBAR DINING CHAIR',	'ZAD-SI206-STD',	NULL,	'Zanzibar Dining Chair: Stylish and functional piece of furniture that is designed to provide comfortable and long-lasting seating for dining or entertaining. It is constructed using solid wood, a type of durable and sustainable hardwood that is often used in furniture making. The chair also features an upholstered seat, armrest, and backrest, which can be made from either (PU) leather or fabric materials, providing a comfortable seating experience. The upholstery material adds to the overall aesthetic appeal of the chair, and it can be chosen to match the decor of the room.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2023-02-21 22:30:18',	'2024-06-29 23:06:34'),
