(1480,	'BITTA BAR CHAIR',	'BBC-CTZ230',	NULL,	'\"Bitta Bar Chair seamlessly combines modern design with durability, offering a stylish and comfortable seating solution for outdoor spaces. Crafted with precision and attention to detail, this bar chair is constructed with a sturdy powder-coated aluminum frame that ensures long-lasting resilience against the elements.\r\n\r\nThe chair\'s frame is intricately woven with Olefin rope, creating a visually appealing pattern that adds a touch of sophistication to any outdoor setting. Olefin is chosen for its exceptional strength and resistance to fading, making it an ideal material for outdoor furniture that withstands the challenges of various weather conditions.\r\n\r\nTo enhance your seating experience, the Bitta Bar Chair comes complete with a sunproof acrylic cushion. The cushion not only provides added comfort but is also designed to withstand prolonged exposure to sunlight without losing its vibrant colors or structural integrity. This feature ensures that your outdoor seating remains inviting and visually striking over time.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtful combination of materials in the Bitta Bar Chair results in a piece of furniture that is not only aesthetically pleasing but also practical and resilient. Whether you are creating a cozy corner on your patio or furnishing a poolside bar, the Bitta Bar Chair offers a sophisticated and durable seating solution that harmonizes with the natural beauty of outdoor spaces. Its blend of contemporary design, high-quality materials, and meticulous craftsmanship makes it a standout choice for those who appreciate both style and functionality in their outdoor furniture.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2023-11-18 01:16:59',	'2023-11-18 02:17:40'),
(1481,	'MADISON BAR CHAIR ',	'MDN-BRC-GR65',	NULL,	'\"Madison Bar Chair, a pinnacle of modern outdoor design that seamlessly combines sophistication, comfort, and durability. Crafted with a sleek aluminum frame, this bar chair not only exudes contemporary elegance but also ensures longevity in outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nMadison Bar Chair features a distinctive woven olefin rope seat and backrest, adding a touch of tactile luxury to its minimalist silhouette. The use of olefin rope not only enhances the chair\'s aesthetic appeal but also provides a comfortable and supportive seating experience. Olefin is renowned for its resistance to fading, moisture, and mildew, making it an ideal material for outdoor furniture that stands up to the elements.\r\n\r\nStylish and practical, the Madison Bar Chair is lightweight and easy to move, making it ideal for creating versatile seating arrangements outdoors. You\'ll be able to elevate your outdoor living experience whether you\'re hosting a casual gathering or enjoying a quiet evening on your patio.\r\n\r\nThe rust-resistant aluminum frame ensures the chair\'s sturdiness, ensuring it maintains its striking appearance over time. In addition to its visual appeal, the chair\'s material combination ensures that it will withstand outdoor use, making it a reliable choice for those seeking both form and function.\r\n\r\nTransform your outdoor space with the Madison Bar Chair, where modern design meets durability and comfort, providing a stylish solution for al fresco lounging and entertaining.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2023-11-18 01:23:43',	'2023-11-18 01:25:26'),
(1482,	'FLORIDA SUN LOUNGER',	'FLR-SS-STD',	NULL,	'An original and aesthetic element of the outdoors, the Florida Sun LOUNGER can be found on your porch or patio. This will provide you with a chance to relax outside in the shade while enjoying the warm weather. Featuring a Stainless steel frame, UV resistance 40 MM strapping black color in a 1×1 webbing pattern, and a high-quality teak wood sider this light is able to stand out in any weather condition. There is a maximum load recommendation of 200 kilograms for this product.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	67,	'2023-11-18 21:46:00',	'2024-05-31 14:29:58'),
(1483,	'CHAISES OUTDOOR CHAIR',	'COE-STD-01',	NULL,	'A stunning and innovative piece of furniture that seamlessly blends contemporary design with exceptional comfort and durability. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this chair is designed to elevate your dining experience while providing a stylish addition to your indoor or outdoor living space.\r\n\r\nFrame: The chair boasts a robust frame made from high-quality aluminum, ensuring stability and longevity. The aluminum frame is not only lightweight and easy to move around, but it also offers impressive resistance to corrosion and rust, making it well-suited for both indoor and outdoor settings. Its sleek and minimalist design adds a touch of modern elegance to any environment.\r\n\r\nBela Ropes: The chair’s seat and backrest are intricately woven with Bela Ropes, a durable and weather-resistant material that provides exceptional support and comfort. The rope weaving adds a unique texture and visual appeal to the chair, enhancing its overall aesthetic. Bela Ropes are known for their strength and flexibility, making them an ideal choice for furniture that needs to withstand frequent use and exposure to the elements.\r\n\r\nUV-Resistant and Easy-Clean Fabric: To enhance the chair’s usability and ease of maintenance, the seat and backrest feature UV-resistant and easy-to-clean fabric. This fabric is designed to resist fading and deterioration caused by prolonged sun exposure, ensuring that the chair maintains its vibrant appearance over time. Additionally, the fabric is engineered to repel spills and stains, simplifying the cleaning process and allowing you to enjoy your dining experience without worrying about accidental messes.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2023-11-19 01:07:12',	'2023-11-19 02:07:52'),
(1484,	'MULTIPURPOSE RACK',	'MT01',	NULL,	'A multipurpose rack is a versatile storage and organization solution designed to serve a variety of functions in homes, offices, garages, and other settings. Typically constructed from sturdy materials such as metal, wood, or plastic, these racks feature multiple shelves or compartments that can be used to store and display a wide range of items. Whether it\'s for organizing kitchen cookware, displaying books, holding toiletries in a bathroom, or storing tools in a workshop, multipurpose racks offer a practical and space-saving way to keep belongings tidy and easily accessible. Their adaptable design makes them a popular choice for individuals seeking efficient and customizable storage solutions.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	88,	'2023-11-19 01:46:06',	'2024-06-08 18:25:38'),
(1485,	'TOWEL BASKET',	'BB02-JB-STD',	NULL,	'A towel basket is a functional and decorative storage solution for organizing towels in a bathroom or any other living space. Typically made from materials like wicker, bamboo, or fabric, it offers a stylish way to keep towels neatly arranged and easily accessible. Available in various sizes, colors, and designs, a towel basket adds a touch of elegance to your interior while helping to maintain a clutter-free environment. Whether placed in bathrooms, poolside areas, or guest rooms, a towel basket combines practicality with aesthetic appeal.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	43,	88,	'2023-11-19 02:03:50',	'2024-06-08 18:44:20'),
