(1491,	'SERENE BAR CHAIR',	'SRN-BRC-AM1',	NULL,	'SERENE BAR CHAIR is a stylish and comfortable bar chair designed for use in bars, kitchens, or other elevated seating areas. The primary material used in its construction is Rubber Wood, known for its durability and attractive grain pattern. Rubber Wood is a popular choice for furniture due to its eco-friendly nature as it comes from the rubber tree, which is primarily grown for latex production.\r\n\r\nThe chair is designed with comfort in mind, featuring a cushioned seat and backrest. The cushion material comes in two options: PU (Polyurethane) or Fabric. PU is a synthetic material that offers a leather-like texture, providing a sleek and easy-to-clean surface. On the other hand, Fabric cushions offer a softer and more comfortable feel, and they come in various colors and patterns to match different interior styles.\r\n\r\nThe combination of Rubber Wood and cushioned seating makes the SERENE BAR CHAIR a perfect blend of elegance, durability, and comfort, making it an inviting seating option for individuals or guests looking to relax and enjoy their time at a bar or kitchen counter.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	2147483647,	NULL,	'0',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2023-11-21 00:37:09',	'2023-12-22 17:30:35'),
(1492,	'HAWAII TEAK TOP TABLE L 180',	'HOD1088-00-S180',	NULL,	'A blend of premium Teak wood top on a sturdy aluminium frame hand woven with Rehau fiber gives the table a great look. One of our most popular outdoor tables. Good for use with center-pole umbrellas. Suitable to use with a variety of our chairs.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 00:47:15',	'2023-11-25 00:54:01'),
