(1494,	'PANAMA TEAK TOP TABLE S 180',	'ODT27-BL-R180',	NULL,	'Features a premium Teak wood top and a sturdy aluminum frame that is hand-woven with Rehau fiber The combination of Teak wood and Rehau fiber gives the table a stylish and sophisticated look that is perfect for any outdoor setting.\r\nThe table is designed to withstand harsh outdoor conditions and is highly durable. It is also resistant to moisture, mold, and mildew, making it perfect for use in any climate.\r\nThe table’s aluminum frame is lightweight and sturdy, making it easy to move around as needed. The hand-woven Rehau fiber adds a touch of elegance to the table, while the Teak wood top adds warmth and natural beauty.\r\nOne of the most popular outdoor tables, thanks to its exceptional design and durability. It is also designed to be used with a center umbrella, making it ideal for outdoor dining and gatherings.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 01:18:15',	'2023-11-25 02:21:31'),
(1495,	'PANAMA TEAK TOP TABLE S 240',	'ODT27-BL-R240',	NULL,	'Features a premium Teak wood top and a sturdy aluminum frame that is hand-woven with Rehau fiber The combination of Teak wood and Rehau fiber gives the table a stylish and sophisticated look that is perfect for any outdoor setting.\r\nThe table is designed to withstand harsh outdoor conditions and is highly durable. It is also resistant to moisture, mold, and mildew, making it perfect for use in any climate.\r\nThe table’s aluminum frame is lightweight and sturdy, making it easy to move around as needed. The hand-woven Rehau fiber adds a touch of elegance to the table, while the Teak wood top adds warmth and natural beauty.\r\nOne of the most popular outdoor tables, thanks to its exceptional design and durability. It is also designed to be used with a center umbrella, making it ideal for outdoor dining and gatherings.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 01:25:33',	'2023-11-25 02:25:52'),
(1496,	'ACCURA OVAL TABLE TOP D 100',	'ACT-NAT-D100',	NULL,	'Introducing the Accura Oval Table Top, a masterpiece crafted from the finest teak wood. This table is the epitome of elegance and quality, designed to elevate your living space with its unique shape and size.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of this exquisite piece is the teak wood top, a material renowned for its natural beauty and durability. Teak wood boasts a warm, rich hue that exudes timeless charm, and it has long been celebrated for its resistance to the elements, making it the perfect choice for both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nThe oval shape of the table is not just aesthetically pleasing but also functional. It offers a spacious surface area that accommodates gatherings of all sizes, whether you’re hosting an intimate dinner for two or a lively gathering of friends and family.\r\n\r\nWhat sets the Accura Oval Table Top apart is its ability to seamlessly blend comfort with durability. Teak wood, known for its strength and longevity, ensures that this table will be a centerpiece in your home for generations to come. Its natural grains and textures add character and sophistication to any space, whether it’s a cozy dining nook or a sunlit outdoor patio.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 01:33:31',	'2023-11-25 02:33:48'),
(1497,	'AVA DINING ROUND TABLE D 100',	'AV-GR-D110',	NULL,	'AVA Outdoor Table is a stylish, modern, and durable outdoor table designed specifically for outdoor use. It is crafted using galvanized steel, a material known for its exceptional resistance to rust, corrosion, and other environmental factors. Galvanized steel is coated with a layer of zinc, which serves as a protective barrier against moisture, UV rays, and harsh weather conditions, thereby extending the table’s lifespan and ensuring its suitability for outdoor environments.\r\nThe table’s construction of galvanized steel offers several advantages. Firstly, it provides excellent durability, allowing the table to withstand regular use and exposure to various outdoor elements without deteriorating. This makes it a reliable and long-lasting choice for outdoor settings.\r\nFurthermore, the galvanized steel coating protects against rust and corrosion but also adds a sleek and modern look to the table. It can complement a wide range of outdoor aesthetics, whether it be contemporary, industrial, or traditional styles.\r\nAVA Outdoor Table is designed to withstand the rigors of outdoor environments, including rain, humidity, and direct sunlight. Its galvanized steel construction ensures that it remains sturdy and intact, even under challenging conditions. This makes it an ideal choice for patios, gardens, decks, or any outdoor space where you would like to add functionality and style.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 01:48:32',	'2023-11-25 01:49:52'),
(1498,	'VIBE DINING TABLE L 180',	'VIB-ODT-L180',	NULL,	'Sturdy and durable piece of furniture designed for outdoor use. The table features a top made of high-quality teak wood, which is known for its strength, resistance to weather and insects, and beautiful natural grain patterns. The natural teak wood finish gives the table a warm and inviting look that complements any outdoor setting. The table frame and legs are made of galvanized steel, which provides excellent corrosion resistance and structural support. The steel frame and legs are powder-coated for added durability and to prevent rust, ensuring that the table can withstand the elements and last for years to come. Sleek and modern design, with clean lines and a minimalist aesthetic, will add a touch of style to any outdoor space.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-11-25 01:58:16',	'2023-11-25 01:59:54'),
(1499,	'REUNION MODULAR SOFA (MIDDLE)',	'OSR91-SR-M',	NULL,	'Transform your outdoor space with the versatile and stylish Reunion Modular sofa set. Handcrafted with synthetic Rattan woven over a sturdy aluminum frame, this furniture is built to last. The modular design allows for various configurations, making it perfect for any patio, deck, or backyard. Experience comfort and elegance with the Reunion Modular sofa set. Shop now and elevate your outdoor living experience.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-11-25 02:08:36',	'2023-11-25 02:12:27'),
(1500,	'MARINA SOFA 3 SEATER',	'MRS-C165-3ST',	NULL,	'Indulge in the ultimate luxury comfort with this stunning sofa, crafted with a sturdy Teak wood base, Olefin rope weaving over an aluminium frame and hardware made from stainless steel for tough weather. The sleek and elegant design is perfect for Hotels, resorts, and Porsche homes, providing a resort-style living experience. The Olefin rope weaving adds a unique touch of style to the sofa, while the aluminium frame ensures durability and stability. Whether you’re lounging by the pool or enjoying a sunset view, this sofa is sure to impress with its great aesthetics and unbeatable comfort. Upgrade your living space with this exceptional piece of furniture and experience the ultimate in luxury living.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-11-25 02:27:31',	'2023-11-25 02:28:54'),
(1501,	'MARINA LOUNGE CHAIR',	'MRS-C165-1ST',	NULL,	'Indulge in the ultimate luxury comfort with this stunning sofa, crafted with a sturdy Teak wood base, Olefin rope weaving over an aluminum frame, and hardware made from stainless steel for tough weather. The sleek and elegant design is perfect for Hotels, resorts, and Porsche homes, providing a resort-style living experience. The Olefin rope weaving adds a unique touch of style to the sofa, while the aluminum frame ensures durability and stability. Whether you’re lounging by the pool or enjoying a sunset view, this sofa is sure to impress with its great aesthetics and unbeatable comfort. Upgrade your living space with this exceptional piece of furniture and experience the ultimate in luxury living.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-11-25 02:33:48',	'2023-11-25 02:35:38'),
(1502,	'RIO SOFA 3 SEATER',	'OSS97-JB-3STR',	NULL,	'Introducing our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa, where the luxury of your living room meets the serenity of the outdoors. Crafted with meticulous design, this sofa is your invitation to bask in the fresh air of your garden or unwind under the radiant sun while enveloped in unparalleled comfort.\r\n\r\nDesigned with a generous depth, our sofa embraces you in a cocoon of relaxation, offering a retreat from the demands of the day. The all-weather fiber, carefully selected for its durability, ensures a lasting and elegant aesthetic, making this sofa a timeless addition to your outdoor sanctuary.\r\n\r\nCustomization is at the heart of our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa. Choose from a range of fabric options in different types and colors, allowing you to tailor the sofa to seamlessly blend with your outdoor theme. From subtle neutrals to vibrant hues, we offer a palette to suit every taste and style.\r\n\r\nThe price of our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa includes cushions made with high-quality olefin sunproof HDF, providing not only plush support but also resistance to the elements. For those seeking alternative fabric brands such as Sunbrella and more, please don\'t hesitate to contact us for a personalized touch.\r\n\r\nElevate your outdoor living experience with the perfect blend of sophistication, durability, and comfort. Our Outdoor Comfort Rio Sofa is more than just furniture; it\'s an oasis of tranquility where the beauty of nature meets the luxury of home.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-11-25 02:43:58',	'2024-03-14 21:07:56'),
