(1511,	'MIAMI SOFA DX-CUSHION COVER SEAT',	'MS-DX-CV-SEAT',	NULL,	'The Miami Sofa DX-Cushion Cover Seat redefines contemporary comfort with its chic design and sumptuous feel. This stylish seating solution effortlessly blends modern aesthetics and functionality, featuring clean lines and a sophisticated color palette to enhance any living space. Crafted with precision, the DX-Cushion Cover adds a touch of opulence, ensuring both durability and easy maintenance. The ergonomic design of the seat promises a luxurious lounging experience, making it the ideal focal point for relaxation and entertainment. Elevate your home with the Miami Sofa DX-Cushion Cover Seat—a perfect synthesis of style and comfort for the discerning homeowner.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2023-12-06 02:03:44',	'2023-12-06 02:04:58'),
(1512,	'SUN LOUNGER CUSHION T5',	'SL-C5-SP167',	NULL,	'Sun Lounger Cushion is designed for outdoor use and is made from Sunproof Olefin fabric, which is resistant to sunlight and other outdoor elements. The cushion is filled with Quick Dry foam, which has a thickness of 5 cm on the seat, providing maximum comfort for users.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the foam, the cushion also has a layer of polyester fiber, which adds an extra layer of softness and comfort. The cushion also features anti-slip backing fabric to prevent it from slipping off the lounger, making it safer and more\r\n\r\nDesigned to provide users with a comfortable and safe outdoor lounging experience. Its durable and high-quality materials make it a reliable choice for anyone looking to enjoy the outdoors in comfort',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2023-12-06 23:22:57',	'2023-12-07 00:30:18'),
(1513,	'SAUD COFFEE TABLE',	'SD-CD90-STD',	NULL,	'The Saud Coffee Table is a furniture item that features a top surface made of teakwood slates and a frame constructed of galvanized and powder-coated steel. The teakwood slates on the top surface give the table a natural and rustic appearance, while the galvanized steel frame provides a sturdy and durable foundation. The powder coating on the steel helps protect against rust and other forms of corrosion, making the table ideal for use both indoors and outdoors. Overall, the combination of materials used in the Saud Coffee Table results in a stylish and functional piece of furniture that is both practical and visually appealing.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-06 23:52:21',	'2023-12-06 23:54:08'),
(1514,	'MADISON TWIN COFFEE TABLE',	'MTCT-GS-D60-80',	NULL,	'Features a sleek and modern design, made with a sturdy Galvanized steel frame and a durable Phenolic top. The Galvanized steel provides a robust and long-lasting structure, while the Phenolic top offers a smooth and resistant surface that is easy to clean and maintain. The combination of these materials creates a coffee table that is not only stylish but also functional and practical, perfect for any living room or office space. Whether you need a place to rest your drinks or display your favorite decor, this coffee table is the ideal solution for your needs.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 00:05:18',	'2023-12-07 00:08:16'),
(1515,	'EYRIE COFFEE TABLE',	'ERY-CFT-STD',	NULL,	'Experience the beauty of the EYRIE outdoor collection and embodies a sense of chic sophistication that is to the point and always in style. Its clean lines, streamlined silhouette, and minimalist features, the perfect addition to your deck, porch, or balcony. made of durable and sustainable Vero Rehau Fiber and Aluminum. With a cushioned seat for ultimate comfort, you’ll want to spend your entire day lounging on this piece. It’s perfect for relaxing in the sun, reading a book, and of course, taking in nature’s beauty.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 01:17:14',	'2023-12-07 02:26:07'),
(1516,	'EYRIE SIDE TABLE',	'ERY-ST-STD',	NULL,	'Eyrie Side Table, where clean lines and a streamlined silhouette converge to create a minimalist masterpiece. Designed to capture attention without being ostentatious, this outdoor furniture piece seamlessly integrates into your outdoor space, offering a touch of contemporary charm.\r\n\r\nConstructed with durability and sustainability in mind, the Eyrie Side Table is forged from the finest materials—Vero Rehau Fiber and Aluminum. This winning combination not only ensures longevity but also underscores our commitment to eco-conscious craftsmanship. The result is a statement piece that stands the test of time while leaving a minimal ecological footprint.\r\n\r\nThe allure of the Eyrie Side Table extends beyond its visual appeal; a cushioned seat beckons you to experience ultimate comfort. Whether you’re soaking up the sun, reading a book, or savoring nature’s serenity, this table transforms into your sanctuary. With its ergonomic design and padded seat, this spot offers a harmonious blend of style and relaxation for unwinding.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 01:35:03',	'2023-12-07 01:46:01'),
(1517,	'PACIFIC SIDE TABLE',	'PCF-SDT-STD',	NULL,	'The Pacific side table boasts a sleek and modern design, featuring a robust aluminum frame that not only ensures durability but also adds a touch of contemporary elegance to any space. The marriage of form and function is exemplified in its construction, where the aluminum frame provides a sturdy foundation while maintaining a lightweight and easy-to-move quality.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure, the Pacific side table incorporates the timeless appeal of wicker/rattan. The intertwining fibers create a visually appealing texture that not only complements the clean lines of the aluminum frame but also infuses a natural and organic feel. This combination of materials not only enhances the aesthetic appeal of the side table but also contributes to its versatility, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.\r\n\r\nThe Pacific side table is not merely a piece of furniture; it’s a statement of style and practicality. Its thoughtful design allows it to seamlessly blend into various design schemes, from contemporary to coastal, adding a touch of sophistication to any setting. Whether you place it next to a modern sofa in a living room, on a sun-drenched patio, or as an accent piece in a stylish bedroom, the Pacific side table stands as a testament to the fusion of form and functionality.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 01:57:27',	'2023-12-07 01:58:27'),
(1518,	'BARCELONA SIDE TABLE L53',	'BST-53-STD',	NULL,	'Barcelona Side Table is an exquisite piece of furniture designed to enhance the aesthetics of your living space while providing functionality and style. It is constructed with a sturdy frame made of White Matte Aluminum, giving it a modern and clean appearance. The use of aluminum not only adds durability but also a sleek and contemporary touch to the table.\r\n\r\nThe weaving material used for the tabletop is Seashell FF 30 in White Wash by Rehau, a renowned company known for producing high-quality synthetic weaving materials. This particular weaving material offers a unique blend of elegance and resilience, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 02:04:10',	'2023-12-07 02:06:46'),
(1519,	'BARCELONA COFFEE TABLE',	'BCT-120-STD',	NULL,	'Barcelona Coffee Table is a testament to the seamless fusion of contemporary design and practical functionality. This exquisite piece of furniture is more than just a table; it’s a statement of style that effortlessly enhances your living space.\r\n\r\nCrafted with meticulous attention to detail, the Barcelona Coffee Table exudes chic aesthetics that are sure to captivate the discerning eye. Its clean lines, elegant curves, and thoughtfully chosen materials create a visual masterpiece that complements any modern interior.\r\n\r\nBut this coffee table isn’t merely a feast for the eyes; it’s also a celebration of convenience. The ample surface provides the perfect canvas for both decor and daily essentials, allowing you to showcase your favorite art pieces, and books, or simply enjoy a clutter-free living space. The Barcelona Coffee Table becomes the epicenter of your room, drawing people together and encouraging moments of connection.\r\nElevate your space with a touch of contemporary elegance, where every detail tells a story of refined taste and a commitment to quality living. Choose the Barcelona Coffee Table, where the art of living is truly redefined.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 02:17:16',	'2023-12-07 02:18:45'),
(1520,	'PANAMA SIDE TABLE',	'PST-99-JB-45',	NULL,	'Panama Side Table is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed for both indoor and outdoor use. Crafted with precision and attention to detail, it combines VIRO/REHAU woven material with a durable aluminum frame, resulting in a versatile and eye-catching addition to your living space or patio. a well-crafted and versatile piece of furniture that combines the elegance of VIRO/REHAU woven material with the durability of an aluminum frame. Its modern design and resilience to the elements make it an excellent choice.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-07 02:23:33',	'2023-12-07 02:26:38'),
(1521,	'PANAMA UMBRELLA S250',	'PANUMB-GREY-S249',	NULL,	'Panama Umbrella with a myriad of shapes, colors, and sizes, your branding impact is unlimited. our talented in-house designers will match your brand colors and logos to give you an all-year-round billboard just the way you want.\r\nPanama umbrella not only comes with an easy swing handle to open and shut but another 3-position tilt mechanism to give you shade the way you want it. The umbrella also comes with a 360° rotation. The umbrella comes with a marble, granite, and water base, which weighs approximately 100-120 kilograms, and it’s suitable for ground mounting.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	70,	'2023-12-07 02:44:27',	'2023-12-07 02:48:08'),
(1522,	'TIARA ROUND D365 PARASOL',	'UMB365RC-NAT-D365',	NULL,	'The TIARA umbrella is a high-quality outdoor umbrella designed for durability and style. It features a teak wood frame that is known for its strength and resistance to weathering. The canopy is made of Sunbrella or Sun proof fabric, which is known for its resistance to fading and staining. The solid brass fittings and ribs add to the umbrella’s elegance and longevity.\r\n\r\nThe ribs are wrapped with 16 pieces of solid brass collar, which not only adds to the visual appeal of the umbrella but also helps to strengthen the overall structure. The mechanism used for opening and closing the umbrella is the Pulley and Drawstring Lift, which makes it easy to use and reliable.\r\n\r\nTIARA umbrella a premium product designed to enhance your outdoor experience. Whether you are looking for a stylish and durable umbrella for your garden or patio, the TIARA umbrella is an excellent choice.\r\n\r\nD 365 cm Round\r\nFrame : 8 ribs (30 mm x 20 mm)\r\nRibs: Wrapped with 16 pieces of solid brass collar\r\nMechanism: Pulley and Drawstring Lift\r\nBrass pin (straight) with chain\r\n50 mm diameter pole x 2.6 m length\r\nWeight: 17 kg\r\nVolume:0.15 m³',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	70,	'2023-12-07 03:18:19',	'2024-02-03 19:01:30'),
(1523,	'ACCURA UMBRELLA STAND',	'ACU-USTN-SST-S55',	NULL,	'The Accura Umbrella Stand is a sleek and functional accessory designed to keep your umbrellas organized and within easy reach. Crafted with high-quality materials, it offers a sturdy base to securely hold both large and small umbrellas, preventing them from tipping over. Its minimalist and modern design complements any home or office decor while helping to maintain a clutter-free and organized space, making it a practical addition for rainy days and a stylish accessory year-round.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	83,	'2023-12-07 03:25:54',	'2023-12-07 03:26:50'),
