(1529,	'FLORENCE DINING TABLE',	'FDT-TB-D135',	NULL,	'The Florence Dining Table epitomizes sophistication, featuring a luxurious marble top elegantly complemented by a teak wood base. With a tasteful design, this table blends timeless aesthetics with modern functionality. Its construction allows for convenient assembly and disassembly, offering a seamless balance between style and practicality.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2023-12-12 20:12:16',	'2023-12-12 20:14:49'),
(1530,	'PUBLIKA  STEAMBOAT TABLE ',	'PLA-SMB-L130',	NULL,	'A steamboat table, also known as a hot pot table, is a unique dining experience that brings people together for interactive and communal cooking. Typically featured in Asian cuisine, this dining setup involves a central pot of simmering broth placed on the table. Diners then cook a variety of raw ingredients such as thinly sliced meat, vegetables, and noodles directly in the pot. The shared experience of cooking and enjoying a customizable meal at the table fosters a social atmosphere, making steamboat tables a popular choice for gatherings with family and friends. It offers a delightful combination of fresh ingredients, flavorful broths, and a participatory dining experience that adds an element of fun to the meal.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2023-12-12 20:45:00',	'2024-03-13 22:45:39'),
(1531,	'KOORG DINING TABLE L120',	'KRG-TB-L120',	NULL,	'Simple and elegant dining table.\r\nMade from premium Teak wood.\r\nAvailable in various sizes.\r\nSuitable for homes, resorts as well as fine dining restaurants.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2023-12-12 21:08:23',	'2024-06-29 20:13:15'),
(1532,	'MERIA DINING CHAIR',	'MRA-DNC-TB',	NULL,	'MERIA Dining Chair is a stylish and comfortable seating option designed for dining spaces and other areas in the home. It is crafted using a combination of Rubber Wood and Rattan Natural, which makes it durable and visually appealing.\r\nThe chair frame is constructed from Rubber Wood, a sturdy and sustainable hardwood known for its strength and resistance to wear. This ensures the chair’s longevity, making it suitable for everyday use in various settings.\r\nThe backrest and possibly the seat portion feature Rattan Natural, a material derived from the rattan palm plant. Rattan is known for its natural, woven texture, providing a rustic and organic aesthetic to the chair. Rattan also adds a touch of warmth and nature-inspired beauty to the overall design.\r\nFor added comfort, the chair comes with a cushioned seat, which can be upholstered with either PU (Polyurethane) or Fabric material. PU cushioning offers a leather-like feel, easy maintenance, and excellent durability, while Fabric cushioning provides a softer, cozy feel and can come in a variety of colors and patterns to suit different interior styles.\r\nThe combination of Rubber Wood, Rattan Natural, and the cushioning material makes the MERIA Dining Chair a blend of natural elements and modern comfort. Whether used as dining chairs or as accent pieces in other parts of the home, these chairs are designed to elevate the overall ambiance and provide a comfortable and stylish seating option.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2023-12-12 21:28:20',	'2024-06-29 22:44:29'),
(1533,	'SANZIO DINING CHAIR',	'SZ-BL-STD',	NULL,	'SANZIO DINING CHAIR is a premium dining chair crafted from high-quality solid wood, ensuring durability and longevity. The chair features a sleek and elegant design, making it a perfect addition to any dining room or kitchen.\r\n\r\nThe main body of the chair is finished in a timeless black color, adding a touch of sophistication and versatility to its overall appearance. The black finish complements various interior styles, ranging from modern to traditional, making it a versatile choice for different dining room aesthetics.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of the SANZIO DINING CHAIR is its unique rattan backrest. The backrest is designed with natural rattan, providing a beautiful and organic texture that adds a touch of warmth and comfort to the chair’s overall design. The natural rattan blends well with the solid wood frame, creating an eye-catching contrast that elevates the chair’s visual appeal.\r\n\r\nTo further enhance its elegance, the chair is embellished with gold-colored shoes. These gold accents serve as decorative elements and provide a luxurious touch to the chair’s legs. The combination of black, natural rattan, and gold shoes creates a harmonious and sophisticated look, making the SANZIO DINING CHAIR a statement piece in any dining setting.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the chair’s solid wood construction ensures sturdiness and stability, making it suitable for everyday use and accommodating various body types comfortably. The ergonomic design of the seat and backrest provides adequate support for long hours of dining or socializing around the table.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2023-12-12 21:35:47',	'2024-06-29 22:48:08'),
(1534,	'SERENE BAR CHAIR',	'SRN-BRC-AM1',	NULL,	'SERENE BAR CHAIR is a stylish and comfortable bar chair designed for use in bars, kitchens, or other elevated seating areas. The primary material used in its construction is Rubber Wood, known for its durability and attractive grain pattern. Rubber Wood is a popular choice for furniture due to its eco-friendly nature as it comes from the rubber tree, which is primarily grown for latex production.\r\n\r\nThe chair is designed with comfort in mind, featuring a cushioned seat and backrest. The cushion material comes in two options: PU (Polyurethane) or Fabric. PU is a synthetic material that offers a leather-like texture, providing a sleek and easy-to-clean surface. On the other hand, Fabric cushions offer a softer and more comfortable feel, and they come in various colors and patterns to match different interior styles.\r\n\r\nThe combination of Rubber Wood and cushioned seating makes the SERENE BAR CHAIR a perfect blend of elegance, durability, and comfort, making it an inviting seating option for individuals or guests looking to relax and enjoy their time at a bar or kitchen counter.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2023-12-12 23:50:59',	'2023-12-12 23:52:41'),
(1535,	'BAHAMAS SQUARE BAR BASE',	'BMS-S55-102.5',	NULL,	'The Bahamas bar base is a type of bar railing or balustrade made from mild steel, which is known for its strength and durability. Mild steel is a popular material choice for construction and fabrication due to its affordability and excellent mechanical properties. This makes the Bahamas bar base suitable for providing support, safety, and aesthetic appeal in various settings.\r\n\r\nThe bar base is designed to be sturdy and long-lasting, ensuring it can withstand the stresses and strains associated with its intended use. It is commonly used in outdoor areas, balconies, terraces, and staircases to provide a protective barrier and prevent falls.\r\n\r\nOne of the notable features of the Bahamas bar base is its availability in various colors. This means that customers have the option to choose from a range of finishes to complement the overall design and style of their space. The color options allow for customization and flexibility in incorporating the bar base into different architectural themes and decor.\r\n\r\nOverall, the Bahamas bar base made from mild steel is a practical and aesthetically pleasing solution for those seeking a durable and customization railing system for their property.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	14,	'2023-12-13 00:05:02',	'2023-12-13 01:05:20'),
(1536,	'GRENADA PIZZA TRAY XL',	'PZ88-NAT-16',	NULL,	'Grenada Pizza Tray is a practical kitchen tool designed to simplify the process of handling medium and large-sized pizzas, appetizers, and side dishes when baking or serving. Crafted from solid teak wood, this pizza tray offers durability, longevity, and an aesthetically pleasing appearance. Compared to conventional trays, the teak wood material is not only sturdier but also more straightforward to clean, making it a convenient addition to your kitchen essentials.\r\n\r\nThe Grenada Pizza Tray is available in three standard sizes, each tailored to accommodate pizzas of varying dimensions. The P Z 88 XL variant is specifically designed for extra-large pizzas, featuring a generous tray diameter of 40 cm (16 inches). This ample size ensures that even the most sizable pizzas can be comfortably moved to and from the oven, making the cooking and serving process more manageable.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a professional chef or a home cook, the Grenada Pizza Tray offers a stylish and efficient solution for preparing and serving pizzas, appetizers, and sides. Its solid teak wood construction, coupled with its range of standard sizes, makes it a versatile and reliable tool for any kitchen.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2023-12-13 00:44:06',	'2023-12-13 00:46:38'),
(1537,	'GRENADA PIZZA TRAY L',	'PZ88-NAT-14',	NULL,	'Conveniently move medium and large size pizzas, appetisers or even sides to and from your oven with this pizza tray.\r\nBeing made of solid teak wood, it lasts longer and is easier to clean than other traditional trays.\r\nComes in 3 standard sizes following the standard pizza sizes. P Z 88 L is for large pizzas with a tray diameter of 35 cm (14 inches).',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2023-12-13 00:50:29',	'2023-12-13 00:52:46'),
