(1544,	'RIO BAR TABLE SQUARE 80',	'RIO-BT-S80',	NULL,	'The Rio Bar Table is not only a sleek and sophisticated addition to any bar or kitchen, but it also offers a myriad of other benefits that make it a truly outstanding choice for homes, restaurants, and cafes.\r\n\r\nCrafted with meticulous attention to detail, this table showcases a stunning design that exudes elegance and style. Its sleek and contemporary appearance effortlessly blends with various interior themes, enhancing the overall aesthetic appeal of any space. Whether you’re looking to create a chic and modern atmosphere or a more refined and classic ambiance, the Rio Bar Table is versatile enough to complement any decor.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of this table is its exceptional durability. Constructed with phenolic, a high-quality synthetic material commonly used in high-end furniture, the Rio Bar Table is built to withstand the test of time. Its robust construction ensures that even after years of frequent use, the tabletop will retain its original beauty, looking as stunning as the day you first brought it home. Whether it’s accidental spills, constant cleaning, or heavy use, this table is engineered to maintain its pristine condition, providing you with long-lasting enjoyment.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2023-12-15 00:14:06',	'2023-12-15 00:22:36'),
