(1552,	'MADRID COFFEE TABLE ',	'MCT-GRC-STD',	NULL,	'The Madrid Coffee Table is a versatile piece designed for both outdoor and indoor settings, adding charm and functionality to any space. Its Glass Reinforced Concrete top ensures durability and a sleek modern look, perfect for braving the elements outdoors while maintaining an elegant appeal indoors. Supported by a Teakwood base, this table brings a natural, timeless aesthetic, making it an ideal choice for various environments. Enjoy style and durability combined in one exquisite piece, whether enhancing your outdoor patio or complementing your indoor living area.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2023-12-16 02:14:10',	'2023-12-16 02:15:29'),
(1553,	'TIARA PLANTER S45',	'TP-NAT-S45',	NULL,	'Transform your indoor or outdoor space into a stunning oasis with the Tiara Planter collection, crafted from premium-grade teak wood for unparalleled durability and longevity. These stylish planters are the perfect investment for cafes, gardens, and living spaces, adding a touch of elegance and natural beauty to any setting. Designed with a classic and timeless aesthetic, the Tiara Planters blend seamlessly with any decor, available in various sizes to accommodate a wide range of plants. Plus, teak wood is a sustainable and eco-friendly choice, making these planters an environmentally responsible option for the eco-conscious consumer. Browse our collection today and elevate your surroundings with the beauty of nature.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2023-12-16 03:05:33',	'2023-12-16 03:07:40'),
