(1556,	'NUSA TOWEL STORAGE',	'NSA-TWR-L120',	NULL,	'Designed to hold towels and other similar items. It is made with a combination of materials, including teak wood and powder-coated aluminum plates.\r\n\r\nTeak wood is used to create the main frame of the storage unit. This provides a sturdy and durable base for towels to rest on. Teak wood is known for its natural resistance to water and moisture. This makes it a great choice for a storage unit used in the swimming pool area and at the beach or all outdoor and indoor spaces.\r\n\r\nPowder-coated aluminum plate is used to create the shelves of the storage unit. This material is lightweight and resistant to rust and corrosion, making it ideal for use in a bathroom or other high-moisture environment.\r\n\r\nIn addition, equipped with caster wheels, which make it easy to move the storage unit around as needed.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2023-12-16 03:41:27',	'2023-12-16 03:44:08'),
