(1558,	'TAHITI ROUND TABLE',	'TRT-D119',	NULL,	'\"The Tahiti Round Table blends elegance and durability, making it a standout piece for any space. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, its top features Sintered Stone, renowned for its robustness and resistance to scratches, heat, and stains. This material ensures enduring beauty and easy maintenance, perfect for everyday use.\r\n\r\nComplementing the sophisticated top is a sturdy frame constructed from high-quality Teak, renowned for its natural strength and weather-resistant properties. The combination of Sintered Stone and Teak exudes a harmonious balance of modernity and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nDesigned with convenience in mind, the table boasts a Knock Down Construction, allowing for easy assembly and disassembly, providing flexibility in transportation and storage without compromising on its structural integrity.\r\n\r\nWith its chic design, resilient materials, and practical construction, the Tahiti Round Table invites gatherings and conversations, whether indoors or outdoors, promising both style and functionality for years to come.\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2023-12-18 21:44:23',	'2023-12-18 21:51:17'),
