(1566,	'TAHITI DAYBED',	'HUT-DB-STD',	NULL,	'\"\r\nThe TAHITI DAYBED is a stunning blend of elegance and modern design, meticulously crafted to elevate outdoor lounging. This exquisite daybed boasts a fusion of premium teak wood and sleek aluminum, harmonizing durability with contemporary style.\r\n\r\nConstructed with the finest teak wood, known for its exceptional strength and natural resistance to outdoor elements, the TAHITI DAYBED promises longevity without compromising on aesthetics. The rich, warm tones and distinct grain of the teak wood exude a timeless appeal, accentuating the sophistication of the daybed.\r\n\r\nComplementing the teak wood frame is the incorporation of aluminum, adding a touch of modernity and functionality. The aluminum components contribute to the daybed\'s structural integrity while imparting a sleek, minimalist aesthetic. This pairing of materials not only ensures resilience against varying weather conditions but also creates a striking visual contrast that embodies modern luxury.\r\n\r\nDesigned with comfort in mind, the TAHITI DAYBED features sumptuous cushions upholstered in premium outdoor fabric. The plush cushions offer an inviting retreat, inviting relaxation and leisure in a chic and inviting manner.\r\n\r\nThe sleek lines and thoughtful craftsmanship of the TAHITI DAYBED make it a focal point in any outdoor setting, whether it\'s a sprawling patio, a serene garden, or a stylish poolside retreat. Its versatile design seamlessly integrates into various outdoor décors, adding an air of sophistication and relaxation.\r\n\r\nWith its blend of teak wood\'s timeless charm and aluminum\'s contemporary allure, the TAHITI DAYBED redefines outdoor lounging, offering a luxurious retreat to unwind and indulge in moments of tranquility and style.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial: Allumnium & Teak wood<br>',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-12-27 21:30:25',	'2023-12-27 22:31:12'),
(1567,	'MIAMI LAZY CHAIR',	'MMI-LZY-BTM',	NULL,	'Introducing the Miami Lazy Chair: a sleek fusion of comfort and convenience. This chair features an aluminum frame, ensuring durability and portability. Its Batyline Mesh offers both support and breathability. With a folding design, it’s effortlessly versatile for any space or adventure.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-12-28 21:20:53',	'2023-12-28 21:38:18'),
(1568,	'TIARA SOFA 1 SEATER',	'TSF01-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the TIARA SOFA 1 seater, a testament to the allure of Danish Design. Reflecting balanced proportions and sleek lines, this piece is crafted from premium solid Teak wood, promising years of enduring charm and comfort. Versatile and adaptable, it seamlessly complements various settings, be it residential or commercial spaces. Featuring cushions filled with HDF foam and adorned in 100% solution dyed Acrylic fabric, this sofa strikes the perfect harmony between sophistication and resilience, making it an ideal choice for those seeking enduring elegance and comfort.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2023-12-29 23:53:21',	'2023-12-30 00:00:37'),
