(1570,	'OUTDOOR BEAN BAG',	'OBB03-00-STD',	NULL,	'\"Introducing our Outdoor Bean Bag, a fusion of style and comfort for your outdoor oasis! Crafted from high-quality 100% dyed acrylic, this contemporary-styled bean bag offers durability and a vibrant, fade-resistant solid color pattern that enhances any outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nDesigned with convenience in mind, it comes with a childproof closure, ensuring safety for little ones. Its UV-resistant fabric shields against harsh sunlight, maintaining its allure. Ready-filled for immediate use, it features a removable cover for effortless machine washing, making maintenance a breeze.\r\n\r\nThis bean bag includes a liner for added durability and ease of use, perfect for residential spaces. Embrace relaxation and leisure in your outdoor haven with this versatile, stylish, and easy-to-care-for bean bag, delivering both functionality and flair to your outdoor living experience.\r\n\r\nMaterial:Outdoor Fabric UV Resistant\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	99999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-01-02 20:42:52',	'2024-01-02 20:45:41'),
