(1575,	'RITZ TERRAZZO TABLE TOP D60',	'RTZ-TT-D60-DGA04',	NULL,	'\"The RITZ Terrazzo Table Top embodies elegance and durability with its premium quality terrazzo material. Crafted to elevate any space, this table top showcases meticulous artisanship and superior materials, delivering a perfect blend of style and functionality.\r\n\r\nMade from high-grade terrazzo, each table top is a masterpiece of fine craftsmanship, exhibiting a stunning fusion of marble, quartz, granite, or other aggregates, seamlessly bound with a high-performance resin. This amalgamation ensures resilience against daily use while exuding timeless sophistication.\r\n\r\nThe RITZ Terrazzo Table Top boasts a luxurious finish, characterized by its smooth surface and exquisite detailing. Its premium quality terrazzo not only offers a visually captivating aesthetic but also delivers exceptional durability and resistance to scratches, stains, and wear, ensuring long-lasting beauty.\r\n\r\nDesigned to complement various interior or exterior settings, this table top is versatile and adaptable, promising to be a focal point of sophistication in any space, whether it\'s a chic indoor dining area or an outdoor patio retreat. With its blend of premium materials and exquisite design, the RITZ Terrazzo Table Top stands as a testament to superior craftsmanship and timeless allure.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial : Terrazzo Stone\r\nColor :DGA 04',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 21:44:17',	'2024-05-30 23:33:43'),
(1576,	'RITZ TERRAZZO TABLE TOP L60',	'RTZ-TT-L60-DGA04',	NULL,	'\"The RITZ Terrazzo Table Top embodies elegance and durability with its premium quality terrazzo material. Crafted to elevate any space, this table top showcases meticulous artisanship and superior materials, delivering a perfect blend of style and functionality.\r\n\r\nMade from high-grade terrazzo, each table top is a masterpiece of fine craftsmanship, exhibiting a stunning fusion of marble, quartz, granite, or other aggregates, seamlessly bound with a high-performance resin. This amalgamation ensures resilience against daily use while exuding timeless sophistication.\r\n\r\nThe RITZ Terrazzo Table Top boasts a luxurious finish, characterized by its smooth surface and exquisite detailing. Its premium quality terrazzo not only offers a visually captivating aesthetic but also delivers exceptional durability and resistance to scratches, stains, and wear, ensuring long-lasting beauty.\r\n\r\nDesigned to complement various interior or exterior settings, this table top is versatile and adaptable, promising to be a focal point of sophistication in any space, whether it\'s a chic indoor dining area or an outdoor patio retreat. With its blend of premium materials and exquisite design, the RITZ Terrazzo Table Top stands as a testament to superior craftsmanship and timeless allure.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial : Terrazzo Stone\r\nColor :DGA 04',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 21:53:41',	'2024-05-30 23:34:19'),
(1577,	'GIZZA STONE TABLETOP S60',	'GS-TT-S60',	NULL,	'Introducing our Gizza Stone Table Top: Crafted from durable ceramic, this table top is designed specifically for indoor use, offering a sophisticated and modern touch to any setting. Its robust construction ensures longevity, while its acid-resistant properties guarantee resilience against everyday wear and tear. Elevate your space with this elegant and practical addition, combining style with functionality for your home or office environment.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 22:00:05',	'2024-05-31 00:12:51'),
(1578,	'GIZZA STONE TABLETOP D60',	'GS-TT-D60',	NULL,	'Introducing our Gizza Stone Table Top: Crafted from durable ceramic, this table top is designed specifically for indoor use, offering a sophisticated and modern touch to any setting. Its robust construction ensures longevity, while its acid-resistant properties guarantee resilience against everyday wear and tear. Elevate your space with this elegant and practical addition, combining style with functionality for your home or office environment.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 22:04:35',	'2024-05-30 22:56:44'),
(1579,	'RIO TABLE TOP S60',	'RTT-S60',	NULL,	'A Rio dining table top made of phenolic material is a durable and versatile choice for modern dining spaces. Phenolic resin is known for its strength, moisture resistance, and low maintenance requirements, making it ideal for furniture surfaces.\r\nThe Rio dining table top crafted from phenolic resin typically boasts a sleek and contemporary design, often featuring clean lines and a smooth finish. This material is available in a range of colors and finishes, allowing for customization to suit various interior styles and preferences.\r\nPhenolic table tops are favored for their ability to resist scratches, stains, and heat, making them well-suited for everyday use in busy households. Additionally, they are lightweight compared to some other materials, which adds to their practicality and ease of use.\r\nOverall, a Rio dining table top made of phenolic resin combines durability with modern aesthetics, offering a stylish and functional centerpiece for dining areas.\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 22:11:36',	'2024-05-30 23:16:11'),
(1580,	'RIO TABLETOP D70',	'RTT-D70',	NULL,	'The Rio table top D70 made of phenolic material is a versatile and durable dining surface. With a diameter of 70 centimeters, this circular tabletop offers ample space for dining and socializing.\r\nPhenolic resin is chosen for its toughness, moisture resistance, and ease of maintenance, making it an ideal material for everyday use. The Rio D70 table top showcases a modern design with a smooth finish, available in various colors to suit different decor styles.\r\nThis phenolic table top is highly resistant to scratches, stains, and heat, ensuring longevity and easy upkeep. Its lightweight construction adds to its practicality, allowing for easy movement and placement within dining areas.\r\nIn summary, the Rio tabletop D70 made of phenolic material combines functionality with contemporary aesthetics, providing a durable and stylish centerpiece for dining spaces. ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-01-18 22:22:58',	'2024-05-30 23:26:39'),
(1581,	'GREEN SUKABUMI STONE',	'GSS-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Green Sukabumi Stone, a premier choice for elevating the aesthetics of your swimming pool. Mined from the pristine quarries of Sukabumi, Indonesia, this natural stone boasts a captivating green hue that gracefully transforms your pool into a haven of tranquility and style. Renowned for its unique color retention and cooling properties, the Green Sukabumi Stone not only enhances the visual appeal of your pool but also ensures a refreshing swimming experience. Its non-slip surface and durability make it a perfect blend of beauty and functionality. Upgrade your pool oasis with the timeless charm of Green Sukabumi Stone and indulge in the ultimate luxury of a serene and sophisticated aquatic retreat\r\n\r\nMaterial: Natural stone\r\n Dim (cm): L/W10 x D10 x TH1 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	82,	'2024-03-05 22:10:37',	'2024-03-05 23:22:31'),
(1582,	'KOBE DINING TABLE L150',	'DT204-TB-L150',	NULL,	'KOBE DINING TABLE – an exquisite addition to elevate the ambiance of your dining room. Crafted with precision and sophistication, this elegant table is constructed entirely from 100% reclaimed solid teak wood, embodying a commitment to sustainability and timeless design.\r\n\r\nA statement of refined taste and luxury. Its straight-cut design seamlessly blends eye-catching aesthetics with practical functionality, offering a harmonious balance between form and purpose.\r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the allure of this exceptional dining table, where each detail reflects meticulous craftsmanship and attention to detail. The reclaimed solid teak wood not only lends a touch of opulence but also showcases a commitment to environmental responsibility.\r\n\r\nTransform your dining space into a haven of sophistication with the KOBE DINING TABLE – where luxury meets eco-conscious design. Elevate your dining experience and make a lasting impression with this exquisite centerpiece that transcends trends and stands the test of time.',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	74,	'2024-03-07 20:10:35',	'2024-03-07 20:14:01'),
