(1594,	'PUBLIKA ROUND DINING TABLETOP D80',	'PUB-DT-D80',	NULL,	'Made of High-pressure laminate (HPL) over hardwood plywood with matching HPL or PVC edging. \r\nThey are very popular with restaurants and Cafes for their low cost and easy maintenance. \r\nIt comes in various custom make sizes and in a variety of colors. ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-03-09 03:27:46',	'2024-05-30 23:14:09'),
(1595,	'SABAH SOFA 1 SEATER',	'SBH-1S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Sabah Sofa 1 Seater, a sleek and modern seating solution that seamlessly blends comfort, style, and durability. Crafted with premium quality materials, this one-seater sofa is designed to elevate any outdoor or indoor space with its contemporary aesthetic.\r\n\r\nConstructed with a sturdy aluminum frame, the Sabah Sofa offers exceptional strength and stability while remaining lightweight for easy maneuverability. The frame is meticulously engineered to withstand the rigors of daily use and outdoor elements, ensuring long-lasting performance.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure, the sofa features a unique weaving pattern made of high-grade olefin rope. This innovative material not only enhances the visual appeal of the sofa but also provides a comfortable seating experience. Olefin rope is known for its resistance to moisture, UV rays, and mildew, making it ideal for outdoor furniture that is exposed to varying weather conditions.\r\n\r\nThe single-seater design of the Sabah Sofa offers ample space for lounging and relaxation, making it perfect for enjoying moments of tranquility alone or as part of a larger seating arrangement. Its minimalist yet sophisticated design complements any decor scheme, whether placed on a patio, terrace, or in a contemporary living room.\r\n\r\nWith its blend of modern aesthetics, superior craftsmanship, and premium materials, the Sabah Sofa 1 Seater redefines luxury and comfort in outdoor furniture. Experience relaxation and style like never before with this exquisite piece that promises to be the focal point of any space.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Olefin Rope \r\nFrame: PC Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-03-15 16:45:25',	'2024-04-19 23:25:53'),
(1596,	'SABAH SOFA 2 SEATER',	'SBH-2S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Sabah Sofa 2 Seater, a luxurious seating option designed to elevate your indoor or outdoor living space with its impeccable style and superior comfort. Crafted with precision and care, this two-seater sofa seamlessly combines durability, elegance, and functionality.\r\n\r\nConstructed using high-quality aluminum, the Sabah Sofa 2 Seater offers exceptional strength and stability while remaining lightweight for easy placement and rearrangement. The aluminum frame is meticulously engineered to withstand the elements, ensuring long-lasting durability even in outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure, the sofa features a distinctive weaving pattern made of premium olefin rope. This innovative material not only enhances the visual appeal of the sofa but also provides a comfortable seating experience. Olefin rope is renowned for its resistance to moisture, UV rays, and mildew, making it the perfect choice for outdoor furniture that is exposed to varying weather conditions.\r\n\r\nThe spacious two-seater design of the Sabah Sofa offers ample room for you and your loved ones to relax and unwind in style. Whether used as a standalone piece or as part of a larger seating arrangement, its modern and versatile design effortlessly complements any decor aesthetic.\r\n\r\nWhether placed on a patio, deck, or in a sunroom, the Sabah Sofa 2 Seater exudes luxury and sophistication while providing a cozy retreat for relaxation. Embrace the perfect blend of style and functionality with this exquisite piece of furniture that promises to enhance any setting with its timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Olefin Rope \r\nFrame: PC Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-03-15 16:59:17',	'2024-04-19 23:26:59'),
(1597,	'SABAH SOFA 3 SEATER',	'SBH-3S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Sabah Sofa 3 Seater, a luxurious and spacious seating solution that combines premium materials with contemporary design for the ultimate in comfort and style. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this three-seater sofa redefines relaxation in both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nConstructed with a robust aluminum frame, the Sabah Sofa 3 Seater offers unparalleled durability and stability while maintaining a lightweight profile for easy transportation and rearrangement. Engineered to withstand the elements, the aluminum frame ensures longevity and resilience, making it an ideal choice for outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nEnhancing its aesthetic appeal and comfort, the sofa features a sophisticated weaving pattern crafted from high-quality olefin rope. This innovative material not only adds visual interest to the sofa but also provides a comfortable seating experience. Olefin rope is known for its resistance to moisture, UV rays, and mildew, making it perfect for outdoor furniture that is exposed to varying weather conditions.\r\n\r\nThe generous three-seater design of the Sabah Sofa offers ample space for you and your guests to lounge and unwind in style. Whether used as a centerpiece in an outdoor entertaining area or as a cozy addition to a contemporary living room, its versatile design effortlessly complements any decor scheme.\r\n\r\nWith its blend of durability, elegance, and comfort, the Sabah Sofa 3 Seater invites you to indulge in moments of relaxation and tranquility. Elevate your outdoor or indoor space with this exquisite piece of furniture that exudes sophistication and charm, promising to be a timeless addition to your home.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Olefin Rope \r\nFrame: PC Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-03-15 17:24:06',	'2024-04-19 23:27:49'),
(1598,	'SABAH COFFEE TABLE',	'SBH-CT-L120',	NULL,	'Introducing the Sabah Coffee Table, a harmonious blend of natural elegance and modern design. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this exquisite piece seamlessly combines the warmth of teak wood, the durability of aluminum, and the sophistication of olefin rope weaving.\r\n\r\nAt its core lies a sturdy teak wood top, exuding timeless charm with its rich grains and warm hues. Teak wood is renowned for its resilience to outdoor elements, making it an ideal choice for both indoor and outdoor settings. The slatted design of the table\'s top adds an element of visual interest, providing a subtle texture that enhances its overall appeal.\r\n\r\nComplementing the teak wood top is an aluminum frame, meticulously crafted to provide structural integrity and longevity. Aluminum\'s lightweight yet robust nature ensures that the table remains effortlessly portable while maintaining stability and support.\r\n\r\nAdding a contemporary flair to the design is the intricately weaved olefin rope detailing that wraps around the aluminum frame. Olefin rope not only enhances the aesthetic appeal of the table but also offers exceptional strength and weather resistance, making it suitable for outdoor use in various climates.\r\n\r\nThe Sabah Coffee Table is not just a piece of furniture; it\'s a statement of refined taste and unparalleled craftsmanship. Whether gracing a cozy living room or adorning a sunlit patio, this coffee table elevates any space with its timeless beauty and functional design. Experience the perfect fusion of natural charm and modern sophistication with the Sabah Coffee Table.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teak Wood Top \r\nFrame:Aluminium \r\nWeaving: Olefin Rope',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2024-03-18 21:01:04',	'2024-03-18 22:01:37'),
(1599,	'TRIPOLATANIA 1 SEATER SOFA',	'TPN-1S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Tripolatania 1 Seater – a fusion of elegance and comfort crafted for your living area. Constructed with a sturdy teakwood frame, this seating masterpiece offers both durability and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nWrapped in high-quality PU foam, the Tripolatania ensures superior comfort, inviting you to unwind after a long day. Versatile in design, it seamlessly complements any interior décor, whether contemporary or traditional.\r\n\r\nChoose from a selection of premium materials such as synthetic leather or genuine leather to suit your preferences. Regardless of your choice, each material exudes luxury and adds a touch of sophistication to your space.\r\n\r\nWhether placed in a cozy corner or as a statement piece in your living room, the Tripolatania 1 Seater promises to elevate your lounging experience with its unmatched craftsmanship and refined aesthetics.\r\n\r\nFrame : Teak wood\r\nMaterial : Indoor fabric\r\nFoam : PU',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-03-20 19:25:36',	'2024-06-01 23:47:58'),
(1600,	'TRIPOLATANIA 2 SEATER SOFA',	'TPN-2S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Tripolatania 2 Seater – a blend of exquisite design and unparalleled comfort, tailored for your living area. Crafted with a robust teakwood frame, this seating ensemble embodies both resilience and sophistication.\r\n\r\nIndulge in luxurious relaxation as you sink into the plush PU foam cushions, designed to provide optimal support and comfort. Whether lounging solo or entertaining guests, the Tripolatania 2 Seater ensures a serene and inviting ambiance.\r\n\r\nEnhance the aesthetics of your living space with your choice of premium materials, including synthetic leather or genuine leather upholstery. Each option exudes opulence and adds a touch of refinement to your home décor.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited for the modern home, the Tripolatania 2 Seater effortlessly combines style and functionality. Elevate your lounging experience and create unforgettable moments with this exceptional piece of furniture.\r\n\r\nFrame : Teak wood\r\nMaterial : Indoor fabric\r\nFoam : PU',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-03-20 19:29:10',	'2024-06-01 23:48:39'),
(1601,	'TRIPOLATANIA 3 SEATER SOFA',	'TPN-3S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the Tripolatania 3 Seater – an embodiment of luxury and comfort, meticulously crafted for your living area. Constructed with a durable teakwood frame, this seating masterpiece is built to withstand the test of time while exuding timeless elegance.\r\n\r\nSink into sublime relaxation with the plush PU foam cushions, designed to provide unparalleled comfort and support. Whether enjoying quiet evenings alone or hosting gatherings with loved ones, the Tripolatania 3 Seater offers the perfect sanctuary for every occasion.\r\n\r\nCustomize your seating experience with a choice of premium upholstery materials, including synthetic leather or genuine leather. Each option adds a touch of sophistication to your living space, elevating its aesthetic appeal.\r\n\r\nDesigned to be the focal point of your home, the Tripolatania 3 Seater seamlessly combines style and functionality. Create lasting memories and indulge in unparalleled comfort with this exceptional piece of furniture.\r\n\r\nFrame : Teak wood\r\nMaterial : Indoor fabric\r\nFoam : PU',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-03-20 19:32:23',	'2024-06-01 23:47:10'),
(1602,	'ONYX 3 DINING CHAIR',	'OX3-DC-1',	NULL,	'\"Introducing the exquisite ONYX 3 Dining Chair, where elegance meets durability in a seamless blend of teakwood craftsmanship and luxurious synthetic leather upholstery. Designed to elevate your dining experience, this chair boasts a perfect fusion of timeless aesthetics and modern comfort.\r\n\r\nCrafted from high-quality teakwood, renowned for its strength and natural beauty, the ONYX 3 Dining Chair exudes sophistication and resilience. The teakwood frame is expertly shaped and finished to accentuate its rich grain patterns, showcasing the inherent elegance of the wood.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure, the chair is upholstered with premium synthetic leather, meticulously selected for its softness, durability, and ease of maintenance. The synthetic leather offers the luxurious look and feel of genuine leather while being more resistant to stains and wear, making it an ideal choice for everyday use.\r\n\r\nThe ergonomic design of the ONYX 3 Dining Chair ensures optimal comfort during long meals and gatherings. Its gently curved backrest provides ample support, while the generously padded seat offers a plush seating experience. The sleek silhouette and clean lines of the chair contribute to its versatile appeal, seamlessly complementing a range of interior styles from classic to contemporary.\r\n\r\nWhether adorning a formal dining room or adding a touch of sophistication to a casual dining space, the ONYX 3 Dining Chair is a statement piece that embodies quality craftsmanship, timeless elegance, and unparalleled comfort. Elevate your dining ambiance with this exceptional piece of furniture, where every meal becomes a luxurious affair.\"\r\n\r\n\"Material: Teak Wood \r\nUpholstery: Fabric/Leather\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2024-04-03 15:17:30',	'2024-07-12 00:58:24'),
(1603,	'ONYX BAR CHAIR',	'OBC-ALU-STD',	NULL,	'\"The Onyx Bar Chair exemplifies contemporary elegance and functionality, crafted with precision and durability in mind. This bar chair is designed to elevate the ambiance of any bar area, whether it\'s in a trendy restaurant, a stylish home, or an outdoor patio setting.\r\n\r\nConstructed from premium aluminum, the Onyx Bar Chair offers exceptional strength and resilience while maintaining a lightweight quality for easy handling. Its frame undergoes a meticulous powder coating process, enhancing its resistance to corrosion, scratches, and UV exposure, ensuring longevity even in demanding environments.\r\n\r\nThe design of the Onyx Bar Chair exudes modern sophistication, characterized by clean lines and a sleek silhouette. Its ergonomic construction ensures optimal comfort, making it perfect for extended periods of sitting while enjoying drinks or socializing with friends and guests.\r\n\r\nVersatile and adaptable, the Onyx Bar Chair seamlessly integrates into various decor styles, from contemporary urban spaces to rustic outdoor settings. Its timeless aesthetic and durable construction make it a versatile choice for both indoor and outdoor bar areas.\r\n\r\nWhether used as standalone pieces or paired with matching bar tables, the Onyx Bar Chair adds a touch of refinement to any setting with its understated elegance and superior craftsmanship. With its combination of style, comfort, and durability, the Onyx Bar Chair is the epitome of modern luxury for discerning individuals and establishments alike.\"\r\nMaterial : Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2024-04-03 15:24:06',	'2024-04-03 16:24:39'),
(1604,	'ONYX BAR STOOL',	'OBS-STD',	NULL,	'\"\r\nIntroducing the ONYX Bar Stool, a pinnacle of sophistication and craftsmanship, meticulously crafted from full premium teakwood. This exquisite bar stool combines timeless elegance with the natural allure of teakwood, creating a statement piece that exudes luxury and style.\r\n\r\nCrafted from the finest grade of teakwood, known for its exceptional durability, rich color variations, and resistance to the elements, the ONYX Bar Stool boasts unparalleled quality and longevity. Each stool is expertly constructed to showcase the inherent beauty of teakwood, with its lustrous golden-brown hue, distinct grain patterns, and smooth finish, adding a touch of warmth and organic charm to any space.\r\n\r\nThe design of the ONYX Bar Stool epitomizes modern sophistication, featuring clean lines, a sleek silhouette, and refined detailing. The minimalist aesthetic ensures that this stool seamlessly integrates into a variety of interior styles, from contemporary to transitional, making it a versatile addition to both residential and commercial spaces.\r\n\r\nBeyond its aesthetic appeal, the ONYX Bar Stool offers exceptional comfort and functionality. The contoured seat provides optimal support, while the subtly curved backrest ensures a comfortable seating experience, allowing guests to relax and unwind in style. Additionally, the sturdy construction and footrest provide stability and convenience, making this bar stool ideal for long hours of dining or socializing.\r\n\r\nWhether placed in a stylish kitchen island, a chic bar area, or an outdoor patio setting, the ONYX Bar Stool elevates the ambiance with its understated elegance and superior craftsmanship. Its timeless design and premium materials make it a standout piece that enhances any environment, creating a sophisticated and inviting atmosphere for guests to enjoy.\r\n\r\nExperience the epitome of luxury and comfort with the ONYX Bar Stool, where impeccable design meets unparalleled quality to redefine the art of seating.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial : Teakwood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2024-04-03 15:31:57',	'2024-05-27 16:23:22'),
(1605,	'ONYX 3 BAR STOOL',	'OX3-BS-1',	NULL,	'\"Introducing the ONYX 3 Bar Stool, a stunning fusion of contemporary design and natural elegance. Crafted from full premium teak wood and featuring a luxuriously upholstered seat with synthetic leather, this bar stool embodies sophistication and durability in every detail.\r\n\r\nThe ONYX 3 Bar Stool stands out with its exquisite combination of materials. The frame is expertly crafted from full premium teak wood, renowned for its rich color variations, durability, and resistance to the elements. Each stool showcases the distinctive grain patterns and warm tones inherent to teak wood, adding a touch of organic beauty to any space.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure, the seat of the ONYX 3 Bar Stool is upholstered with high-quality synthetic leather, offering both comfort and style. The synthetic leather provides a soft and supple seating surface while being easy to clean and maintain, making it ideal for high-traffic areas such as bars, kitchen islands, or entertainment spaces.\r\n\r\nDesigned with comfort and functionality in mind, the ONYX 3 Bar Stool features a sleek and ergonomic silhouette. The curved backrest provides excellent lumbar support, while the padded seat ensures a comfortable seating experience for extended periods. The footrest offers added convenience and support, allowing guests to relax and unwind in style.\r\n\r\nVersatile and adaptable, the ONYX 3 Bar Stool complements a range of interior styles, from modern and minimalist to classic and eclectic. Whether used in a contemporary kitchen, a chic bar area, or an outdoor patio setting, this bar stool adds a touch of sophistication and refinement to any space.\r\n\r\nWith its premium materials, expert craftsmanship, and timeless design, the ONYX 3 Bar Stool is not just a piece of furniture—it\'s a statement of luxury and elegance. Elevate your home or establishment with the understated beauty and enduring quality of the ONYX 3 Bar Stool.\"\r\n\r\n\"Material: Teak Wood \r\nUpholstery: Fabric/Leather\"',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2024-04-03 15:40:08',	'2024-05-27 16:24:58'),
(1606,	'ONYX DINING TABLE',	'ONX-TB-L50',	NULL,	'\"Introducing the ONYX Dining Table, a masterful fusion of natural beauty and contemporary design, meticulously crafted to be the centerpiece of your dining area. Crafted with precision and passion, this table epitomizes elegance and durability, offering a perfect balance of form and function.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the ONYX Dining Table lies a captivating tabletop crafted from top-tier teakwood. Renowned for its remarkable strength, resilience, and exquisite grain patterns, teakwood brings a timeless allure to any space. Each plank of teak is carefully selected and expertly arranged to showcase its inherent beauty, resulting in a surface that exudes warmth and sophistication.\r\n\r\nComplementing the stunning teakwood tabletop is a base crafted from bend plywood, adding a touch of modern flair to the design. Engineered for stability and style, the plywood base features graceful curves and clean lines that create a striking contrast against the natural richness of the teakwood. This thoughtful juxtaposition of materials enhances the visual appeal of the table while ensuring robust support for years to come.\r\n\r\nVersatile and functional, the ONYX Dining Table is designed to accommodate gatherings of all sizes, from intimate dinners to festive celebrations. Its spacious surface provides ample room for place settings, culinary creations, and cherished memories, making it the perfect setting for special moments shared with loved ones.\r\n\r\nWhether gracing a formal dining room or serving as a focal point in an open-plan living space, the ONYX Dining Table is sure to make a lasting impression with its impeccable craftsmanship, timeless elegance, and understated luxury. Elevate your dining experience with this exquisite piece of furniture, where every meal becomes a celebration of style and sophistication.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial : Teakwood top Base Bend Plywood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	66,	'2024-04-03 16:00:04',	'2024-04-03 17:05:54'),
(1607,	' ONYX TV CABINET',	'ONX-TV-CNT',	NULL,	'\"Introducing the ONYX TV Cabinet, a luxurious statement piece meticulously crafted from exquisite teakwood to elevate your entertainment area. Designed with both functionality and style in mind, this cabinet seamlessly combines timeless elegance with modern convenience.\r\n\r\nCrafted from premium teakwood, renowned for its natural beauty, durability, and rich grain patterns, the ONYX TV Cabinet exudes sophistication and warmth. Each piece of teak is carefully selected and expertly crafted to showcase the wood\'s unique characteristics, resulting in a stunning piece of furniture that adds a touch of luxury to any living space.\r\n\r\nThe ONYX TV Cabinet features ample storage space, making it perfect for organizing your entertainment essentials. Whether you\'re storing DVDs, gaming consoles, or multimedia devices, the cabinet\'s spacious compartments and drawers provide plenty of room to keep your space neat and organized.\r\n\r\nIn addition to its practical storage capabilities, the ONYX TV Cabinet is designed to showcase your television in style. The sturdy teakwood construction provides a stable and secure base for your TV, while the elegant design adds a touch of sophistication to your entertainment setup.\r\n\r\nVersatile and adaptable, the ONYX TV Cabinet effortlessly complements a range of interior styles, from classic to contemporary. Whether placed in a cozy living room or a stylish entertainment area, this cabinet enhances the ambiance of any space with its timeless charm and understated luxury.\r\n\r\nElevate your entertainment experience with the ONYX TV Cabinet, where exquisite craftsmanship meets functional design to create a truly exceptional piece of furniture that will be cherished for years to come.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teakwood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	56,	'2024-04-03 16:40:35',	'2024-04-03 17:41:03'),
(1608,	'ONYX DINING CHAIR',	'ODC-ALU-STD',	NULL,	'\"The Onyx Dining Chair is a sleek and modern piece of furniture designed to elevate the aesthetic of any dining space. Crafted with precision and style in mind, this chair seamlessly blends contemporary design with durability, making it a perfect addition to both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nConstructed from high-quality aluminum, the Onyx Dining Chair boasts exceptional strength and resilience while remaining lightweight for easy maneuverability. The aluminum frame undergoes a meticulous powder coating process, enhancing its resistance to corrosion, scratches, and fading caused by UV exposure. This coating not only fortifies the chair against the elements but also adds a refined finish, ensuring long-lasting beauty.\r\n\r\nThe chair\'s design features clean lines and a minimalist silhouette, exuding sophistication and modernity. Its ergonomic shape provides optimal comfort during extended periods of use, making it ideal for leisurely dining experiences or engaging in lively conversations around the table.\r\n\r\nThe Onyx Dining Chair is not only a testament to superior craftsmanship but also a versatile piece that complements various decor styles, from chic urban lofts to elegant outdoor patios. Its timeless appeal and durability make it a staple for any design-conscious individual or establishment seeking both functionality and aesthetics in their seating arrangements. Whether used as standalone pieces or paired with matching dining tables, the Onyx Dining Chair promises to elevate the ambiance of any space with its understated elegance and enduring quality.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial: Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2024-04-03 17:27:52',	'2024-05-28 22:18:07'),
(1609,	'ONYX COFFE TABLE',	'ONX-CT-D140',	NULL,	'\"Introducing the ONYX Coffee Table, a captivating blend of top-tier craftsmanship and contemporary design, meticulously crafted to elevate your living space. Constructed with the finest premium teak wood for its unparalleled beauty and durability, this coffee table exudes sophistication and timeless elegance.\r\n\r\nThe ONYX Coffee Table features a stunning tabletop crafted from top-grade teak wood, renowned for its rich grain patterns and natural luster. Each piece of teak is carefully selected and skillfully assembled to showcase the wood\'s inherent beauty, resulting in a striking surface that serves as the focal point of any room.\r\n\r\nComplementing the exquisite teak wood tabletop is a sleek and modern base crafted from bend plywood. Engineered for both style and stability, the plywood base adds a contemporary flair to the table while ensuring robust support for everyday use. Its graceful curves and clean lines create a visually captivating contrast against the warmth of the teak wood, making the ONYX Coffee Table a true statement piece in any interior setting.\r\n\r\nDesigned with versatility in mind, this coffee table is perfectly proportioned to fit seamlessly into a variety of living spaces, from cozy lounges to spacious living rooms. Whether used as a centerpiece for entertaining guests or as a functional surface for everyday living, the ONYX Coffee Table effortlessly combines form and function with its timeless design and impeccable craftsmanship.\r\n\r\nWith its exquisite materials, meticulous attention to detail, and sleek contemporary aesthetic, the ONYX Coffee Table offers the perfect blend of luxury and practicality. Elevate your living space with this stunning piece of furniture, where every moment becomes an opportunity to indulge in refined elegance and unparalleled comfort.\"\r\n\r\nMaterial : Teakwood top Base : Bend plywood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2024-04-03 17:41:01',	'2024-04-03 18:41:36'),
(1610,	'MERCHANDISE CEILING SUSPENSION',	'MCS-L184',	NULL,	'Introducing our exquisite Merchandise Ceiling Suspension crafted meticulously from high-quality teakwood, a product designed to elevate any space with its timeless beauty and functionality.\r\n\r\nConstructed with precision and attention to detail, this ceiling suspension system boasts the natural elegance of teakwood, renowned for its durability and rich, warm tones. Each piece is hand-selected to ensure consistency in grain pattern and color, resulting in a cohesive and luxurious aesthetic.\r\n\r\nThe design of our Merchandise Ceiling Suspension is both versatile and sophisticated, suitable for various settings including retail spaces, galleries, restaurants, and residential interiors. Its sleek and minimalist appearance adds a touch of modernity while seamlessly integrating with a range of interior styles, from contemporary to classic.\r\n\r\nCrafted to suspend merchandise or lighting fixtures effortlessly, this ceiling suspension system offers not only practical functionality but also serves as a statement piece, enhancing the overall ambiance of any environment. Whether used to showcase products, illuminate artworks, or define spatial boundaries, it provides a striking focal point that commands attention.\r\n\r\nMoreover, the inherent resilience of teakwood ensures longevity and resilience, making it an investment piece that withstands the test of time. Its natural resistance to decay and insects, coupled with its strength, guarantees enduring beauty and performance even in demanding environments.\r\n\r\nWith our Merchandise Ceiling Suspension, you not only acquire a functional solution for your space but also a symbol of craftsmanship and sophistication. Elevate your surroundings with the unparalleled charm and quality of teakwood, epitomizing luxury and refinement in every detail.\r\n\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teakwood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2024-04-04 16:48:20',	'2024-04-04 16:52:05'),
(1611,	'PASTRY SHELVES CEILING SUSPENSION',	'PSCS-L113',	NULL,	'Introducing our elegant Pastry Shelves Ceiling Suspension, meticulously handcrafted from premium teakwood, offering a sophisticated solution for displaying pastries and baked goods with style and functionality.\r\n\r\nCrafted with utmost care and attention to detail, each piece of this ceiling suspension system embodies the natural beauty and durability of teakwood. The rich, warm tones and distinctive grain patterns of the wood enhance the visual appeal of any space, creating a welcoming atmosphere that beckons customers to indulge in delectable treats.\r\n\r\nDesigned to suspend from the ceiling, our Pastry Shelves Ceiling Suspension provides a unique and space-saving way to showcase pastries, desserts, and baked goods in bakeries, cafes, patisseries, and other food establishments. The minimalist yet chic design adds a touch of sophistication to any interior, complementing a range of decor styles from contemporary to rustic.\r\n\r\nThe versatility of this suspension system allows for customizable configurations to suit specific needs and spatial requirements. Adjustable shelving provides flexibility in displaying a variety of pastries, while the sturdy teakwood construction ensures stability and reliability, even when laden with delicious confections.\r\n\r\nBeyond its aesthetic appeal, teakwood is renowned for its exceptional durability and resistance to moisture, making it ideal for food-related environments. This ensures that your pastry shelves maintain their pristine appearance and structural integrity over time, even in high-humidity settings such as commercial kitchens.\r\n\r\nInvesting in our Pastry Shelves Ceiling Suspension not only enhances the presentation of your baked goods but also reflects a commitment to quality and craftsmanship. Elevate your bakery or cafe with the timeless beauty and functionality of teakwood, creating an inviting ambiance that leaves a lasting impression on customers.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teakwood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2024-04-04 16:54:45',	'2024-04-04 17:55:09'),
(1612,	'COUNTER SHELVES',	'CS-NCS-L200',	NULL,	'Introducing our exquisite Teak Wood Counter Shelves, meticulously crafted to elevate your retail space or home with sophistication and functionality.\r\n\r\nEach shelf is expertly fashioned from premium teak wood, renowned for its durability, rich color, and distinct grain patterns. The natural beauty of teak wood brings warmth and character to any environment, creating a timeless aesthetic that seamlessly blends with various decor styles.\r\n\r\nDesigned to sit atop countertops or display tables, these shelves offer a versatile solution for showcasing merchandise, collectibles, or decorative items. Whether used in retail stores, galleries, or residential spaces, they add a touch of elegance while maximizing display space.\r\n\r\nThe minimalist design of our Teak Wood Counter Shelves allows the beauty of the wood to take center stage, enhancing the visual appeal of the items on display. The smooth, clean lines and sleek finish accentuate the organic beauty of teak wood, creating a harmonious balance between form and function.\r\n\r\nConstructed with precision and attention to detail, these shelves are built to last. Teak wood\'s natural resistance to moisture, decay, and insects ensures that your shelves maintain their integrity and beauty over time, even in high-traffic areas or humid environments.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, our Teak Wood Counter Shelves are available in a range of sizes and configurations to suit your specific needs and space requirements. Whether you need a single shelf for a small display or multiple shelves for a larger presentation, customization options are available to accommodate your preferences.\r\n\r\nInvest in our Teak Wood Counter Shelves to add a touch of luxury and sophistication to your space while providing a practical and stylish solution for displaying your favorite items. With their timeless beauty and durability, these shelves are sure to become a cherished focal point in any environment.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Teakwood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2024-04-04 16:58:34',	'2024-04-04 17:59:24'),
(1613,	'PAMPORE DINING CHAIR',	'OX3-DC-3',	NULL,	'Introducing the PAMPORE Dining Chair, a stunning blend of contemporary design and durable materials crafted to enhance your dining experience. Crafted with precision from lightweight yet robust aluminum, this chair embodies modern elegance and resilience. Its frame is meticulously engineered to ensure stability while maintaining a sleek and streamlined profile.\r\n\r\nAdding a touch of natural charm, the PAMPORE Dining Chair features intricately woven synthetic rattan, meticulously crafted to mimic the texture and appeal of traditional rattan. This weaving technique not only adds visual interest but also enhances the chair\'s comfort and breathability, making it an ideal choice for long hours of dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe combination of aluminum and synthetic rattan makes the PAMPORE Dining Chair exceptionally weather-resistant, perfect for both indoor and outdoor dining settings. Whether gracing a sunlit patio or a chic dining room, this chair effortlessly elevates any space with its contemporary aesthetic and timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nDesigned with comfort in mind, the PAMPORE Dining Chair features a gently curved backrest and a generously sized seat, providing ergonomic support for extended periods of sitting. Its lightweight construction allows for easy maneuverability, while the stackable design makes storage a breeze, maximizing space when not in use.\r\n\r\nWith its sleek lines, durable construction, and natural accents, the PAMPORE Dining Chair offers a perfect balance of style and functionality. Whether used as standalone pieces or paired with a coordinating dining table, these chairs are sure to make a statement in any setting, creating a welcoming atmosphere for memorable dining experiences.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Synthetic Rattan\r\nFrame: Aluminium',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2024-04-04 19:12:47',	'2024-04-04 20:13:37'),
(1614,	'ALEX DINING CHAIR',	'ALX-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the ALEX Dining Chair, a harmonious fusion of contemporary design and enduring functionality. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this chair is an epitome of sophistication, boasting a seamless blend of premium materials and superior craftsmanship.\r\n\r\nAt its core, the ALEX Dining Chair features a robust frame constructed from high-quality aluminum, ensuring both lightweight maneuverability and exceptional durability. The frame is meticulously powder coated, not only enhancing its aesthetic appeal but also providing added protection against corrosion and wear, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.\r\n\r\nAdding to its allure is the meticulously woven olefin rope, intricately integrated into the frame\'s design. This woven rope not only elevates the chair\'s visual appeal with its captivating texture and modern aesthetic but also offers unparalleled comfort and support. The olefin rope is renowned for its exceptional strength, resistance to fading, and ability to withstand harsh weather conditions, ensuring longevity and ease of maintenance.\r\n\r\nThe ALEX Dining Chair is designed for ultimate comfort, featuring armrests crafted from luxurious teak wood. Renowned for its exquisite grain patterns, natural durability, and resistance to moisture and decay, teak wood adds a touch of warmth and elegance to the chair while providing a comfortable resting place for arms during dining or relaxation.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, practicality meets versatility with the ALEX Dining Chair\'s stackable design, allowing for convenient storage and space-saving solutions when not in use. Whether you\'re furnishing a cozy dining area, a chic patio, or a trendy cafe, the stackable feature of the ALEX Dining Chair ensures effortless rearrangement and organization.\r\n\r\nIn summary, the ALEX Dining Chair embodies a perfect harmony of style, comfort, and durability. With its aluminum powder-coated frame, intricately woven olefin rope, luxurious teak wood armrests, and stackable design, it\'s an exquisite addition to any indoor or outdoor setting, promising years of enjoyment and timeless elegance.\r\n\r\nMaterial : Aluminium frame\r\nWeaving : Olefin Rope\r\nArmrest : Teak wood',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2024-04-04 19:16:28',	'2024-04-04 20:16:59'),
(1615,	'FOLDING CAMPING CHAIR',	'FCPC-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Folding Camping Chair, meticulously crafted with a sturdy teakwood frame and adorned with 100% dyed acrylic fabric, offering the perfect blend of durability, style, and comfort for your outdoor adventures.\r\n\r\nCrafted from high-quality teakwood, renowned for its exceptional strength and resistance to the elements, this chair ensures long-lasting reliability, making it an ideal companion for all your camping trips, picnics, beach outings, and other outdoor escapades. Teakwood\'s natural oils provide inherent protection against moisture, insects, and decay, ensuring the chair maintains its integrity even in challenging outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nThe 100% dyed acrylic fabric not only adds a splash of vibrant color but also boasts exceptional resilience against fading, mildew, and stains, ensuring your chair looks as good as new even after prolonged use. Its quick-drying properties make it perfect for beachside relaxation or unexpected rain showers, allowing you to enjoy your outdoor experience without worry.\r\n\r\nDesigned with convenience in mind, this folding camping chair effortlessly collapses for compact storage and transportation, making it a practical choice for those on the move. Whether you\'re embarking on a weekend camping trip or simply lounging in your backyard, this chair provides the perfect seating solution, combining functionality with style.\r\n\r\nWith its timeless teakwood frame, durable acrylic fabric, and effortless folding mechanism, our Folding Camping Chair offers unparalleled comfort and convenience, allowing you to relax and unwind in style wherever your adventures take you. Experience the ultimate in outdoor comfort with our premium camping chair – your perfect companion for leisurely moments under the open sky.\r\n\r\nMaterial : Teakwood \r\nFabric: 100% Acrylic Fabric',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	65,	'2024-04-04 19:20:32',	'2024-04-04 20:20:50'),
(1616,	'TAHITI OFFICE DESK',	'D02-L236',	NULL,	'Tahiti Office Desk, where functionality meets elegance. Crafted from solid wood, this desk exudes durability and timeless charm. Supported by steel legs with a bronze finishing, it strikes a balance between modern sophistication and sturdiness. Enhance your workspace with this fusion of natural allure and contemporary design, offering both style and practicality for your office needs\r\n\r\nMaterial : Solid Wood\r\nBase : Steel bronze finishing',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-04-19 15:59:14',	'2024-04-19 16:59:40'),
(1617,	'LAGUNA 1 SEATER SOFA',	'LGN-1S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Laguna 1 seater sofa designed in contemporary style, where clean lines meet minimalist design for an effortlessly chic outdoor experience. Crafted with sleek simplicity in mind, this sofa boasts a modern aesthetic that elevates any outdoor space\r\n\r\nThe frame of the Laguna sofa is constructed from premium stainless steel 304#, renowned for its exceptional strength, corrosion resistance, and longevity. This high-quality material ensures that your sofa retains its elegance and structural integrity even when exposed to the elements, making it ideal for outdoor use in any climate.\r\n\r\nWrapped in 100% dyed Acrylic fabric, the upholstery of the Laguna sofa exudes sophistication and style. Acrylic fabric is celebrated for its vibrant colors, fade resistance, and ability to withstand UV exposure, ensuring that your sofa maintains its beauty and allure over time. Whether under the bright sun or occasional rain, the Acrylic fabric remains pristine, adding a touch of luxury to your outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe seating experience is further enhanced by the inclusion of high-density foam cushions, providing plush comfort and support for relaxation and lounging. The foam retains its shape even with prolonged use, offering lasting comfort and enjoyment for you and your guests.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of stainless steel frame, Acrylic fabric upholstery, and high-density foam cushions, the Laguna 1 Seater Sofa redefines outdoor lounging, blending durability, elegance, and comfort seamlessly. Whether placed on a patio, by the poolside, or in a garden retreat, this sofa elevates your outdoor living experience to new heights.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel #304Frame\r\nFabric: 100% Solution Dyed Acrylic \r\nDim (cm): L/W75 x W79 x H65 \r\nColour: Grey',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-05-29 20:44:13',	'2024-05-29 20:58:11'),
(1618,	'LAGUNA 2 SEATER SOFA',	'LGN-2S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Laguna 2  seater sofa designed in contemporary style, where clean lines meet minimalist design for an effortlessly chic outdoor experience. Crafted with sleek simplicity in mind, this sofa boasts a modern aesthetic that elevates any outdoor space\r\n\r\nAt its core lies a robust frame crafted from premium stainless steel 304#, renowned for its exceptional strength, corrosion resistance, and longevity. This ensures that your sofa remains resilient against the elements, promising years of reliable performance and timeless elegance.\r\n\r\nWrapped in luxurious 100% dyed Acrylic fabric upholstery, the Laguna sofa boasts vibrant colors and fade-resistant properties, ensuring lasting beauty even under the sun\'s intense rays. The Acrylic fabric is not only visually striking but also highly durable, withstanding outdoor conditions with ease while maintaining its pristine appearance.\r\n\r\nComplementing the durability of the frame and upholstery is the inclusion of high-density foam cushions, offering unparalleled comfort and support. Whether lounging with a book or entertaining guests, the plush cushions provide an inviting seating experience, ensuring relaxation and enjoyment for hours on end.\r\n\r\nThe Laguna 2 Seater Sofa is designed to seamlessly integrate into any outdoor setting, whether it\'s a patio, poolside, or garden retreat. Its sleek stainless steel frame, vibrant Acrylic fabric upholstery, and plush foam cushions come together to create an oasis of comfort and style, inviting you to unwind and indulge in the beauty of outdoor living.\r\n\r\nElevate your outdoor space with the Laguna 2 Seater Sofa, where durability meets luxury for an unparalleled lounging experience.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel #304Frame\r\nFabric: 100% Solution Dyed Acrylic \r\nDim (cm): L/W150 x W79 x H65 \r\nColour: Grey',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-05-29 20:51:56',	'2024-05-30 15:08:22'),
(1619,	'LAGUNA 3 SEATER SOFA',	'LGN-3S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing our Laguna 3  seater sofa designed in contemporary style, where clean lines meet minimalist design for an effortlessly chic outdoor experience. Crafted with sleek simplicity in mind, this sofa boasts a modern aesthetic that elevates any outdoor space\r\n\r\nAt its core, the Laguna sofa features a robust frame crafted from premium stainless steel 304#. Renowned for its exceptional strength and corrosion resistance, this stainless steel frame ensures longevity and stability, even in harsh outdoor environments.\r\n\r\nWrapped in opulent 100% dyed Acrylic fabric upholstery, the Laguna sofa exudes elegance and sophistication. The Acrylic fabric not only boasts vibrant colors but also offers excellent UV resistance, ensuring that your sofa retains its beauty and vibrancy over time. Rain or shine, the Acrylic fabric upholstery maintains its allure, making it the perfect choice for outdoor lounging.\r\n\r\nTo provide the ultimate comfort experience, the Laguna sofa is outfitted with high-density foam cushions. These cushions offer plush support and relaxation, inviting you to sink in and unwind after a long day. Whether you\'re hosting gatherings or enjoying quiet moments alone, the Laguna sofa provides unparalleled comfort for all.\r\n\r\nDesigned to seamlessly integrate into any outdoor setting, the Laguna 3 Seater Sofa adds a touch of sophistication to your patio, deck, or garden area. Its sleek stainless steel frame, vibrant Acrylic fabric upholstery, and sumptuous foam cushions combine to create an inviting oasis where you can lounge in style and comfort.\r\n\r\nElevate your outdoor living experience with the Laguna 3 Seater Sofa – where durability, elegance, and comfort converge to create the ultimate outdoor sanctuary.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel #304Frame\r\nFabric: 100% Solution Dyed Acrylic \r\nDim (cm): L/W205 x W79 x H65 \r\nColour: Grey',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-05-29 21:01:05',	'2024-05-30 15:09:20'),
(1620,	'SIESTA 1 SEATER SOFA',	'STA-1S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the SIESTA 1 SEATER SOFA, a premium outdoor seating solution blending durability with contemporary design. Crafted with a robust stainless steel frame, grade 304#, this sofa ensures long-lasting stability in various weather conditions.\r\n\r\nEnhancing both comfort and style, the SIESTA 1 SEATER features weaving sunproof olefin webbing. This innovative material not only withstands the elements but also provides a luxurious feel, making it an ideal choice for outdoor lounging areas. Whether it\'s soaking up the sun or enjoying a cozy evening under the stars, this sofa promises relaxation without compromising on aesthetics.\r\n\r\nElevate your outdoor space with the SIESTA 1 SEATER SOFA and indulge in ultimate comfort and sophistication.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel #304Frame\r\nWeaving: Sunproof Olefin Webbing\r\nDim (cm): L/W72 x W79 x H65 \r\nColour: Grey',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-05-30 14:22:39',	'2024-05-30 14:41:46'),
(1621,	'SIESTA 2 SEATER SOFA',	'STA-2S-STD',	NULL,	'Introducing the SIESTA 2 SEATER SOFA, a testament to both durability and style for your outdoor oasis. Crafted with a sturdy stainless steel frame (grade 304#), this sofa ensures stability and resilience against outdoor elements, promising years of reliable use.\r\n\r\nDesigned for relaxation and sophistication, the SIESTA 2 SEATER features weaving sunproof olefin webbing. This advanced material not only withstands sun exposure and weather fluctuations but also offers a luxurious feel, enhancing your outdoor lounging experience.\r\n\r\nWhether hosting gatherings or enjoying quiet moments, the SIESTA 2 SEATER SOFA provides the perfect blend of comfort and durability, elevating your outdoor living space with timeless elegance and enduring quality.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Stainless Steel #304Frame\r\nWeaving: Sunproof Olefin Webbing\r\nDim (cm): L/W137 x W79 x H65 \r\nColour: Grey',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-05-30 14:58:54',	'2024-05-30 15:01:43'),
