(1630,	'RIO TABLETOP D120',	'RTT-D120',	NULL,	'The Rio table top D120 made of phenolic material is a versatile and durable dining surface. With a diameter of 120 centimeters, this circular tabletop offers ample space for dining and socializing.\r\nPhenolic resin is chosen for its toughness, moisture resistance, and ease of maintenance, making it an ideal material for everyday use. The Rio D120 table top showcases a modern design with a smooth finish, available in various colors to suit different decor styles.\r\nThis phenolic table top is highly resistant to scratches, stains, and heat, ensuring longevity and easy upkeep. Its lightweight construction adds to its practicality, allowing for easy movement and placement within dining areas.\r\nIn summary, the Rio tabletop D120 made of phenolic material combines functionality with contemporary aesthetics, providing a durable and stylish centerpiece for dining spaces. \r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nD120cm xTH12mm',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-05-31 01:34:17',	'2024-05-31 01:35:23'),
