(1639,	'EIFFEL BAR CHAIR PLUS',	'EC102-BL-ARM',	NULL,	'The Eiffel Bar Chair is a sophisticated and stylish seating option that combines the durability of SST 303# stainless steel with the elegance of teakwood armrests. This high-quality bar chair features a frame crafted from SST 303#, a premium stainless steel known for its exceptional resistance to corrosion and wear, ensuring both longevity and a sleek, modern appearance.\r\n\r\nThe seat and backrest are made from Batyline, a high-performance material renowned for its excellent UV resistance, flexibility, and comfort. Batyline is also easy to clean and maintain, making it an ideal choice for both indoor and outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nAdding to the chair\'s luxurious design, the armrests are crafted from teakwood, a prized hardwood known for its rich color, smooth texture, and natural oils that make it resistant to water and decay. The combination of teakwood armrests with the stainless steel frame and Batyline seating creates a harmonious blend of materials that exudes both modern sophistication and timeless elegance.\r\n\r\nThe Eiffel Bar Chair is not only aesthetically pleasing but also designed with ergonomics in mind, providing comfortable support for extended periods. Its robust construction and premium materials make it a perfect choice for upscale bars, restaurants, and residential spaces looking to enhance their décor with a touch of refined luxury.\r\n\r\nMaterial : Stainless Steel\r\nArm : Teakwood\r\nSeat : French Batyline\r\nDim(cm) : W48 xD43 x H105   SH75\r\nColor : Black',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2024-05-31 15:09:26',	'2024-05-31 15:11:14'),
(1640,	'SERENE DINING CHAIR',	'SRN-DRC-AM1',	NULL,	'The Serene Dining Chair is a stylish, comfortable seating option to enhance any dining space. This chair has a sleek, modern silhouette and combines elegant curves with clean lines, making it a versatile addition to various interior decor styles. The chair is constructed with a sturdy frame, often made from high-quality wood or metal, ensuring durability and stability. Upholstered in premium fabric or leather, the Serene Dining Chair offers a plush seating experience, with ergonomic back support and cushioning that promotes meal relaxation. Its refined design and attention to detail make it ideal for casual and formal dining.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\n\r\nW48 x D53 x H78 x SH45 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2024-06-01 19:31:30',	'2024-06-01 19:32:17'),
(1641,	'VILAD DINING CHAIR',	'VDC-BL-RW',	NULL,	'The Vilad Dining Chair is a contemporary and sophisticated seating solution, perfect for modern dining spaces. Its design blends clean, angular lines and soft, inviting curves, creating a balanced and stylish aesthetic. The chair is crafted with a robust frame, typically made from high-quality wood or metal, providing excellent stability and longevity. Upholstered in premium fabric or leather, the Vilad Dining Chair offers a comfortable seating experience with ample padding and ergonomic support. Its sleek and elegant design and meticulous craftsmanship make it an excellent addition to everyday meals and special occasions.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\n\r\nW59 x D54 xH75 x SH45 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2024-06-01 19:33:51',	'2024-06-01 20:34:05'),
(1642,	'TOKYO DINING CHAIR',	'HDC72-NAT-WS',	NULL,	'Introducing the Tokyo Dining Chair, a timeless and sophisticated piece of furniture meticulously crafted from full premium teak wood. Renowned for its natural beauty, durability, and weather-resistant properties, teak wood is the perfect material choice for creating elegant and long-lasting pieces of furniture.\r\nThe Tokyo Dining Chair epitomizes understated luxury with its clean lines, minimalist design, and unparalleled craftsmanship. Each chair is expertly crafted to showcase the innate beauty of teak wood, with its rich golden-brown hue and distinctive grain patterns, ensuring that every piece is unique and visually striking.\r\nBeyond its aesthetic appeal, the Tokyo Dining Chair is engineered for comfort and functionality. The ergonomic design provides excellent lumbar support, allowing for hours of comfortable seating during leisurely meals or lively gatherings. The slightly curved backrest and contoured seat offer a superior seating experience, enhancing relaxation and enjoyment.\r\nMoreover, teak wood’s natural oils and high resin content make the Tokyo Dining Chair inherently resistant to moisture, rot, pests, and harsh outdoor elements, making it suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. Whether placed in a chic dining room, a cozy kitchen nook, or an alfresco dining area, this chair effortlessly blends style with durability.\r\nThe Tokyo Dining Chair is not just a piece of furniture; it’s an investment in quality and craftsmanship that will withstand the test of time, becoming a cherished addition to any space. With its timeless design and premium materials, the Tokyo Dining Chair is sure to elevate the dining experience and leave a lasting impression on discerning individuals who appreciate the fine craftsmanship and elegant design.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W51 x D54 x H73 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	62,	'2024-06-01 19:41:36',	'2024-06-01 19:42:16'),
(1643,	'KOORG PIZZA TRAY',	'KRG-PZT-D25',	NULL,	'The Koorg Pizza Tray is a must-have for pizza lovers, offering a combination of style and functionality. Crafted with durable materials, this tray ensures even cooking and easy serving. Its innovative design features perforations for optimal airflow, resulting in a perfectly crisp crust every time. Whether you’re baking homemade pizzas or reheating leftovers, the Koorg Pizza Tray guarantees delicious results. Enjoy your favorite pizzas with family and friends with this essential kitchen accessory.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL35 xD25x H2 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2024-06-01 19:45:14',	'2024-06-01 19:45:49'),
(1644,	'KOORG SERVING TRAY L',	'CT07-NAT-L',	NULL,	'The Koorg Serving Tray is crafted from premium teak wood, boasting a natural finish free from harmful chemicals. Its organic design ensures the safety of your food and health, offering a stylish and safe way to serve your favorite dishes.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W36 x D25x H1 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2024-06-01 19:52:36',	'2024-06-01 19:56:07'),
