(1659,	'RITZ BOOTH SOFA L120',	'RTZ-BTS-L120',	NULL,	'Introducing the RITZ BOOTH SOFA, a pinnacle of sophistication and comfort in furniture design. Crafted with meticulous attention to detail, this exquisite piece seamlessly blends elegance with durability to elevate any living or office space.\r\nAt its core lies a solid wood frame, meticulously constructed to provide unparalleled stability and longevity. This ensures that the RITZ BOOTH SOFA not only exudes luxury but also boasts remarkable resilience against daily wear and tear, promising years of unwavering support and comfort.\r\nThe sofa seat is upholstered with premium PU leather, meticulously selected for its sumptuous texture and luxurious appearance. PU leather offers the timeless charm of genuine leather while being more resistant to scratches, spills, and stains, making maintenance a breeze. Its sleek finish adds a touch of sophistication to any setting, while its soft, supple feel invites you to sink in and relax after a long day.\r\nDesigned with style and functionality, the RITZ BOOTH SOFA features a spacious seating area, perfect for lounging or entertaining guests. Its refined silhouette and contemporary lines exude modern elegance, effortlessly complementing a variety of interior aesthetics.\r\nWhether used as a statement piece in a formal living room, a cozy addition to a home theater, or a chic seating option in a corporate lounge, the RITZ BOOTH SOFA will leave a lasting impression. Elevate your space with luxury and comfort with this exceptional piece of furniture.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W120 x D60 x H80 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	76,	'2024-06-01 22:42:46',	'2024-06-01 22:43:37'),
