(1661,	'ATHENS OFFICE CHAIR',	'AOC-TB-STD',	NULL,	'The Athens office chair combines elegance with ergonomic design, making it ideal for professional workspaces and home offices. Its sleek, modern appearance is complemented by thoughtful features that prioritize comfort and functionality.\r\nThe Athens chair boasts a contoured seat and high backrest, providing excellent lumbar support to promote good posture during long hours of sitting. Adjustable height and tilt mechanisms allow for personalized positioning, catering to individual preferences and ensuring optimal comfort.\r\nCrafted from premium materials such as durable upholstery and a sturdy base, the Athens chair not only exudes sophistication but also promises durability and longevity. Its smooth rolling casters enable effortless mobility, allowing users to move around their workspace with ease.\r\nWhether used in a corporate setting or a home office environment, the Athens office chair blends style and practicality seamlessly, enhancing productivity and creating a welcoming atmosphere for work\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL59 x W50 CM\r\nHeight: Adjustable',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-01 22:58:18',	'2024-06-01 23:58:32'),
