(1664,	'WALL PANEL D5x2.5',	'WP-D5',	NULL,	'Wall Paneling: A modern and sustainable solution for interior design.\r\nTransform your space with the natural beauty and durability of plywood.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nL30 x H240 xT2.8 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-01 23:27:28',	'2024-06-01 23:29:32'),
(1665,	'TRIPOLITANIA LEFT CORNER SOFA',	'TPN-LC-STD',	NULL,	'The Tripolitania Left Corner Sofa epitomizes modern comfort and style, ideal for enhancing any contemporary living space.  The left-corner orientation allows for seamless integration into various room layouts, optimizing space while providing ample seating.\r\n\r\nCrafted with both aesthetics and comfort in mind, the Tripolitania Left Corner Sofa boasts plush cushions and premium upholstery, ensuring a luxurious lounging experience. The deep seats and supportive backrests offer exceptional comfort, making it perfect for relaxation, social gatherings, or everyday use.\r\n\r\nVersatility is a key feature of the Tripolitania Left Corner Sofa. Its modular design allows for flexibility in arrangement, making it easy to adapt to different room configurations or design preferences. Whether used as a centerpiece in a spacious living room or as a stylish addition to a cozy den, this sofa effortlessly blends functionality with style.\r\n\r\nAvailable in a range of colors, fabrics, and finishes, the Tripolitania Left Corner Sofa can be customized to suit individual tastes and complement existing decor. Whether you prefer a neutral palette for a minimalist look or a bold hue to make a statement, this sofa offers endless possibilities for personalization.\r\n\r\nOverall, the Tripolitania Left Corner Sofa is a versatile and elegant furniture piece that combines contemporary design with unparalleled comfort, making it a must-have for any modern home.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W 80x D 80x H 76 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:34:17',	'2024-06-01 23:35:05'),
(1666,	'TRIPOLITANIA MIDDLE SOFA',	'TPN-MDL-STD',	NULL,	'Tripolitania Middle Sofa is a contemporary furniture piece that epitomizes sophistication and comfort. Crafted with premium materials and meticulous attention to detail, this sofa seamlessly blends elegance with functionality. The Tripolitania Middle Sofa features a sleek design characterized by clean lines and a tailored silhouette, making it a versatile addition to any modern living space.\r\n\r\nThe sofa’s construction includes a sturdy frame that ensures durability and stability, while plush cushions provide exceptional comfort and support. Upholstered in luxurious fabric or leather, the Tripolitania Middle Sofa is available in a range of colors and finishes to suit various interior aesthetics.\r\n\r\nWith its timeless appeal and ergonomic design, the Tripolitania Middle Sofa invites relaxation and style, making it a standout piece for lounging and entertaining. Whether placed in a living room, office, or lounge area, this sofa embodies understated luxury and enhances the ambiance of any setting.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W65x D80x H76 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:38:17',	'2024-06-01 23:38:56'),
(1667,	'TRIPOLITANIA OTTOMAN',	'TPN-OTM-STD',	NULL,	'The Tripolitania Ottoman is a chic and versatile accent piece designed to complement contemporary interiors. Featuring a sleek and minimalist silhouette, this ottoman embodies both style and functionality. Its clean lines and understated elegance make it an ideal addition to any living room, bedroom, or lounge area.\r\nCrafted with a sturdy frame and upholstered in premium fabric or leather, the Tripolitania Ottoman offers a comfortable seating or footrest option. Its compact size makes it perfect for smaller spaces, while still providing a practical and stylish solution for extra seating or as a decorative element.\r\nAvailable in a variety of colors and finishes to match different decor schemes, the Tripolitania Ottoman adds a touch of sophistication to any room. Whether used as a standalone piece or paired with other furniture, this ottoman combines modern design with versatility, enhancing the overall ambiance of the space.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W65 x D80 x H76 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:41:13',	'2024-06-01 23:41:53'),
(1668,	'TRIPOLITANIA RIGHT CORNER SOFA',	'TPN-RC-STD',	NULL,	'The Tripolitania Right-Corner Sofa is a stylish and versatile piece of furniture designed for modern living spaces. Its defining feature is its unique L-shaped configuration, which includes a longer section that extends along one wall and a shorter section that runs perpendicular, forming a right angle. This sofa is crafted with comfort in mind, featuring plush cushions and soft upholstery that invites relaxation. The Tripolitania Right-Corner Sofa is not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing, with a contemporary design that complements various interior styles, from minimalist to eclectic.The right-corner design makes efficient use of space, allowing for ample seating without overcrowding the room. It can be a focal point in a living room, providing a cozy and inviting area for lounging, entertaining guests, or simply unwinding after a long day. Available in a range of colors and fabrics, the Tripolitania Right-Corner Sofa can be customized to suit individual preferences and match existing decor. Its durable construction ensures longevity, making it a practical investment for any home. Overall, this sofa combines form and function, offering both comfort and style for modern living environments.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W80 x D80 x H76 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:43:49',	'2024-06-01 23:44:51'),
(1669,	'TRIPOLITANIA 2PC SECTIONAL SOFA ',	'TPN-2PC-SC-STD',	NULL,	'The Tripolitania 2PC sectional sofa is a modern and stylish furniture piece designed for comfort and versatility. It typically features a sleek, contemporary design with clean lines and often includes plush cushions for added comfort. The sectional configuration allows for flexibility in arranging the pieces to suit different living spaces. The Tripolitania sectional is often crafted with quality materials, such as durable upholstery fabrics and sturdy frames, ensuring both aesthetic appeal and longevity. This type of sectional sofa is ideal for creating a cozy and inviting seating area in your home while adding a touch of sophistication to your decor.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nTRIPOLITANIA 2 SEATER SECTION \r\nL/W145x D80x H76 CM\r\nTRIPOLITANIA CHAISE\r\nL/W160x D81x H77 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:52:01',	'2024-06-01 23:52:49'),
(1670,	'TRIPOLITANIA 3PC SECTIONAL SOFA ',	'TPN-3PC-SC-STD',	NULL,	'The Tripolitania 3PC sectional sofa is a modern and stylish furniture piece designed for comfort and versatility. It typically features a sleek, contemporary design with clean lines and often includes plush cushions for added comfort. The sectional configuration allows for flexibility in arranging the pieces to suit different living spaces. The Tripolitania sectional is often crafted with quality materials, such as durable upholstery fabrics and sturdy frames, ensuring both aesthetic appeal and longevity. This type of sectional sofa is ideal for creating a cozy and inviting seating area in your home while adding a touch of sophistication to your decor.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nTRIPOLITANIA 2 SEATER SECTION \r\nL/W145x D80x H76 CM\r\nTRIPOLITANIA RIGHT CORNER\r\nL/W80x D80x H76 CM\r\n',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-01 23:55:59',	'2024-06-01 23:58:17'),
(1671,	'MARINA SOFA 2 SEATER',	'MRS-C165-2ST',	NULL,	'Indulge in the ultimate luxury comfort with this stunning sofa, crafted with a sturdy Teak wood base, Olefin rope weaving over an aluminium frame and hardware made from stainless steel for tough weather. The sleek and elegant design is perfect for Hotels, resorts, and Porsche homes, providing a resort-style living experience. The Olefin rope weaving adds a unique touch of style to the sofa, while the aluminium frame ensures durability and stability. Whether you\'re lounging by the pool or enjoying a sunset view, this sofa is sure to impress with its great aesthetics and unbeatable comfort. Upgrade your living space with this exceptional piece of furniture and experience the ultimate in luxury living.\r\n\r\nBase : Solid Teak Wood\r\nFrame : Aluminium\r\nWeaving : Round Knitted Texteline/OlefinRope\r\nDim (cm):L/W156 x D90 x H88 ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-06-03 21:02:49',	'2024-06-03 21:04:24'),
(1672,	'CALENDER HOLDER ',	'CH-TB-STD',	NULL,	'A calendar holder is a decorative or functional item designed to hold and display calendars. These holders come in various styles and materials, including wood, metal, or acrylic. They typically feature a clip or ring mechanism to secure the calendar pages in place, allowing for easy flipping to the current month. Calendar holders often incorporate additional design elements such as hooks for keys, storage compartments, or decorative motifs that complement different interior styles. They serve as a practical organizational tool and as a decorative accent for homes or offices.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W27x D21 x T2 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-08 19:04:45',	'2024-06-08 19:06:07'),
(1673,	'KASHMIR CONFERENCE TABLE ',	'KCT-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'The Kashmir Conference Table is a luxurious, sophisticated centerpiece for upscale meeting rooms and executive spaces. Known for its elegant craftsmanship and attention to detail, the Kashmir Conference Table exudes a sense of refinement and prestige.\r\nCrafted from high-quality materials such as rich hardwoods or premium veneers, the Kashmir Conference Table features a distinctive design that often incorporates ornate detailing or polished finishes. This attention to aesthetics elevates the table\'s visual appeal, making it a focal point in any professional setting.\r\nThe Kashmir Conference Table is available in various sizes and shapes, catering to different meeting room layouts and seating capacities. It offers ample space for large groups to gather comfortably, facilitating collaborative discussions and presentations.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\n L/W180 x D120 x H75  CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-11 23:53:44',	'2024-06-11 23:54:56'),
(1674,	' MEHFIL DESK',	'MD-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'The Mehfil Desk is a stylish and functional addition to any workspace or home office. Its design blends contemporary aesthetics with practical features, making it an excellent choice for those seeking both beauty and utility.\r\nCrafted from high-quality materials such as Saur wood, metal accents, or composite materials, the Mehfil Desk offers durability and a sophisticated look. Its sleek lines and minimalist silhouette contribute to a modern yet timeless appeal, suitable for various interior styles.\r\nThe Mehfil Desk is designed with functionality in mind, featuring ample surface space for working, studying, or organizing paperwork and devices. \r\nWhether placed in a professional office setting or a cozy home workspace, the Mehfil Desk enhances productivity and complements the overall decor with its understated elegance and practical design.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W120 x D60 x H75 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-12 00:20:10',	'2024-06-12 00:21:09'),
(1675,	'WINDSOR WRITING DESK ',	'WRD-SW-STD',	NULL,	'The Windsor Writing Desk is a classic and versatile piece of furniture that combines timeless design with practical functionality. Characterized by its traditional aesthetic and quality craftsmanship, this desk is an excellent choice for both professional offices and home workspaces.\r\nCrafted from Solid wood, the Windsor Writing Desk showcases elegant details such as turned legs, graceful curves, and a smooth finish. These elements give the desk a sophisticated and refined appearance, making it a standout piece in any room.\r\nThe desk provides a spacious and uncluttered work surface, ideal for writing, typing, or engaging in creative projects. It often features convenient storage options like drawers or compartments to keep supplies and documents organized and easily accessible.\r\nWith its classic charm and sturdy construction, the Windsor Writing Desk not only serves as a functional workstation but also adds a touch of elegance to its surroundings. Whether used as a focal point in a study or as a practical desk in a bedroom, this desk combines beauty and utility seamlessly.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL/W150 x D70 x H75 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	81,	'2024-06-12 00:26:13',	'2024-06-12 00:27:04'),
(1676,	'DESARU COFFEE TABLE',	'OSD82-CF-GB',	NULL,	'The Desaru Coffee Table is a versatile and stylish addition to any space, featuring a sturdy aluminum frame that ensures both strength and lightweight durability. This frame is artfully wrapped in synthetic wicker, providing the natural aesthetic of wicker with enhanced weather resistance and easy maintenance.\r\n\r\nThe table\'s top is intricately woven with the same synthetic wicker, creating a textured and visually appealing surface. Over this woven top, a layer of tempered glass is placed, offering a smooth and sleek finish that is durable and resistant to scratches. The tempered glass not only adds elegance but also protects the woven surface beneath, ensuring longevity and practicality.\r\n\r\nPerfect for both indoor and outdoor settings, the Desaru Coffee Table seamlessly combines modern design with high-quality materials, making it a functional and attractive piece for any decor.\r\n\r\nMaterial : VIRO/REHAU fiber\r\nFrame : Aluminium\r\nDim (cm) : L110xW70xH45\r\nColor : Graphite Black',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	78,	'2024-06-12 20:07:34',	'2024-06-12 20:09:13'),
(1677,	'LOMBOK SINGLE SEATER SOFA',	'LBK-1S-STD',	NULL,	'Elevate your outdoor living space with the Lombok single Seater Sofa, a perfect blend of style and durability. Crafted with an aluminum frame that is powder-coated for enhanced weather resistance, this sofa ensures long-lasting performance and elegance. The weaving is done with premium Olefin rope, known for its exceptional strength and resistance to UV rays and moisture, making it ideal for outdoor settings.\r\n\r\nWhether you place it on your patio, garden, or poolside, the Lombok 1 Seater Sofa offers both comfort and sophistication, providing a cozy spot to relax and unwind. Its sleek design and high-quality materials make it a standout piece that seamlessly complements any outdoor decor. Enjoy the perfect combination of modern design and robust construction with the Lombok 1 Seater Sofa.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Aluminium Frame     \r\nWeaving: Olefin Rope   \r\nDim (cm):  L/W82 x D80 x H80',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-06-22 20:29:45',	'2024-06-22 20:30:44'),
(1678,	'LOMBOK 3 SEATER SOFA',	'LBK-3S-STD',	NULL,	'Transform your outdoor space with the Lombok 3 Seater Sofa, a perfect combination of contemporary design and durability. This elegant sofa features a robust aluminum frame that is powder-coated to withstand the elements, ensuring longevity and stability. The sofa is beautifully adorned with premium Olefin rope weaving, renowned for its superior strength and resistance to UV rays and moisture, making it ideal for outdoor use.\r\n\r\nThe Lombok 3 Seater Sofa offers ample seating for friends and family, providing both comfort and style. Its modern aesthetics seamlessly blend with any outdoor decor, creating a sophisticated ambiance in your patio, garden, or poolside area. Experience the ultimate in outdoor relaxation and luxury with the Lombok 3 Seater Sofa, where quality craftsmanship meets exquisite design.\r\n\r\nMaterial: Aluminium Frame\r\nWeaving: Olefin Rope\r\nDim (cm):  L/W240 x D80 x H80 ',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	68,	'2024-06-22 20:32:56',	'2024-06-22 20:33:52'),
(1679,	'RITZ MARBLETOP D60',	'RDT10-MB-D60',	NULL,	'Quartz Marble Top available with a variety of table bases. The Ritz top is ideal for restaurants and bars due to its high resistance to stains and scratches. It is compressed to a great extent to minimize chipping on edges. Ritz top is available in a variety of colors and patterns. Thanks to the curved edges it increases safety. The suitable bases are square, round, cross, Rocket, or cast iron. The price listed is for the tabletop only.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nD60 x H78 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-06-25 18:53:23',	'2024-06-25 18:54:16'),
(1680,	'RITZ MARBLETOP D70',	'RDT10-MB-D70',	NULL,	'Quartz Marble Top available with a variety of table bases. The Ritz top is ideal for restaurants and bars due to its high resistance to stains and scratches. It is compressed to a great extent to minimize chipping on edges. Ritz top is available in a variety of colors and patterns. Thanks to the curved edges to increases safety. The suitable bases are square, round, cross or Rocket base or cast iron base. The price listed is for the tabletop only.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nD70 x H78 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-06-25 19:07:16',	'2024-06-25 19:07:49'),
(1681,	'RITZ MARBLETOP D80',	'RDT10-MB-D80',	NULL,	'Quartz Marble Top available with variety of table bases. The Ritz top is ideal for restaurants and bars due to its high resistance to staines and scratches. It is compressed to a great extent to minimise chipping on edges. Ritz top is available in variety of colors and paterns. Thanks to the curved edges to increase safety. The suitable bases are square, round, cross or Rocket base or cast iron base. Price listed is for table top only.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nD80 x H78',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-06-25 19:23:47',	'2024-06-25 19:26:09'),
(1682,	'RITZ MARBLETOP D90',	'RDT10-MB-D90',	NULL,	'Quartz Marble Top available with a variety of table bases. The Ritz top is ideal for restaurants and bars due to its high resistance to stains and scratches. It is compressed to a great extent to minimize chipping on edges. Ritz top is available in a variety of colors and patterns. Thanks to the curved edges it increases safety. The suitable bases are square, round, cross or Rocket base or cast iron base. The price listed is for the tabletop only.\r\nDIMENSIONS\r\n D90 x H78 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	95,	'2024-06-25 19:29:36',	'2024-06-25 19:30:21'),
(1683,	'CONCORDE PEDICURE CHAIR',	'HDC02-TB-STD',	NULL,	'The CONCORDE PEDICURE CHAIR is a luxurious and innovative piece of salon furniture designed to provide the ultimate relaxation and pampering experience during pedicure treatments. Crafted with a blend of modern aesthetics and advanced functionality, the Concorde Pedicure Chair features plush cushioning, ergonomic design, and customizable massage settings. Its sleek and contemporary appearance is complemented by a state-of-the-art hydrotherapy system, which incorporates soothing water jets to invigorate and massage the feet. The chair’s adjustable settings allow both the client and the technician to find the perfect comfort level, while its high-quality materials ensure durability and easy maintenance. Elevating the pedicure experience to new heights, the CONCORDE PEDICURE CHAIR promises a blend of luxury, relaxation, and top-notch performance for both salon professionals and their clients.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nL 113 x W 91 x H 97 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	30,	'2024-06-25 19:51:26',	'2024-06-25 19:51:52'),
(1684,	'MADRID SIDEBOARD L150',	'MSB150-NAT-STD',	NULL,	'Made from teak wood. Storage cabinet with compartment and give the sideboard a streamlined look.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nL 150 x W 45 x H 80 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	7,	80,	'2024-06-25 20:06:28',	'2024-06-25 20:06:44'),
(1685,	'KAIZEN BAR TABLE L180',	'KIZ-BRT-L180',	NULL,	'The Kaizen bar table is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed for use in bars, restaurants, or even home entertainment areas. It features a combination of solid wood for the top and mild steel for the base, resulting in a contemporary and industrial aesthetic. The tabletop is crafted from high-quality solid wood, which provides durability and natural beauty. The type of wood used can vary, but popular choices include oak, walnut, or reclaimed wood, each offering its unique grain pattern and color variations. The solid wood construction ensures a sturdy and reliable surface that can withstand regular use. The base of the Kaizen bar table is constructed using mild steel. Mild steel is a strong and durable material that is often chosen for its industrial look and ability to support heavy loads. It offers stability and longevity to the table, ensuring it remains steady and secure. The design of the Kaizen bar table typically incorporates clean lines and a minimalist aesthetic. The combination of solid wood and mild steel creates a striking contrast between the warm, natural tones of the wood and the cool, metallic finish of the steel base. This blend of materials gives the table a modern and versatile appearance that can complement various interior styles, from rustic to contemporary.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION\r\nW180 x D40 x H106 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2024-06-26 00:48:32',	'2024-06-26 00:48:57'),
(1686,	'KAIZEN BAR TABLE L150',	'KIZ-BRT-L150',	NULL,	'The Kaizen bar table is a stylish and functional piece of furniture designed for use in bars, restaurants, or even home entertainment areas. It features a combination of solid wood for the top and mild steel for the base, resulting in a contemporary and industrial aesthetic. The tabletop is crafted from high-quality solid wood, which provides durability and natural beauty. The type of wood used can vary, but popular choices include oak, walnut, or reclaimed wood, each offering its unique grain pattern and color variations. The solid wood construction ensures a sturdy and reliable surface that can withstand regular use. The base of the Kaizen bar table is constructed using mild steel. Mild steel is a strong and durable material that is often chosen for its industrial look and ability to support heavy loads. It offers stability and longevity to the table, ensuring it remains steady and secure. The design of the Kaizen bar table typically incorporates clean lines and a minimalist aesthetic. The combination of solid wood and mild steel creates a striking contrast between the warm, natural tones of the wood and the cool, metallic finish of the steel base. This blend of materials gives the table a modern and versatile appearance that can complement various interior styles, from rustic to contemporary.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION\r\nW150 x D40 x H106',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	63,	'2024-06-26 00:51:32',	'2024-06-26 00:52:04'),
(1687,	'DESARU DOUBLE SUN LOUNGER',	'SL82-SR-DOUBLE',	NULL,	'The DESARU Double Sun Lounger is perfect for relaxing outdoors with someone special. It has a sturdy yet lightweight frame made from powder-coated aluminium, so it won\'t rust or corrode, even if left outside in different weather conditions. The lounger is covered in synthetic rattan that looks just like natural rattan but is much more durable and easy to care for. You can adjust the backrests to find the perfect angle for sunbathing, reading, or napping. Its stylish design fits well in any garden, patio, or pool area, and because it\'s lightweight, you can easily move it around to catch the sun. Plus, a quick wipe-down is all it takes to keep it looking great.\r\n\r\nMaterial : Frame: PC Aluminium \r\nWeaving:syntethic Rattan\r\nDim (cm):199 X 139 X 29',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	67,	'2024-06-26 16:28:05',	'2024-06-26 16:34:09'),
(1688,	'PUBLIKA BAR STOOL',	'HBC22-MS-STD',	NULL,	'A mild steel bar stool with an upholstered cushion that is fixed in place. The strength and resiliency of mild steel produce stunning designs and high-performance furniture. Perfect for use in a residential or commercial setting. Highly durable, long-lasting, and low-maintenance furniture. You can choose from a variety of colors for the cushion.\r\n\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\n\r\nL40x W40x H75 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	61,	'2024-07-02 19:38:55',	'2024-07-02 19:55:36'),
(1689,	'DOUBLE GRANITE UMBRELLA BASE',	'GRN-DUSTN-D60',	NULL,	'The Double Granite Umbrella Base is a sturdy and durable support designed to securely hold outdoor umbrellas. Made from high-quality granite, this base offers exceptional stability and resistance to the elements. Its double design allows for the attachment of two umbrellas, making it ideal for larger patio areas or commercial settings such as cafes and restaurants. The sleek, polished finish adds a touch of elegance while ensuring long-lasting performance. With easy-to-use adjustment knobs, the Double Granite Umbrella Base provides reliable support and flexibility for various umbrella sizes and styles.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL60 x D60 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	83,	'2024-07-03 22:36:06',	'2024-07-03 23:36:23'),
(1690,	'TIARA UMBRELLA STAND',	'TAR-USTN-S50',	NULL,	'TIARA Umbrella Stand combines Teak Wood with stainless steel to make an extremely sturdy and durable umbrella stand.\r\nPerfect for heavy-duty umbrella use in residential or commercial beaches and swimming pools. Highly durable, long-lasting, and low-maintenance.\r\n\r\nDIMENSION:\r\nL 50 x D 50 x H 40 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	41,	83,	'2024-07-03 22:40:45',	'2024-07-03 22:41:08'),
(1691,	'ACCURA ROUND BAR BASE D55',	'SS-D55-102',	NULL,	'The base is made of 8mm thick corrosion resistant stainless steel grade 304 plate. The thick stainless steel base plate ensures stability.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nD55xH102.5 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	14,	'2024-07-06 23:54:15',	'2024-07-06 23:54:43'),
(1692,	'ACCURA CROSS DINING BASE L60',	'SS-CROSS60-72',	NULL,	'The base is made of thick corrosion resistant stainless steel cross prong.\r\nDIMENSIONS:\r\nL60 x D60 x H72.5 CM',	NULL,	'',	NULL,	9999,	NULL,	'1',	0,	0,	12,	14,	'2024-07-07 00:10:13',	'2024-07-07 00:10:37');
